WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Support us and become VIP member 
to remove all ads from www.OpenSubtitles.org

2
00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:24.770
[popping]

3
00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.460
[soft rustling]

4
00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:01.260
[KAGAYA]
Within the next five days.

5
00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.980
Muzan will come.

6
00:01:09.310 --> 00:01:12.110
I will be the bait you use.

7
00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:15.780
When he comes.
I need you to behead him.

8
00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:23.250
Master. what leads you
to believe he'll find you?

9
00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.210
[Kagaya chuckles weakly]

10
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.960
My intuition. That's all.

11
00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:31.460
Nothing beyond that.

12
00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:35.010
But listen.
the others can't know.

13
00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:40.220
They would never agree
to using me as bait like this.

14
00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.600
They would sooner die
than do it.

15
00:01:43.390 --> 00:01:47.640
You're the only one
that I can ask. Gyomei.

16
00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:53.530
Even if you behead him.
he won't die.

17
00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:59.200
There's likely only one way
to destroy Muzan.

18
00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:02.830
Trapping him in place
until sunlight shines upon him.

19
00:02:03.620 --> 00:02:06.410
If beheading isn't enough
to kill him.

20
00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:08.500
there's only one option left.

21
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.250
You all must endure a battle
until the sun rises.

22
00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:15.550
Yes. sir.

23
00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:19.840
If that is your wish.
then so be it. Master.

24
00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.100
[KAGAYA] Thank goodness.

25
00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:34.360
Gyomei. after I have perished.

26
00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:37.740
please do not let
any more of my children

27
00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.280
be sent to their graves.

28
00:02:40.030 --> 00:02:42.200
That is my wish.

29
00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:59.470
[♪ tense music playing]

30
00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:01.760
[MUZAN] You think
you've driven me into a corner

31
00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:03.180
with your little plan?

32
00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:08.560
But you are all about to be
going straight to hell!

33
00:03:08.600 --> 00:03:10.730
Mark my words. Demon Slayers.

34
00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:14.400
I'll massacre every one of you
before sunrise!

35
00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.690
[grunts angrily]

36
00:03:15.730 --> 00:03:17.280
[Nakime plucking biwa strings]

37
00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:21.240
You're the only one
going to hell!

38
00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.990
And you won't get away!

39
00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:26.080
Oh. is that so?

40
00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.200
Let's see you try.

41
00:03:28.580 --> 00:03:31.170
Tanjiro Kamado!

42
00:03:31.210 --> 00:03:32.830
[rumbling]

43
00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.250
I will defeat you!

44
00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:38.760
Muzan Kibutsuji!

45
00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:43.970
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA
THE MOVIE: INFINITY CASTLE

46
00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.680
[♪ opening theme song playing]

47
00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:52.690
What is this place?

48
00:03:53.310 --> 00:03:55.310
Everything's upside down.

49
00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:57.520
KILL

50
00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.400
Was all of this made using
the enemy's Blood Demon Art?

51
00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:05.200
I don't understand
what's happening.

52
00:04:05.240 --> 00:04:08.240
except that Ms. Tamayo
was restraining Muzan.

53
00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:12.710
Even so. how long
can she keep that up?

54
00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.250
[screaming]

55
00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.000
[IGURO] Calm down. Kanroji.

56
00:04:17.460 --> 00:04:18.750
[gasps] Yes!

57
00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:20.760
[IGURO] Stay with me.

58
00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:34.270
[gasps]

59
00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.780
[Gyomei grunts]

60
00:04:54.040 --> 00:04:55.500
[effort grunts]

61
00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.170
[effort grunts]

62
00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:18.270
[TANJIRO] I need to reach Muzan
as soon as possible

63
00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.320
and defeat him
by whatever means!

64
00:05:25.110 --> 00:05:26.910
[grunts]

65
00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:29.830
[♪ Gregorian chanting]

66
00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:31.410
That's the bottom!

67
00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:33.290
I'll be killed at this speed!

68
00:05:33.750 --> 00:05:35.540
I'll use a move
to change directions.

69
00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:37.750
Then find something
to grab on to.

70
00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:39.000
DESTROY

71
00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.590
[♪ music intensifies]

72
00:05:41.460 --> 00:05:45.220
It didn't work. I can't
break away from this free fall.

73
00:05:48.430 --> 00:05:49.470
DESTROYER OF DEMONS

74
00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.860
[♪ low tense music playing]

75
00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:19.830
[♪ music fades]

76
00:06:27.010 --> 00:06:29.130
[Tanjiro panting]

77
00:06:34.600 --> 00:06:35.970
[GIYU] You all right?

78
00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:39.940
Yes. Thanks for your help.

79
00:06:40.390 --> 00:06:41.560
[sighs in relief]

80
00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:43.320
You really saved--

81
00:06:45.280 --> 00:06:47.990
Water Breathing. First Form:

82
00:06:48.030 --> 00:06:49.650
Water Surface Slash.

83
00:06:51.820 --> 00:06:52.950
[GIYU] Tanjiro!

84
00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.580
[♪ intense music playing]

85
00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:01.250
[hinges creaking]

86
00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:04.540
[snarling]

87
00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:16.560
[BOTH] Water Breathing.

88
00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:18.390
[TANJIRO] Sixth Form.

89
00:07:18.430 --> 00:07:19.850
[GIYU] Third Form.

90
00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:23.190
[TANJIRO] Whirlpool!

91
00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:24.810
[GIYU] Flowing Dance.

92
00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.700
[Tanjiro groans nervously]

93
00:07:32.570 --> 00:07:34.530
Mr. Giyu's amazing.

94
00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:37.990
He can tell exactly which move
I'm gonna use.

95
00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:39.700
Then he follows up with one

96
00:07:39.750 --> 00:07:42.210
that prevents
any kind of friendly fire.

97
00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:44.710
He's unbelievable.

98
00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:47.800
Just what's behind those eyes?

99
00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:49.970
[stifled whimpering]

100
00:07:50.510 --> 00:07:52.050
If I'm not mistaken...

101
00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:53.720
this is the place

102
00:07:53.760 --> 00:07:55.930
that Shinazugawa and Iguro
mentioned.

103
00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:58.010
[♪ Gregorian chanting]

104
00:07:59.390 --> 00:08:00.680
Which means

105
00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.810
Kibutsuji's plan
was to gather everyone here.

106
00:08:03.850 --> 00:08:06.440
then kill us all
in one fell swoop.

107
00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:11.860
From here on out. we'll need
to be even more vigilant.

108
00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:13.860
Right.

109
00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:17.410
-Let's go.
-Right!

110
00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:18.450
PITTER PATTER

111
00:08:18.490 --> 00:08:20.700
[♪ dramatic music playing]

112
00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.470
[demons snarling]

113
00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:43.100
[IGURO]
Serpent Breathing. Fifth Form:

114
00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:52.320
Slithering Serpent!

115
00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:58.620
You demon scum!
Stay away from Kanroji!

116
00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:00.370
[squealing]

117
00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.830
Mr. Iguro is so cool!

118
00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:05.830
-Are you hurt?
-No. not at all!

119
00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:07.790
-Then. let's go.
-Okay!

120
00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.750
[Kanroji squealing]

121
00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.140
[grunts]

122
00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:29.770
Tokito!

123
00:09:29.810 --> 00:09:32.320
[demons snarling]

124
00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:38.950
[MUICHIRO] There's a whole lot
of demons. huh?

125
00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:40.660
[GYOMEI] It would seem
they've been given

126
00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:42.580
the strength of the Lower Ranks.

127
00:09:42.620 --> 00:09:45.870
It's clear that they're being
used to try and exhaust us.

128
00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.670
[metallic rattling]

129
00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:50.880
[MUICHIRO] Hmm.

130
00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:53.050
What of the Master?

131
00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:57.010
[GYOMEI] He has departed
from this world.

132
00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:00.050
It was a truly noble end.

133
00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:02.470
Knowing him.

134
00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:06.180
he never would have allowed
himself to be caught unawares.

135
00:10:06.940 --> 00:10:09.060
Did he sacrifice himself?

136
00:10:09.730 --> 00:10:13.860
[GYOMEI] Indeed. The Master
did not have much time left.

137
00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.120
[MUICHIRO] Master.

138
00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:31.670
Back when I was mortally wounded
by a demon

139
00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.750
and found myself
teetering on the edge

140
00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.380
between life and death...

141
00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.130
...he stayed by my side.

142
00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:43.760
He did the same
for every Corps member

143
00:10:43.810 --> 00:10:45.560
who was on the brink of death.

144
00:10:47.770 --> 00:10:49.230
Like a father.

145
00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.230
[GYOMEI] Yes. I know.

146
00:10:53.860 --> 00:10:56.780
[MUICHIRO] Muzan not only
took my brother from me.

147
00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.900
but our father as well.

148
00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.450
That bastard.

149
00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:02.870
Damn him!

150
00:11:03.240 --> 00:11:05.450
I swear I'll make him suffer.

151
00:11:05.490 --> 00:11:07.580
I'll send him straight to hell!

152
00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:10.330
[GYOMEI] You're not alone.

153
00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:17.670
Trust me. we all feel the same.

154
00:11:22.430 --> 00:11:24.720
DESTROY

155
00:11:24.760 --> 00:11:26.970
[SHINAZUGAWA]
Forgive me. Master.

156
00:11:28.600 --> 00:11:30.770
I couldn't protect you.

157
00:11:34.230 --> 00:11:36.650
[distorted grunting]

158
00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:39.570
[blade rasps]

159
00:11:43.070 --> 00:11:44.740
[♪ upbeat music playing]

160
00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:49.540
There's no end
to you lowlifes. huh?

161
00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:52.330
[demon cackling]

162
00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.750
That's just fine by me.

163
00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:56.750
I'll kill all of you!

164
00:12:04.720 --> 00:12:06.180
[INOSUKE] Hyah!

165
00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.640
Make way! I'm coming through!

166
00:12:10.180 --> 00:12:11.890
[chuckles]

167
00:12:11.930 --> 00:12:14.770
Whole lotta falling
happening here!

168
00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:19.730
Hyah! Pretty rude to just
drop me in here out of nowhere!

169
00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:22.360
Though I've been itching to see
how my training's paying off.

170
00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:26.450
So with that in mind.
let's test it out on you chubs!

171
00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:27.780
[chuckles]

172
00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:30.080
Let's go!

173
00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:32.750
[grunting]

174
00:12:34.170 --> 00:12:36.420
[Genya panting]

175
00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:39.550
Where am I?
The Demon Headquarters?

176
00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.090
Where are the others?

177
00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:43.300
Big Brother.

178
00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:46.430
I hope you're safe. too.

179
00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:52.810
[ZENITSU] I just heard a sound.

180
00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.850
Could it be that
he's somewhere nearby?

181
00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:59.480
[demons snarling]

182
00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:02.940
You'll regret this.

183
00:13:04.650 --> 00:13:06.360
I won't forgive you.

184
00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.410
Not in a million years.

185
00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:34.350
[SHINOBU] I smell blood.

186
00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.150
What is this place?

187
00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:54.790
[chomping]

188
00:14:02.090 --> 00:14:03.210
[DEMON] Hmm?

189
00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.170
Oh. my. You're here.

190
00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:07.840
UPPER TWO

191
00:14:07.880 --> 00:14:09.840
Oh! And you're a girl. too!

192
00:14:10.600 --> 00:14:14.100
What a young and tasty morsel
we have. [chuckles]

193
00:14:14.810 --> 00:14:18.270
I'll have to properly thank
Nakime for this later.

194
00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.730
[Shinobu panting]

195
00:14:30.620 --> 00:14:32.740
[whimpers softly]

196
00:14:34.080 --> 00:14:35.500
[KANAE] Shinobu.

197
00:14:35.540 --> 00:14:38.710
You must leave
the Demon Slayer Corps.

198
00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:43.380
I know that
you've trained really hard

199
00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:46.380
and you're fighting
to make a difference.

200
00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:50.010
-[sobbing softly]
-But I don't think you'll...

201
00:14:50.680 --> 00:14:51.720
[sighs softly]

202
00:14:51.760 --> 00:14:53.430
[stifled sobbing]

203
00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:59.480
I want you to live the life
of a happy. normal girl.

204
00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:03.230
To be able to see
your own hair turn gray.

205
00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:05.690
DESTROYER OF DEMONS

206
00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:08.320
Really... you've done enough.

207
00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:10.780
[SHINOBU] No! [sobbing]
Can't stop now!

208
00:15:10.820 --> 00:15:13.950
I will avenge you
if it's the last thing I do!

209
00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.410
This demon! I need to know...

210
00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:18.450
I have to know
what it looked like!

211
00:15:19.000 --> 00:15:21.500
Please. Big Sister.
I'm begging you!

212
00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:22.830
Tell me!

213
00:15:23.380 --> 00:15:27.460
I could never live a normal life
knowing someone did this to you!

214
00:15:27.510 --> 00:15:29.260
[sobbing] Please!

215
00:15:30.590 --> 00:15:31.840
[sighs weakly]

216
00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:35.300
[KANAE] It was a demon

217
00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:38.270
with a blood-stained pattern
on his head.

218
00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:43.100
[DEMON] I must say. it's very
nice to meet you. miss.

219
00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:45.770
You may refer to me as Doma.

220
00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:49.440
Ah. what a wonderful night!

221
00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:54.070
[SHINOBU] Such a warm smile
and gentle voice.

222
00:15:54.570 --> 00:15:57.830
There's a soft.
benevolent presence to him.

223
00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:01.790
[woman weakly] Please. help me.

224
00:16:02.670 --> 00:16:04.170
Please help me!

225
00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:05.540
Shh.

226
00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.920
Can't you see that
we're talking?

227
00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:12.680
Hmm?

228
00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:14.180
[SHINOBU] Are you all right?

229
00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:16.180
[DOMA] Wow!

230
00:16:16.220 --> 00:16:19.220
That was fast.
Are you a Hashira?

231
00:16:19.270 --> 00:16:21.270
[labored breathing]

232
00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:23.480
[squelching]

233
00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:26.690
-[gasps]
-[♪ unsettling music playing]

234
00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:29.820
[DOMA]
Oh. don't worry about that.

235
00:16:29.860 --> 00:16:31.780
You can just leave her
right there.

236
00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:34.110
I'll make
a proper meal of her later.

237
00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.620
[exhales]

238
00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.910
And this demon...

239
00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:41.120
the weapon he used.

240
00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:44.330
it was a pair of sharp fans.

241
00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.790
[metallic scraping]

242
00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:50.380
As the founder
of the Eternal Paradise Faith.

243
00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:52.380
it is my sworn duty to see that

244
00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:54.930
all my followers
attain happiness.

245
00:16:55.430 --> 00:16:58.010
I'll be sure
to consume her completely.

246
00:16:59.930 --> 00:17:01.310
[SHINOBU] There's no doubt.

247
00:17:01.350 --> 00:17:03.890
This is the demon
who killed my sister.

248
00:17:05.350 --> 00:17:07.270
Attaining happiness?

249
00:17:07.310 --> 00:17:08.940
For who exactly?

250
00:17:09.440 --> 00:17:12.360
This girl was horrified.
crying out for help.

251
00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.700
-And that's why I saved her.
-[fans scraping]

252
00:17:15.360 --> 00:17:18.160
Her suffering
has come to an end.

253
00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:20.030
No more pain.

254
00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:21.700
No more fear.

255
00:17:22.700 --> 00:17:24.910
Everyone is afraid of death.

256
00:17:25.370 --> 00:17:27.920
So I help them
by consuming them.

257
00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:33.130
This way. they get to live on
within me for all eternity.

258
00:17:33.170 --> 00:17:35.930
I take in their entire being.

259
00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:38.180
Blood. Desires.

260
00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:40.430
Even the last bit of their sinew

261
00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:43.730
-and help their souls transcend.
-[♪ unsettling music playing]

262
00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:46.390
What you're spouting
is sheer nonsense.

263
00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:48.860
And to say it with such glee...

264
00:17:49.360 --> 00:17:51.270
You truly make me sick!

265
00:17:51.320 --> 00:17:53.280
Aw.

266
00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:57.570
I can't believe you'd say that
after we'd only just met.

267
00:17:57.610 --> 00:17:59.280
Oh. I see.

268
00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:01.580
Oh. you poor thing.

269
00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:04.290
Did something unfortunate
happen?

270
00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:05.870
Let's hear it.

271
00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:07.370
Go on. tell me.

272
00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:11.880
"Unfortunate" doesn't begin
to describe it!

273
00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:15.050
You are the one who killed
my big sister. weren't you?

274
00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:18.090
Does the haori I'm wearing
mean nothing to you?!

275
00:18:18.130 --> 00:18:19.390
Huh?

276
00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:25.560
[blade rasps]

277
00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:31.020
[flesh squelching]

278
00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.860
[DOMA] That's right.

279
00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:36.030
It belonged to the girl
who used Flower Breathing.

280
00:18:36.570 --> 00:18:38.910
Such a sweet. gentle child.

281
00:18:39.820 --> 00:18:42.450
The sun came up
and cut our time short.

282
00:18:42.490 --> 00:18:43.870
I remember.

283
00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:46.500
It's a shame I didn't get-- Her.

284
00:18:48.370 --> 00:18:49.580
[SHINOBU] Insect Breathing.

285
00:18:49.620 --> 00:18:52.380
Dance of the Bee Sting:
True Flutter.

286
00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.590
A marvelous thrust.

287
00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:57.550
I hardly even saw it.

288
00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.260
Blood Demon Art:

289
00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:04.510
Frozen Lotus.

290
00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:07.060
[Shinobu shivering] So cold.

291
00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:09.440
It feels like my lungs
are bursting.

292
00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:11.650
[DOMA] Hmm.

293
00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:13.860
Look at that. You are fast.

294
00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:16.480
Unfortunately for you.

295
00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:19.650
those thrusts aren't enough
to kill a demon.

296
00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:20.910
[slurps]

297
00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:22.780
[rattling]

298
00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:24.530
Aim for here.

299
00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:27.620
You need to chop off my head.

300
00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:29.660
DESTROY

301
00:19:29.710 --> 00:19:32.580
My thrusts alone
may not be enough.

302
00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.090
but what of this?

303
00:19:34.130 --> 00:19:36.210
-[clanks]
-[ratchets. clicks]

304
00:19:37.170 --> 00:19:38.170
[Doma groans]

305
00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:40.800
[SHINOBU] Time to see
whether this toxin

306
00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.590
works on an Upper Rank.

307
00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:48.930
Sister. lend me
your strength. please.

308
00:19:49.730 --> 00:19:50.980
[retches]

309
00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:52.900
[straining] This poison.

310
00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:56.110
It's clearly far stronger
than the strain you used

311
00:19:56.150 --> 00:19:58.940
up on Rui's mountain. [wheezing]

312
00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.700
[SHINOBU] So they did
exchange information.

313
00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:04.530
This is the drawback
to using poison.

314
00:20:04.570 --> 00:20:08.580
[DOMA] He told me that
you've been changing concoction

315
00:20:08.620 --> 00:20:11.910
for each demon you face.
[straining]

316
00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:14.290
-[coughs. retches]
-[blood splatters]

317
00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:16.750
[wheezing]

318
00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:20.920
Oh. my.

319
00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:25.390
It would seem that I've already
neutralized all of your poison.

320
00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:26.720
How rude of me.

321
00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:30.060
And after you'd made it
just for me.

322
00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.480
That sword of yours.

323
00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:36.270
it makes quite an interesting
sound when you sheathe it.

324
00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:40.360
Is that where you change
what poison you use?

325
00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:43.200
Yay! This is fun!

326
00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:46.910
Who knew being poisoned
was so invigorating?

327
00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:48.700
It's almost addictive.

328
00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:51.200
What will the next formula
be like? [chuckles]

329
00:20:51.240 --> 00:20:53.620
Come on. let's give it a try.

330
00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:57.250
-[swishing]
-[rattling]

331
00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:01.300
Very well then.

332
00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:03.420
I'll oblige.

333
00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:04.510
See...

334
00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:11.020
...I'd already anticipated
this would happen.

335
00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:14.480
[Doma chuckling]
Is your next batch set?

336
00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:16.850
I'm ready whenever you are.

337
00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:24.110
I know I just said
to give it a try...

338
00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:28.570
...but you could at least
change up your offense.

339
00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:32.620
-[metallic clanking]
-[Doma chuckles]

340
00:21:33.830 --> 00:21:36.080
-[continues chuckling]
-[grunts]

341
00:21:43.380 --> 00:21:45.010
What's this?

342
00:21:45.050 --> 00:21:47.510
You seem to be
slower than earlier.

343
00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:49.050
So sad.

344
00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:52.510
[SHINOBU] Insect Breathing.
Dance of the Horsefly:

345
00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:54.560
Enticing Slash!

346
00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:05.280
Oh. my.
You were able to land a hit.

347
00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:08.160
The way you got through
all my defenses.

348
00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:09.660
it's amazing!

349
00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:11.200
I'm truly impressed.

350
00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:14.250
It's almost enough
to bring a tear to my eye.

351
00:22:14.290 --> 00:22:16.500
Come on.
what are you waiting for?

352
00:22:16.540 --> 00:22:20.500
Hurry up and attack me again.
before I stop the poison.

353
00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:23.170
Please? You're doing so well.

354
00:22:23.210 --> 00:22:25.010
Maybe the next attack kills me.

355
00:22:25.050 --> 00:22:26.090
[disgruntled sigh]

356
00:22:29.930 --> 00:22:33.470
[laughs] Yes! That's the spirit!

357
00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:38.890
Ever since I was a child.

358
00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:40.940
I was kind and clever.

359
00:22:41.730 --> 00:22:43.980
I always helped those
who were in need

360
00:22:44.030 --> 00:22:46.490
and led them
to the path of happiness.

361
00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:49.320
It was my duty after all.

362
00:22:50.950 --> 00:22:53.780
[DOMA'S FATHER] His eyes
have the colors of a rainbow.

363
00:22:54.790 --> 00:22:57.910
And this gray hair
is proof of his innocence.

364
00:22:58.910 --> 00:23:00.880
This child is truly special.

365
00:23:01.370 --> 00:23:04.090
Surely he can hear
the voices of the gods.

366
00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:06.010
[♪ slow piano notes playing]

367
00:23:06.050 --> 00:23:09.760
[DOMA] My parents were
hopelessly naive simpletons.

368
00:23:10.340 --> 00:23:11.890
You'd have to be

369
00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:15.760
in order to found a religion
like the Eternal Paradise Faith.

370
00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:18.310
I pitied them.

371
00:23:18.350 --> 00:23:21.900
so I always played along
with their make-believe ideas.

372
00:23:23.020 --> 00:23:25.940
I never once heard
the voice of the gods.

373
00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:29.570
At first. I didn't know
how to deal

374
00:23:29.610 --> 00:23:33.160
with the hordes of people
worshiping and praying to me.

375
00:23:34.120 --> 00:23:37.160
Seeing these grown-ups
come crying to a child

376
00:23:37.200 --> 00:23:40.290
saying they were suffering.
pleading for help.

377
00:23:40.330 --> 00:23:43.710
made me worry
if they were sick in the head.

378
00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:48.670
After nearly putting me to sleep
with their personal stories.

379
00:23:48.710 --> 00:23:50.380
they would bow to me.

380
00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:53.050
asking to be guided to paradise.

381
00:23:53.550 --> 00:23:54.850
I cried.

382
00:23:56.060 --> 00:23:58.220
"You poor things." I thought.

383
00:23:58.720 --> 00:24:00.770
"Paradise doesn't even exist.

384
00:24:01.430 --> 00:24:05.560
It's just a fairy tale
concocted by deluded humans.

385
00:24:06.650 --> 00:24:09.150
There are no gods or Buddhas."

386
00:24:09.780 --> 00:24:12.280
These people
had lived for decades.

387
00:24:12.320 --> 00:24:15.490
yet they still couldn't grasp
that simple truth.

388
00:24:16.030 --> 00:24:19.160
When you die.
you return to nothingness.

389
00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:21.330
All feeling ceases.

390
00:24:22.080 --> 00:24:23.790
Your heart stops.

391
00:24:23.830 --> 00:24:25.580
Your brain stops.

392
00:24:25.630 --> 00:24:27.920
You rot and return to the earth.

393
00:24:28.420 --> 00:24:31.590
Such is the fate
of every living creature.

394
00:24:33.760 --> 00:24:37.010
To be too foolish
to accept reality.

395
00:24:37.640 --> 00:24:39.810
what a hard life that must be.

396
00:24:40.810 --> 00:24:44.020
I want to bring happiness
to these pitiful people.

397
00:24:44.520 --> 00:24:46.190
I want to save them.

398
00:24:47.060 --> 00:24:51.440
I truly believe
that is my purpose here.

399
00:24:55.450 --> 00:24:56.410
[squelches]

400
00:24:56.450 --> 00:24:57.570
[blade rasps]

401
00:24:57.620 --> 00:25:00.290
-Aw. Still nothing.
-[metallic rattling]

402
00:25:00.330 --> 00:25:02.000
And that was number five.

403
00:25:02.040 --> 00:25:03.540
What will you do?

404
00:25:04.080 --> 00:25:06.540
The toxin's
getting less effective.

405
00:25:07.040 --> 00:25:09.710
How many more times
do you think you can adapt it?

406
00:25:10.300 --> 00:25:12.630
-Oh! Are you out of breath now?
-[panting]

407
00:25:13.170 --> 00:25:14.800
Look at all that sweat.

408
00:25:14.840 --> 00:25:16.180
Are you all right?

409
00:25:16.800 --> 00:25:19.850
[SHINOBU] So. this is the power
of an Upper Rank.

410
00:25:20.560 --> 00:25:22.600
None of my poisons are working.

411
00:25:23.520 --> 00:25:26.690
He's adapting too fast
to keep up with.

412
00:25:28.860 --> 00:25:31.230
Your alveoli must be dead now.

413
00:25:31.280 --> 00:25:33.360
[crystals tinkling]

414
00:25:33.400 --> 00:25:34.780
Painful.

415
00:25:34.820 --> 00:25:38.160
You did breathe it in.
my Blood Demon Art.

416
00:25:40.330 --> 00:25:43.160
[SHINOBU] He turns
his frozen blood into mist

417
00:25:43.200 --> 00:25:45.540
and disperses it with his fans.

418
00:25:45.580 --> 00:25:48.670
Even breathing around him
is dangerous now.

419
00:25:54.420 --> 00:25:55.550
[clangs]

420
00:25:55.590 --> 00:25:56.630
[ratchets. clicks]

421
00:25:57.090 --> 00:26:00.680
This time. I'll increase
the dose with multiple strikes!

422
00:26:01.510 --> 00:26:04.730
Insect Breathing.
Dance of the Dragonfly:

423
00:26:11.560 --> 00:26:13.860
Compound Eye Hexagon!

424
00:26:16.400 --> 00:26:17.780
I can't believe it!

425
00:26:17.820 --> 00:26:19.780
Such blazing speed!

426
00:26:19.820 --> 00:26:23.330
You might be the fastest Hashira
I've ever met.

427
00:26:25.700 --> 00:26:27.120
-[blood squelches]
-[gasps]

428
00:26:27.620 --> 00:26:30.040
[SHINOBU] He... got me.

429
00:26:30.080 --> 00:26:31.340
[grunts]

430
00:26:31.380 --> 00:26:33.130
Forget the poison.

431
00:26:33.170 --> 00:26:35.340
Why not try to decapitate me?

432
00:26:35.880 --> 00:26:38.300
With your speed.
you might have won.

433
00:26:39.260 --> 00:26:41.470
[laughs sarcastically]
Maybe not.

434
00:26:41.510 --> 00:26:43.720
I mean. you are small.

435
00:26:44.220 --> 00:26:45.770
[gasps. breathing shakily]

436
00:26:47.560 --> 00:26:50.650
[SHINOBU] Why are my hands
so small? I wonder.

437
00:26:52.400 --> 00:26:55.570
How come I was never able
to grow taller?

438
00:26:57.490 --> 00:27:00.320
If my stature
were just a little bigger.

439
00:27:00.780 --> 00:27:04.200
could I have been able to behead
and defeat a demon?

440
00:27:05.040 --> 00:27:07.540
The longer
your arms and legs are.

441
00:27:07.580 --> 00:27:09.420
the more muscles you have.

442
00:27:09.460 --> 00:27:12.040
which means more strength
in your attacks.

443
00:27:13.500 --> 00:27:15.170
[♪ tender music playing]

444
00:27:15.210 --> 00:27:18.130
My sister
was also of small frame.

445
00:27:18.170 --> 00:27:20.050
but she was taller than I.

446
00:27:22.180 --> 00:27:24.810
How I envy Mr. Himejima.

447
00:27:25.390 --> 00:27:27.890
Seeing someone like him
come to the rescue

448
00:27:27.930 --> 00:27:29.730
would give anyone relief.

449
00:27:33.560 --> 00:27:36.690
I know what my sister
really wanted to say.

450
00:27:37.400 --> 00:27:39.490
but didn't have the heart to.

451
00:27:42.910 --> 00:27:44.410
[DOMA] Oh. no!

452
00:27:44.450 --> 00:27:46.490
Have our games come to an end?

453
00:27:46.870 --> 00:27:48.410
That's too bad.

454
00:27:49.370 --> 00:27:51.420
[metallic rattling]

455
00:27:52.000 --> 00:27:55.090
[SHINOBU] "I don't think
you'll win against that demon."

456
00:27:55.630 --> 00:27:57.880
[voice breaking] That's what
you were going to say.

457
00:27:57.920 --> 00:28:00.380
But you stopped yourself.
didn't you?

458
00:28:00.880 --> 00:28:02.680
[KANAE] Pull yourself together.

459
00:28:08.310 --> 00:28:10.270
This is no time for tears.

460
00:28:11.940 --> 00:28:12.980
[SHINOBU] Sister.

461
00:28:13.940 --> 00:28:15.150
[KANAE] Stand up.

462
00:28:15.190 --> 00:28:18.610
[SHINOBU] I can't.
I've lost so much blood.

463
00:28:18.650 --> 00:28:21.950
My left lung is punctured
and I can't even breathe.

464
00:28:22.490 --> 00:28:24.160
You can and you will.

465
00:28:24.740 --> 00:28:28.200
Stand up.
You are a Hashira. Shinobu.

466
00:28:28.620 --> 00:28:30.410
[grunting softly]

467
00:28:31.040 --> 00:28:34.000
If you've made up your mind
to defeat him. then do so.

468
00:28:34.040 --> 00:28:35.710
No excuses.

469
00:28:37.090 --> 00:28:39.550
Win by whatever means you can.

470
00:28:40.090 --> 00:28:42.170
Remember your promise.

471
00:28:42.220 --> 00:28:43.880
to me and Kanao.

472
00:28:46.390 --> 00:28:47.640
[SHINOBU] Kanao.

473
00:28:50.640 --> 00:28:52.520
[DOMA] Forgive me.

474
00:28:52.560 --> 00:28:54.980
You must be suffering right now.

475
00:28:55.020 --> 00:28:57.150
[whimpering softly]

476
00:28:58.730 --> 00:28:59.900
[gasps]

477
00:28:59.940 --> 00:29:02.030
I know that you have it in you.

478
00:29:02.400 --> 00:29:03.780
Do your best.

479
00:29:04.740 --> 00:29:06.660
-Huh?
-[metallic rattling]

480
00:29:07.820 --> 00:29:08.910
[quivers]

481
00:29:10.040 --> 00:29:14.710
Wait. Are you... standing up?
[exclaims in amazement]

482
00:29:14.750 --> 00:29:16.330
Scary.

483
00:29:16.380 --> 00:29:18.670
Are you actually a human?

484
00:29:18.710 --> 00:29:22.800
I slashed your collarbone.
your lungs. and your ribs.

485
00:29:23.920 --> 00:29:25.970
At your diminutive size

486
00:29:26.010 --> 00:29:28.300
and the amount of blood
you've lost.

487
00:29:28.350 --> 00:29:30.390
how are you not dead right now?

488
00:29:30.430 --> 00:29:31.470
[coughs]

489
00:29:31.520 --> 00:29:33.060
See? Right there.

490
00:29:33.100 --> 00:29:36.060
There clearly is blood
gurgling in your lungs.

491
00:29:36.100 --> 00:29:38.690
The pain must be unimaginable.

492
00:29:39.150 --> 00:29:41.900
Surrender and I'll put an end
to your suffering.

493
00:29:41.940 --> 00:29:43.240
It'll be quick.

494
00:29:44.150 --> 00:29:46.070
It's too late for you.

495
00:29:46.110 --> 00:29:47.860
So. just let go.

496
00:29:47.910 --> 00:29:50.620
[SHINOBU] I'll make a go
for his neck this time

497
00:29:50.660 --> 00:29:54.080
and put everything I have left
into this strike!

498
00:29:54.710 --> 00:29:58.500
Insect Breathing.
Dance of the Centipede.

499
00:29:59.000 --> 00:30:00.130
[DOMA] Hmm?

500
00:30:00.170 --> 00:30:02.170
[SHINOBU]
Hundred-Legged Zigzag.

501
00:30:03.000 --> 00:30:04.880
[♪ dramatic music playing]

502
00:30:06.970 --> 00:30:08.090
[groans]

503
00:30:25.110 --> 00:30:27.950
[DOMA] It feels like
she's everywhere at once.

504
00:30:28.780 --> 00:30:31.280
Just her movement
destroyed the bridge.

505
00:30:32.120 --> 00:30:33.910
[squeaking]

506
00:30:33.950 --> 00:30:36.250
So fast. I can't follow her.

507
00:30:37.120 --> 00:30:38.330
[impact grunts]

508
00:30:42.590 --> 00:30:43.630
From below?

509
00:30:43.670 --> 00:30:44.920
[gasps]

510
00:30:47.720 --> 00:30:49.220
[Shinobu grunts]

511
00:30:52.890 --> 00:30:55.970
-[glass shatters]
-[♪ music swells. fades]

512
00:30:57.600 --> 00:30:59.270
[SHINOBU]
Back when I was a child...

513
00:31:00.770 --> 00:31:02.770
...I thought of happiness
like a road.

514
00:31:02.820 --> 00:31:05.320
one that stretched on
into the distance

515
00:31:05.360 --> 00:31:07.440
with no end in sight.

516
00:31:07.490 --> 00:31:09.070
[laughter]

517
00:31:09.110 --> 00:31:10.450
[blood splatters]

518
00:31:11.110 --> 00:31:13.740
It wasn't until it was destroyed

519
00:31:13.780 --> 00:31:15.910
that I finally realized

520
00:31:15.950 --> 00:31:19.910
the road beneath my feet
was but a thin sheet of glass.

521
00:31:22.380 --> 00:31:26.960
However. some haven't had
the glass broken yet.

522
00:31:27.800 --> 00:31:32.300
All I wanted after being saved
was to become stronger...

523
00:31:33.300 --> 00:31:37.470
...so that some day.
I could protect those people.

524
00:31:38.890 --> 00:31:42.730
So... we made a promise.

525
00:31:44.940 --> 00:31:50.450
To vanquish the demons
as many as we could. together.

526
00:31:51.110 --> 00:31:52.700
[♪ poignant music playing]

527
00:31:53.570 --> 00:31:56.450
In hopes that the pain
we suffered

528
00:31:56.490 --> 00:31:59.080
would never be felt by another.

529
00:32:07.630 --> 00:32:09.460
Even if I'm weak...

530
00:32:13.090 --> 00:32:16.300
...even if I can't
decapitate demons.

531
00:32:16.350 --> 00:32:18.600
if I can take down just one.

532
00:32:18.640 --> 00:32:20.890
I can save dozens of lives.

533
00:32:20.930 --> 00:32:23.020
And if that demon's
an Upper Rank.

534
00:32:23.690 --> 00:32:25.940
it could mean saving hundreds.

535
00:32:27.520 --> 00:32:30.740
It's not a matter
of can or cannot.

536
00:32:31.320 --> 00:32:33.780
This is something I have to do.

537
00:32:38.990 --> 00:32:40.540
Are you angry?

538
00:32:42.500 --> 00:32:46.000
[SHINOBU] Yes.
I am angry. Tanjiro.

539
00:32:46.040 --> 00:32:47.420
I'm furious.

540
00:32:48.170 --> 00:32:49.340
In fact...

541
00:32:50.300 --> 00:32:52.670
...I'm always angry.

542
00:32:52.720 --> 00:32:54.550
How could I not be?

543
00:32:56.850 --> 00:32:58.850
My parents were killed.

544
00:33:00.270 --> 00:33:02.680
My older sister was killed.

545
00:33:03.690 --> 00:33:07.230
My Tsuguko. other than Kanao.
were killed.

546
00:33:08.230 --> 00:33:10.070
And those poor girls.

547
00:33:10.730 --> 00:33:12.400
If it weren't for the demons...

548
00:33:12.900 --> 00:33:15.820
If it weren't for the demons
that killed their loved ones.

549
00:33:16.490 --> 00:33:19.620
they'd be living happily
with their families.

550
00:33:21.120 --> 00:33:22.120
[♪ discordant music playing]

551
00:33:22.160 --> 00:33:25.330
It's all so infuriating!

552
00:33:25.370 --> 00:33:27.750
Stop messing with me. damn it!

553
00:33:28.540 --> 00:33:32.340
Why the hell isn't my poison
working on this prick?

554
00:33:33.130 --> 00:33:34.930
You bastard!

555
00:33:34.970 --> 00:33:36.340
[exhales]

556
00:33:36.380 --> 00:33:38.470
[ice crackling]

557
00:33:46.140 --> 00:33:48.770
I'm moved! You did your best!

558
00:33:48.810 --> 00:33:51.070
Even though you're so weak.

559
00:33:51.110 --> 00:33:53.230
You must have worked
so incredibly hard

560
00:33:53.280 --> 00:33:55.320
to get to this point. [sobbing]

561
00:33:55.360 --> 00:33:57.490
You're weaker than your sister.

562
00:33:57.530 --> 00:33:59.990
and yet. you somehow
outlived her.

563
00:34:00.490 --> 00:34:03.580
[sniffles] It's a miracle
you survived this long.

564
00:34:03.620 --> 00:34:04.750
[body cracking]

565
00:34:04.790 --> 00:34:06.210
[coughs]

566
00:34:06.250 --> 00:34:07.540
Even when hope is gone.

567
00:34:07.580 --> 00:34:10.040
humans always fight
to the bitter end.

568
00:34:10.590 --> 00:34:12.500
Humans are so foolish.

569
00:34:12.550 --> 00:34:15.170
But that's what makes them
so beautiful.

570
00:34:16.050 --> 00:34:18.680
I deem you worthy
of becoming part of me.

571
00:34:19.180 --> 00:34:22.260
[sobbing] You and I
shall share eternity!

572
00:34:25.600 --> 00:34:27.560
Do you have any last words?

573
00:34:28.140 --> 00:34:29.400
I'm listening.

574
00:34:34.190 --> 00:34:37.030
Rot in hell. you bastard!

575
00:34:41.030 --> 00:34:43.330
[exclaims in horror] Master!

576
00:34:46.330 --> 00:34:47.750
[bones crunching]

577
00:34:48.580 --> 00:34:51.540
[exclaims in anguish]

578
00:34:51.590 --> 00:34:53.710
[bones crunching]

579
00:34:59.340 --> 00:35:00.720
[clangs]

580
00:35:03.600 --> 00:35:05.180
[clatters]

581
00:35:05.890 --> 00:35:07.520
[quivering]

582
00:35:08.350 --> 00:35:11.310
[screaming in agony]

583
00:35:15.030 --> 00:35:17.740
[ZENITSU] I can't shake
the feeling he's here.

584
00:35:17.780 --> 00:35:19.150
He must be.

585
00:35:19.610 --> 00:35:22.200
He's got a score to settle
with me. too.

586
00:35:29.500 --> 00:35:30.870
The people we love.

587
00:35:30.920 --> 00:35:34.380
the people we hold dear
are so precious.

588
00:35:34.840 --> 00:35:37.420
We take for granted
that they'll always be there.

589
00:35:37.880 --> 00:35:41.840
However. that's just
a selfish delusion.

590
00:35:41.890 --> 00:35:43.800
Flower Breathing...

591
00:35:44.300 --> 00:35:46.430
[ZENITSU] Because the thought
of living without them

592
00:35:46.470 --> 00:35:48.390
is simply unbearable.

593
00:35:48.430 --> 00:35:49.680
...Fourth Form:

594
00:35:50.350 --> 00:35:52.560
Crimson Hanagoromo!

595
00:35:52.600 --> 00:35:54.400
[shatters]

596
00:35:55.570 --> 00:35:56.650
[grunts]

597
00:35:59.280 --> 00:36:02.320
[DOMA] Wow!
You nearly got me there.

598
00:36:05.870 --> 00:36:08.660
[ZENITSU] "They'll always be
alive and close by."

599
00:36:09.790 --> 00:36:12.460
It's a naive thought. I know.

600
00:36:13.040 --> 00:36:14.920
but we all wanna believe it.

601
00:36:18.130 --> 00:36:21.550
Would you mind holding off
your attacks for just a second?

602
00:36:21.590 --> 00:36:24.640
-I'm trying to absorb her.
-[flesh squelching]

603
00:36:27.430 --> 00:36:29.560
[seething]

604
00:36:32.060 --> 00:36:33.560
[DOMA] How strange.

605
00:36:33.600 --> 00:36:36.270
You're not taking the bait.
are you?

606
00:36:36.940 --> 00:36:38.980
What she did earlier.

607
00:36:39.030 --> 00:36:41.610
that motion she made
with her fingers.

608
00:36:42.070 --> 00:36:45.030
Was that her warning you
of my powers?

609
00:36:45.530 --> 00:36:48.370
I'm impressed she thought
to do that so quickly.

610
00:36:48.830 --> 00:36:50.580
Good job you did it.

611
00:36:51.120 --> 00:36:53.000
Too bad it doesn't matter.

612
00:36:53.500 --> 00:36:55.500
-[flesh squelching]
-[clatters]

613
00:36:55.540 --> 00:36:58.710
Well. in case
you were wondering.

614
00:36:59.250 --> 00:37:02.420
your master was tastier
than I imagined.

615
00:37:02.470 --> 00:37:03.720
[slurps]

616
00:37:04.260 --> 00:37:06.010
And now. you're here.

617
00:37:06.050 --> 00:37:09.470
It's just one feast
after another. it seems.

618
00:37:10.260 --> 00:37:13.390
Ah. this truly is...

619
00:37:13.980 --> 00:37:16.440
a wonderful night.

620
00:37:17.020 --> 00:37:20.190
[seething]

621
00:37:29.780 --> 00:37:31.120
You can't hide.

622
00:37:31.700 --> 00:37:33.040
Come out.

623
00:37:33.870 --> 00:37:36.250
Have some dignity and face me.

624
00:37:38.790 --> 00:37:41.670
[DEMON] Sounds like someone
ought to teach you some manners.

625
00:37:41.710 --> 00:37:43.970
Did you forget
that I'm your senior?

626
00:37:44.550 --> 00:37:48.010
You look a little stronger
than the last time I saw ya.

627
00:37:48.720 --> 00:37:52.680
It's too bad you still reek
of being a pathetic weakling.

628
00:37:55.310 --> 00:37:56.270
[clatters]

629
00:37:56.310 --> 00:37:57.650
UPPER SIX

630
00:37:57.690 --> 00:38:01.900
It's been a while.
hasn't it... Zenitsu?

631
00:38:01.940 --> 00:38:03.740
[chuckles]

632
00:38:04.690 --> 00:38:06.110
[ZENITSU] Kaigaku.

633
00:38:06.150 --> 00:38:08.530
You don't get my respect.

634
00:38:08.910 --> 00:38:10.450
You're a demon.

635
00:38:10.490 --> 00:38:12.370
You'll be treated as such.

636
00:38:20.130 --> 00:38:21.170
[Nakime plucking biwa strings]

637
00:38:21.210 --> 00:38:22.630
-[rumbles]
-[Tanjiro gasps]

638
00:38:22.670 --> 00:38:23.710
[grunts]

639
00:38:25.760 --> 00:38:28.260
Water Breathing. Ninth Form:

640
00:38:30.050 --> 00:38:32.430
Splashing Water Flow. Turbulent!

641
00:38:33.510 --> 00:38:34.850
[grunts]

642
00:38:34.890 --> 00:38:36.100
Stay focused!

643
00:38:36.140 --> 00:38:37.390
All right!

644
00:38:38.600 --> 00:38:40.690
This place is insane.

645
00:38:40.730 --> 00:38:43.320
The building keeps shifting
and rearranging itself

646
00:38:43.360 --> 00:38:45.030
as if it's alive.

647
00:38:45.070 --> 00:38:47.900
I can tell that
it's trying to separate us.

648
00:38:48.990 --> 00:38:51.660
We have to regroup
with the other Corps members

649
00:38:51.700 --> 00:38:54.080
and stay together
till we reach Muzan!

650
00:38:57.960 --> 00:38:59.870
[cawing]

651
00:39:00.290 --> 00:39:02.000
[cawing]

652
00:39:02.040 --> 00:39:03.670
Attention!

653
00:39:03.710 --> 00:39:05.920
Shinobu Kocho is dead!

654
00:39:06.590 --> 00:39:09.010
She fought valiantly
against Upper Two

655
00:39:09.050 --> 00:39:10.760
but was defeated!

656
00:39:17.980 --> 00:39:20.230
-[gasps]
-[muted silence]

657
00:39:23.650 --> 00:39:25.820
[♪ poignant music playing]

658
00:39:27.190 --> 00:39:29.320
[inaudible laughter]

659
00:39:42.460 --> 00:39:44.250
[seething]

660
00:39:47.840 --> 00:39:49.760
[cawing]

661
00:39:52.010 --> 00:39:53.300
[GIYU] Strange.

662
00:39:53.350 --> 00:39:55.890
There's a piece of paper
wrapped around its neck.

663
00:39:56.390 --> 00:39:58.230
How are the crows already here?

664
00:39:59.230 --> 00:40:02.020
[♪ epic dramatic music playing]

665
00:40:02.690 --> 00:40:04.480
Shinobu is dead.

666
00:40:04.520 --> 00:40:06.610
but we must push forward.

667
00:40:06.980 --> 00:40:09.570
Think only of what must be done
for victory.

668
00:40:10.070 --> 00:40:11.200
[KUINA. KANATA] Right.

669
00:40:13.490 --> 00:40:14.870
And what about the others?

670
00:40:14.910 --> 00:40:17.290
I need reports
on their whereabouts.

671
00:40:18.790 --> 00:40:20.500
[KANATA]
Center of the 40th vertical

672
00:40:20.540 --> 00:40:22.370
and 12th horizontal levels.

673
00:40:22.410 --> 00:40:24.040
[fight grunts]

674
00:40:24.080 --> 00:40:26.040
The Corps members
are fighting off

675
00:40:26.090 --> 00:40:29.010
what appears to be
at least ten demons.

676
00:40:30.800 --> 00:40:34.140
[fight grunts]

677
00:40:35.890 --> 00:40:38.890
However. more than 30 demons
are moving in their direction

678
00:40:38.930 --> 00:40:40.390
from behind the walls.

679
00:40:46.610 --> 00:40:48.650
[KIRIYA]
Using Mr. Yushiro's eyes.

680
00:40:48.690 --> 00:40:51.190
we're able to see
Blood Demon Arts.

681
00:40:51.240 --> 00:40:54.450
something that isn't possible
to do with the human eye.

682
00:40:55.370 --> 00:40:57.580
Each red light
is a Blood Demon Art.

683
00:40:57.620 --> 00:41:00.910
The more intense they glow.
the more potent their power.

684
00:41:01.790 --> 00:41:04.420
In this place. the entire area.

685
00:41:04.460 --> 00:41:07.750
buildings and all. must also be
a Blood Demon Art.

686
00:41:08.500 --> 00:41:11.510
There's seemingly
no end in sight to it.

687
00:41:13.930 --> 00:41:15.930
What incredible power!

688
00:41:17.260 --> 00:41:18.760
A demon labyrinth

689
00:41:18.810 --> 00:41:21.270
with the ability
to branch out endlessly.

690
00:41:24.560 --> 00:41:26.350
And here we lie at its center.

691
00:41:26.400 --> 00:41:29.270
trapped within the walls
of this infinite castle.

692
00:41:29.980 --> 00:41:31.570
[KAKUSHI 1] This one's finished.

693
00:41:33.450 --> 00:41:36.820
[KIRIYA] However. it's not as if
we've been caught off guard.

694
00:41:36.860 --> 00:41:37.820
KAKUSHI

695
00:41:38.120 --> 00:41:41.290
My father prepared
for this day meticulously.

696
00:41:42.040 --> 00:41:44.210
With Gyomei's cooperation.

697
00:41:44.250 --> 00:41:46.250
he had the Hashira
within arm's reach

698
00:41:46.290 --> 00:41:47.830
to mobilize at any time.

699
00:41:47.880 --> 00:41:50.840
To prevent the Corps members
from being isolated.

700
00:41:50.880 --> 00:41:53.630
he sent the Kasugai Crows
to gather them into groups

701
00:41:53.670 --> 00:41:54.630
and waited.

702
00:41:55.760 --> 00:41:59.350
He enlisted the aid
of Ms. Tamayo and Mr. Yushiro.

703
00:41:59.390 --> 00:42:00.600
And finally.

704
00:42:01.220 --> 00:42:03.520
to ensure that
their plan would succeed.

705
00:42:04.020 --> 00:42:06.600
my sisters and our parents

706
00:42:07.100 --> 00:42:09.270
readily sacrificed their lives.

707
00:42:12.610 --> 00:42:14.110
We cannot lose.

708
00:42:14.650 --> 00:42:16.070
no matter what!

709
00:42:19.280 --> 00:42:21.910
[♪ music intensifies]

710
00:42:22.580 --> 00:42:24.370
Amongst the Blood Demon Arts.

711
00:42:24.410 --> 00:42:27.670
there are five traces of power
that tower over the rest

712
00:42:27.710 --> 00:42:29.710
as if flaunting their strength.

713
00:42:30.340 --> 00:42:32.710
These must be Upper Ranks.

714
00:42:33.420 --> 00:42:34.960
One of them is at the same spot

715
00:42:35.010 --> 00:42:37.300
where Shinobu
was last seen fighting.

716
00:42:37.880 --> 00:42:39.300
Found another!

717
00:42:39.390 --> 00:42:42.350
Upper Six and Zenitsu have just
encountered each other!

718
00:42:42.390 --> 00:42:43.970
An Upper Rank!

719
00:42:44.020 --> 00:42:45.180
Is he alone?

720
00:42:45.230 --> 00:42:47.770
[KUINA] He is.
It looks to be a one-on-one!

721
00:42:47.810 --> 00:42:50.690
[KIRIYA] A Hinoe can't beat
an Upper Rank by themself.

722
00:42:50.730 --> 00:42:51.860
Send backup!

723
00:42:57.490 --> 00:42:58.740
[KAIGAKU] Hmm.

724
00:42:58.780 --> 00:43:00.870
What. you're frozen in fear?

725
00:43:00.910 --> 00:43:02.990
Guess some things never change.

726
00:43:03.030 --> 00:43:05.290
Once a coward. always a coward.

727
00:43:06.290 --> 00:43:08.330
Did you ever become a Hashira?

728
00:43:08.370 --> 00:43:10.420
[scoffs] Guess not.

729
00:43:10.460 --> 00:43:11.750
That's too bad.

730
00:43:12.250 --> 00:43:16.420
Got any new techniques?
Or still just First Form?

731
00:43:17.470 --> 00:43:19.090
For an Upper Rank bottom feeder

732
00:43:19.130 --> 00:43:21.260
who's nothing more
than a spare blade.

733
00:43:21.300 --> 00:43:23.560
you're sure acting
awfully proud.

734
00:43:24.430 --> 00:43:27.270
[Kaigaku sarcastically]
Wow! [laughs]

735
00:43:27.310 --> 00:43:30.440
Who taught you to talk
like that? New friends?

736
00:43:30.940 --> 00:43:33.270
[ZENITSU] Why the hell
did you become a demon?

737
00:43:33.770 --> 00:43:35.940
[laughs] You'd never understand.

738
00:43:35.980 --> 00:43:38.490
You were supposed to succeed
Thunder Breathing!

739
00:43:38.530 --> 00:43:39.990
But you tarnished it!

740
00:43:41.450 --> 00:43:42.570
Huh?

741
00:43:42.610 --> 00:43:44.870
[ZENITSU]
After you became a demon.

742
00:43:44.910 --> 00:43:46.120
he...

743
00:43:47.790 --> 00:43:49.500
He committed seppuku!

744
00:43:50.000 --> 00:43:51.250
[♪ poignant music playing]

745
00:43:51.290 --> 00:43:52.670
[voice breaking] Even worse.

746
00:43:53.210 --> 00:43:54.920
he did it by himself.

747
00:43:56.130 --> 00:43:58.170
He was all alone!

748
00:43:59.380 --> 00:44:01.090
Because of that.
no one was there

749
00:44:01.130 --> 00:44:02.760
to put him out of his misery.

750
00:44:02.800 --> 00:44:06.010
He bled out
and died a painful death.

751
00:44:06.060 --> 00:44:07.850
It's your fault!

752
00:44:07.890 --> 00:44:11.060
Gramps died the most
agonizing death possible

753
00:44:11.100 --> 00:44:13.230
all because
the Thunder Breathing rights

754
00:44:13.270 --> 00:44:14.440
produced a demon!

755
00:44:16.150 --> 00:44:18.320
Why the hell should I care?

756
00:44:18.780 --> 00:44:21.200
Gramps died? So what?

757
00:44:21.240 --> 00:44:22.650
Want me to cry?

758
00:44:22.700 --> 00:44:25.200
Did you expect me
to give it to him?

759
00:44:25.240 --> 00:44:26.490
Well. I don't.

760
00:44:26.780 --> 00:44:30.080
In fact. I don't care for anyone
who doesn't appreciate me.

761
00:44:30.120 --> 00:44:31.960
No matter what.

762
00:44:32.000 --> 00:44:33.830
this is who I am.

763
00:44:33.870 --> 00:44:36.960
Take the side
of whoever knows my worth.

764
00:44:37.000 --> 00:44:38.170
[laughs]

765
00:44:39.090 --> 00:44:41.380
If the old geezer
really did die in agony.

766
00:44:41.420 --> 00:44:43.130
then I couldn't be happier.

767
00:44:43.180 --> 00:44:46.350
I slaved away
for that ungrateful bastard.

768
00:44:46.390 --> 00:44:48.640
And what does he do to repay me?

769
00:44:48.680 --> 00:44:50.520
He makes you my co-successor

770
00:44:50.560 --> 00:44:52.560
instead of just letting me
carry the torch!

771
00:44:52.600 --> 00:44:54.150
I hope he rots!

772
00:44:54.690 --> 00:44:56.810
Former Hashira or not.

773
00:44:56.860 --> 00:45:00.280
I would never shed a tear
over some senile geezer.

774
00:45:00.320 --> 00:45:03.110
[laughs boorishly]

775
00:45:05.450 --> 00:45:08.120
[ZENITSU] Gramps knew
exactly what he was doing.

776
00:45:08.620 --> 00:45:11.830
We were made co-successors
because we're weak.

777
00:45:11.870 --> 00:45:14.210
I was only able to use
the First Form

778
00:45:14.250 --> 00:45:17.080
while you could use
everything but First Form.

779
00:45:17.710 --> 00:45:19.750
I can't help
but feel sorry for Gramps

780
00:45:19.800 --> 00:45:22.220
that he has two
useless successors!

781
00:45:22.260 --> 00:45:24.090
[KAIGAKU]
Don't lump us together!

782
00:45:24.130 --> 00:45:26.220
I'm nothing like you!

783
00:45:26.720 --> 00:45:31.020
Thunder Breathing. Fourth Form:
Distant Thunder!

784
00:45:31.060 --> 00:45:33.230
[♪ intense dramatic music
playing]

785
00:45:34.520 --> 00:45:35.900
[gasps]

786
00:45:38.730 --> 00:45:41.030
You're so slow. scum.

787
00:45:41.070 --> 00:45:42.650
-[groans]
-[blood splatters]

788
00:45:46.610 --> 00:45:49.330
[KAIGAKU]
What the hell? He got me.

789
00:45:49.370 --> 00:45:50.990
His speed is unreal.

790
00:45:51.040 --> 00:45:53.580
He never moved like that.

791
00:45:53.620 --> 00:45:55.330
He's changed.

792
00:45:56.870 --> 00:45:59.170
But he's not the only one.

793
00:46:03.090 --> 00:46:05.220
[wet squelching]

794
00:46:09.640 --> 00:46:12.890
There's no shame in kneeling
down before the powerful

795
00:46:12.930 --> 00:46:14.430
if it means surviving.

796
00:46:14.930 --> 00:46:16.810
As long as you're alive.

797
00:46:16.850 --> 00:46:18.650
you can still win.

798
00:46:20.020 --> 00:46:23.190
Only once you die have you lost.

799
00:46:23.690 --> 00:46:26.990
Even if you have to beg
on your hands and knees.

800
00:46:27.530 --> 00:46:30.820
Even if you're without a home
and have to drink from a puddle.

801
00:46:31.280 --> 00:46:34.790
Even if they condemn you
for stealing money.

802
00:46:35.790 --> 00:46:37.120
As long as you're alive.

803
00:46:37.160 --> 00:46:39.540
there's still a future
where you can win.

804
00:46:40.040 --> 00:46:43.670
Believing that
is all that's kept me going.

805
00:46:45.630 --> 00:46:48.050
[KOKUSHIBO]
Forfeit your humanity

806
00:46:48.090 --> 00:46:51.640
and limitless power
will be within reach.

807
00:46:52.140 --> 00:46:55.310
Should my Lord
choose to acknowledge you.

808
00:46:55.350 --> 00:46:58.770
demon blood
shall course through your veins.

809
00:47:00.560 --> 00:47:01.900
[Kaigaku quivers]

810
00:47:02.570 --> 00:47:04.440
The stronger the swordsman.

811
00:47:04.480 --> 00:47:07.780
the longer it takes for him
to become a demon.

812
00:47:08.570 --> 00:47:12.240
It took me three days
to fully transform.

813
00:47:12.740 --> 00:47:15.580
Turning a breathing technique
user into a demon

814
00:47:15.620 --> 00:47:17.330
is no small feat.

815
00:47:17.370 --> 00:47:19.170
Doing such a thing will require

816
00:47:19.210 --> 00:47:22.040
an exorbitant amount
of my Lord's blood.

817
00:47:22.790 --> 00:47:24.750
And though it is rare.

818
00:47:24.800 --> 00:47:26.670
some people.
for whatever reason.

819
00:47:26.710 --> 00:47:29.220
are physically incapable
of becoming demons.

820
00:47:29.260 --> 00:47:30.260
Huh?

821
00:47:30.880 --> 00:47:33.850
[KOKUSHIBO] I'm curious to see
how you will fare.

822
00:47:33.890 --> 00:47:35.560
UPPER ONE

823
00:47:36.060 --> 00:47:37.220
[quivers]

824
00:47:37.270 --> 00:47:39.940
You must appreciate this blood.

825
00:47:39.980 --> 00:47:45.070
Even holding it as you are now
is an honor you cannot fathom.

826
00:47:45.110 --> 00:47:47.440
Should you spill a single drop.

827
00:47:47.490 --> 00:47:50.490
I'll have you dismembered
in an instant

828
00:47:50.530 --> 00:47:52.740
before it touches the ground.

829
00:47:52.780 --> 00:47:54.160
[gasps in horror]

830
00:47:54.870 --> 00:47:56.490
[breathing shakily]

831
00:47:58.000 --> 00:48:02.290
[KAIGAKU] Even now.
I remember the terror I felt.

832
00:48:02.330 --> 00:48:06.380
Like every cell in my body
was screaming in anguish.

833
00:48:08.960 --> 00:48:11.220
Compared to what I felt then.

834
00:48:11.260 --> 00:48:12.800
this is nothing.

835
00:48:12.840 --> 00:48:15.350
-He's just a punk.
-[clatters]

836
00:48:15.390 --> 00:48:16.810
He might be stronger.

837
00:48:16.850 --> 00:48:18.930
but he's not on par
with an Upper Rank.

838
00:48:19.810 --> 00:48:24.060
Zenitsu Agatsuma
is and always will be trash.

839
00:48:24.100 --> 00:48:26.020
He's a despicable crybaby

840
00:48:26.070 --> 00:48:28.570
without a shred of dignity
or valor!

841
00:48:28.610 --> 00:48:30.610
Somebody. help!

842
00:48:30.650 --> 00:48:35.160
I fell in a pitfall
and twisted my ankle!

843
00:48:35.830 --> 00:48:37.620
[KAIGAKU] The disrespect!

844
00:48:37.660 --> 00:48:41.370
As if I'd be co-successor
with that sniveling loser!

845
00:48:41.910 --> 00:48:43.830
[JIGORO] Here you are. Kaigaku.

846
00:48:44.380 --> 00:48:46.920
-[ZENITSU] Hey. Gramps?
-[KAIGAKU] Hmm?

847
00:48:46.960 --> 00:48:50.210
It looks a little big on me.
don't you think?

848
00:48:50.260 --> 00:48:52.510
-Maybe I'll grow into it...
-[KAIGAKU] I'm supposed to be

849
00:48:52.550 --> 00:48:55.090
-that idiot's equal?
-[both laughing]

850
00:48:56.220 --> 00:48:58.770
That's gotta be
some kind of sick joke!

851
00:48:58.810 --> 00:49:00.100
[seething]

852
00:49:00.600 --> 00:49:03.060
The old bastard deserved to die!

853
00:49:03.100 --> 00:49:05.350
And if you miss him so dearly.

854
00:49:05.400 --> 00:49:07.860
then I'll see to it
you join him!

855
00:49:09.150 --> 00:49:12.110
[ZENITSU] I was only ever able
to learn the First Form.

856
00:49:12.150 --> 00:49:15.990
However. you were able to learn
everything but the First Form.

857
00:49:17.200 --> 00:49:18.620
[♪ tender music playing]

858
00:49:18.660 --> 00:49:19.910
Gramps knew that.

859
00:49:20.450 --> 00:49:23.500
His solution
was having us both succeed

860
00:49:23.540 --> 00:49:25.290
the Thunder Breathing technique.

861
00:49:27.880 --> 00:49:29.590
But you denied him that.

862
00:49:30.210 --> 00:49:32.550
You became a demon

863
00:49:32.590 --> 00:49:34.590
purely to reject him.

864
00:49:35.550 --> 00:49:37.800
-[crackling]
-It's coming!

865
00:49:37.850 --> 00:49:40.680
Thunder Breathing. Second Form:

866
00:49:41.270 --> 00:49:42.640
Rice Spirit!

867
00:49:42.680 --> 00:49:44.770
[♪ dramatic synth music playing]

868
00:49:44.810 --> 00:49:47.560
[ZENITSU] He attacked five times
in one breath.

869
00:49:48.190 --> 00:49:50.440
-[Kaigaku yells]
-[effort grunts. strains]

870
00:49:50.480 --> 00:49:52.400
How many people
have you devoured?

871
00:49:52.440 --> 00:49:55.530
You can't even tell right
from wrong anymore!

872
00:49:55.570 --> 00:49:58.570
I'm more aware of those
than I've ever been!

873
00:49:59.780 --> 00:50:01.120
What's the matter?

874
00:50:01.200 --> 00:50:04.410
Aren't you supposed to be
the old geezer's favorite?

875
00:50:04.910 --> 00:50:06.500
-[grunts]
-If you are.

876
00:50:06.540 --> 00:50:08.670
then show me
what he passed down to you!

877
00:50:08.710 --> 00:50:12.210
It's the only technique
you've got. so use it!

878
00:50:12.250 --> 00:50:13.420
[Zenitsu grunts]

879
00:50:14.800 --> 00:50:17.890
Go all out.
Use everything you got.

880
00:50:17.930 --> 00:50:19.800
-[groans angrily]
-And don't you dare hold back

881
00:50:19.850 --> 00:50:22.180
-for a second!
-[determined grunt]

882
00:50:26.980 --> 00:50:28.560
[ZENITSU] Thunder Breathing...

883
00:50:30.940 --> 00:50:32.360
...First Form...

884
00:50:32.730 --> 00:50:33.730
[scoffs]

885
00:50:34.320 --> 00:50:36.240
...Thunderclap and Flash.

886
00:50:39.110 --> 00:50:40.570
[effort grunts]

887
00:50:40.620 --> 00:50:42.200
[laughs boisterously]

888
00:50:42.240 --> 00:50:45.580
As if a basic attack
like charging me head-on

889
00:50:45.620 --> 00:50:47.330
would ever find its mark.

890
00:50:47.370 --> 00:50:49.120
Don't make me laugh!

891
00:50:50.920 --> 00:50:52.590
Thunder Breathing.

892
00:50:52.630 --> 00:50:55.970
Third Form: Thunder Swarm!

893
00:50:58.180 --> 00:51:00.220
[grunting]

894
00:51:01.470 --> 00:51:03.890
[ZENITSU] He's attacking me
from every angle at once.

895
00:51:03.930 --> 00:51:05.350
[KAIGAKU] What's the matter?

896
00:51:05.390 --> 00:51:07.600
Don't tell me
you're done already!

897
00:51:08.810 --> 00:51:10.600
[ZENITSU]
Thunder Breathing. First Form:

898
00:51:10.650 --> 00:51:13.270
Thunderclap and Flash:
Eight Fold!

899
00:51:17.740 --> 00:51:20.320
-That's not gonna work!
-[Zenitsu grunts]

900
00:51:20.820 --> 00:51:23.950
Thunder Breathing. Fifth Form:

901
00:51:26.330 --> 00:51:27.870
Heat Lightning!

902
00:51:28.370 --> 00:51:30.830
-Ah!
-Gotcha!

903
00:51:31.500 --> 00:51:35.000
How does the bite of my Blood
Demon Art-enhanced sword feel?

904
00:51:35.050 --> 00:51:37.840
-[electricity crackling]
-Each strike on contact

905
00:51:37.880 --> 00:51:40.510
leaves a wound
that burns your skin.

906
00:51:41.090 --> 00:51:44.720
This proves those who recognize
my talents and value are right!

907
00:51:45.260 --> 00:51:48.520
And those that dismiss
or condemn me are wrong!

908
00:51:49.060 --> 00:51:52.810
Do you get it now?
This is the power I have!

909
00:51:53.310 --> 00:51:55.480
My power as a demon that is!

910
00:51:55.940 --> 00:51:58.150
All you know how to do
is use First Form.

911
00:51:58.190 --> 00:52:01.240
yet that geezer chose
to make you his successor!

912
00:52:01.280 --> 00:52:03.990
And. boy.
what a mistake that was!

913
00:52:10.290 --> 00:52:11.620
So. that's it.

914
00:52:11.670 --> 00:52:14.380
This is the path
that you've chosen to take.

915
00:52:15.880 --> 00:52:17.420
[weakly] I already knew.

916
00:52:18.090 --> 00:52:19.590
I knew. but...

917
00:52:21.510 --> 00:52:23.180
[sword scraping]

918
00:52:24.760 --> 00:52:27.720
With this strike. I'll end this.

919
00:52:27.770 --> 00:52:29.220
You're finished!

920
00:52:29.270 --> 00:52:30.940
-[crackling]
-Thunder Breathing...

921
00:52:30.980 --> 00:52:33.980
-[rumbling]
-...Sixth Form:

922
00:52:37.820 --> 00:52:41.110
-[crackling]
-[♪ music intensifies]

923
00:52:42.150 --> 00:52:44.820
Rumble and Flash!

924
00:52:44.870 --> 00:52:48.790
That strike I landed will keep
crackling through your flesh!

925
00:52:48.830 --> 00:52:52.790
This is the power that I gained
by becoming a demon.

926
00:52:52.830 --> 00:52:54.370
Get it now?

927
00:52:54.420 --> 00:52:56.920
I've long surpassed
Thunder Breathing!

928
00:52:58.710 --> 00:53:00.880
[laughs boisterously]

929
00:53:00.920 --> 00:53:02.630
You and I aren't equals.

930
00:53:02.680 --> 00:53:04.050
And we never have been.

931
00:53:04.590 --> 00:53:06.350
I'm better than all of you.

932
00:53:07.350 --> 00:53:08.600
Guess the old bastard

933
00:53:08.640 --> 00:53:10.770
shouldn't have put
his trust in you after all.

934
00:53:10.810 --> 00:53:13.600
[laughs boisterously]

935
00:53:15.310 --> 00:53:17.820
[JIGORO] Come on.
be more like Kaigaku!

936
00:53:18.320 --> 00:53:21.900
He's your senior.
so follow his example. you hear?

937
00:53:21.940 --> 00:53:24.160
Hang on. Isn't the First Form

938
00:53:24.200 --> 00:53:26.780
pretty much the entire basis
of Thunder Breathing?

939
00:53:26.820 --> 00:53:29.410
Yeah. and it's the only one
he can't do.

940
00:53:29.450 --> 00:53:31.700
You know what that means.
don't ya?

941
00:53:31.750 --> 00:53:34.040
That even though
he's mastered other forms.

942
00:53:34.080 --> 00:53:35.580
he's still a weakling.

943
00:53:35.620 --> 00:53:37.000
Yep. exactly.

944
00:53:37.040 --> 00:53:39.670
The way he shows off. though?
He's got such an ego.

945
00:53:39.710 --> 00:53:42.260
[BOY 1] No way
he becomes a Hashira.

946
00:53:42.300 --> 00:53:44.380
[BOY 2] Yeah.
he'll die before then.

947
00:53:44.420 --> 00:53:45.510
[♪ gentle music playing]

948
00:53:45.550 --> 00:53:47.640
What did I do to deserve that?

949
00:53:49.100 --> 00:53:51.970
I heard you went and punched
someone from a higher rank.

950
00:53:52.430 --> 00:53:55.350
Don't go around making trouble.
you trash!

951
00:53:55.390 --> 00:53:58.940
It's embarrassing even being
seen in the same room as you.

952
00:54:01.480 --> 00:54:04.740
[ZENITSU] I was fully aware
that you hated me. Kaigaku.

953
00:54:04.780 --> 00:54:08.570
And to be perfectly honest.
I hated you. too.

954
00:54:09.700 --> 00:54:13.700
Even so. I couldn't help
but respect you as well.

955
00:54:14.210 --> 00:54:17.370
You never stopped
working towards your goals.

956
00:54:18.210 --> 00:54:20.250
Despite our differences.

957
00:54:20.290 --> 00:54:22.710
I looked up to you
as an example.

958
00:54:23.210 --> 00:54:25.630
You really were a special guy.

959
00:54:27.220 --> 00:54:28.930
It wasn't just me.

960
00:54:28.970 --> 00:54:31.470
Gramps thought
you were remarkable. too.

961
00:54:32.470 --> 00:54:36.020
But I guess you weren't
satisfied with that. were you?

962
00:54:36.730 --> 00:54:38.400
No matter the day.

963
00:54:38.440 --> 00:54:42.480
the only sound that came
from you was discontent.

964
00:54:42.520 --> 00:54:43.730
[soft tinkling]

965
00:54:43.780 --> 00:54:46.740
It was like the box
where you kept your joy

966
00:54:46.780 --> 00:54:48.200
had a hole in it.

967
00:54:49.820 --> 00:54:52.410
And that joy kept leaking out.

968
00:54:53.830 --> 00:54:55.830
If the hole isn't mended.

969
00:54:56.290 --> 00:54:58.920
happiness will always be
out of reach.

970
00:55:01.330 --> 00:55:04.500
Gramps.
I'm sorry we're fighting...

971
00:55:05.460 --> 00:55:06.880
...but he and I

972
00:55:07.510 --> 00:55:09.930
must walk separate paths.

973
00:55:16.060 --> 00:55:18.230
-[clangs]
-[crackling]

974
00:55:19.440 --> 00:55:20.600
[KAIGAKU] Huh?

975
00:55:21.150 --> 00:55:23.230
He's still holding on?

976
00:55:23.270 --> 00:55:24.360
[electricity crackling]

977
00:55:24.400 --> 00:55:27.070
[♪ synth music playing]

978
00:55:31.280 --> 00:55:32.490
[power surging]

979
00:55:32.530 --> 00:55:33.950
What the hell?

980
00:55:42.540 --> 00:55:43.710
[ZENITSU] Brother...

981
00:55:44.590 --> 00:55:46.800
-...I'm sorry.
-[gasps]

982
00:55:47.380 --> 00:55:49.550
[♪ music intensifies]

983
00:56:05.650 --> 00:56:09.360
Thunder Breathing. Seventh Form:

984
00:56:09.400 --> 00:56:11.030
[roaring]

985
00:56:12.280 --> 00:56:14.530
God of Fire Thunder.

986
00:56:21.710 --> 00:56:23.210
[KAIGAKU] That...

987
00:56:23.540 --> 00:56:25.290
was so fast.

988
00:56:25.790 --> 00:56:28.170
That move. What was it?

989
00:56:28.550 --> 00:56:30.170
Unbelievable.

990
00:56:30.220 --> 00:56:33.090
How come I've never seen
that technique until now?

991
00:56:34.010 --> 00:56:36.640
Damn you. Damn you!

992
00:56:36.680 --> 00:56:39.850
I always knew that stupid geezer
liked you more than me!

993
00:56:39.890 --> 00:56:42.850
Why else would he only
teach you that technique?!

994
00:56:42.900 --> 00:56:44.730
You're wrong.

995
00:56:44.770 --> 00:56:45.860
[gasps]

996
00:56:45.900 --> 00:56:46.900
[♪ gentle music playing]

997
00:56:47.190 --> 00:56:49.320
[ZENITSU] Gramps was never
that kind of person.

998
00:56:50.400 --> 00:56:53.030
This technique
is something I made.

999
00:56:53.660 --> 00:56:56.700
I created it all by myself.

1000
00:56:57.620 --> 00:56:58.910
My hope was...

1001
00:56:59.910 --> 00:57:04.960
...that one day. I'd be able
to use it to fight by your side.

1002
00:57:08.420 --> 00:57:11.130
[KAIGAKU]
How is this even possible?

1003
00:57:11.670 --> 00:57:14.340
Thunder Breathing
only has six techniques.

1004
00:57:14.390 --> 00:57:17.350
and yet he was able
to create a seventh?

1005
00:57:18.100 --> 00:57:21.850
Him? The one who can only
use the First Form?

1006
00:57:23.140 --> 00:57:26.150
He's inferior to me
in every way!

1007
00:57:26.190 --> 00:57:27.560
[groans angrily]

1008
00:57:27.610 --> 00:57:30.650
I can't accept it.
I won't accept it!

1009
00:57:30.690 --> 00:57:33.530
This must be
some kind of twisted joke!

1010
00:57:33.570 --> 00:57:37.200
Someone like me losing to him?

1011
00:57:38.120 --> 00:57:40.740
I must be going insane!

1012
00:57:42.370 --> 00:57:43.540
Wait!

1013
00:57:44.460 --> 00:57:46.380
With his strength depleted.

1014
00:57:46.420 --> 00:57:48.790
I can still have the last laugh.

1015
00:57:48.840 --> 00:57:51.630
This fall will kill him
and he can't stop it.

1016
00:57:52.340 --> 00:57:56.430
I'll be taking him to hell
with me. [laughs maliciously]

1017
00:57:56.470 --> 00:57:58.220
[YUSHIRO]
Those who never give to others

1018
00:57:58.260 --> 00:58:00.680
are never able to receive
in return.

1019
00:58:00.720 --> 00:58:01.850
Huh?

1020
00:58:02.560 --> 00:58:04.440
People who have
nothing but desire

1021
00:58:04.480 --> 00:58:07.020
are no different than those
who have nothing at all.

1022
00:58:07.520 --> 00:58:10.900
And one cannot create anything
out of nothing.

1023
00:58:11.860 --> 00:58:14.740
Dying alone is pathetic.
wouldn't you say?

1024
00:58:20.910 --> 00:58:22.620
[screaming in anguish]

1025
00:58:22.660 --> 00:58:24.410
[fizzles out]

1026
00:58:32.920 --> 00:58:34.300
[gasps]

1027
00:58:34.340 --> 00:58:36.380
-[birds chirping]
-[leaves rustling]

1028
00:58:37.050 --> 00:58:38.140
Where am I?

1029
00:58:38.180 --> 00:58:40.300
-[stream trickling]
-[birds chirping]

1030
00:58:45.350 --> 00:58:46.640
[gasps]

1031
00:58:46.690 --> 00:58:48.100
Gramps!

1032
00:58:48.690 --> 00:58:50.810
[♪ tender music playing]

1033
00:58:50.860 --> 00:58:52.020
I'm sorry!

1034
00:58:52.070 --> 00:58:54.690
I... I couldn't get along
with Kaigaku!

1035
00:58:54.730 --> 00:58:57.740
I even tried
writing him letters. but...

1036
00:58:57.780 --> 00:59:00.450
But he never wrote me back.
And... [sobs]

1037
00:59:00.490 --> 00:59:01.910
...if it weren't for me.

1038
00:59:01.950 --> 00:59:04.080
he might not have ended up
the way he did.

1039
00:59:04.540 --> 00:59:06.000
I'm really sorry!

1040
00:59:06.040 --> 00:59:07.290
Forgive me!

1041
00:59:07.330 --> 00:59:10.380
I wasn't able to pay you back
for everything!

1042
00:59:10.420 --> 00:59:13.460
I really wanted you
to see me as a Hashira.

1043
00:59:13.500 --> 00:59:15.300
to make you proud.

1044
00:59:15.340 --> 00:59:16.720
I'm sorry.

1045
00:59:16.760 --> 00:59:18.510
I failed you. Gramps!

1046
00:59:21.430 --> 00:59:24.470
[sobbing] I understand
if you hate me now.

1047
00:59:25.100 --> 00:59:27.770
Please. just say something.
Anything!

1048
00:59:27.810 --> 00:59:29.140
[effort grunting]

1049
00:59:29.690 --> 00:59:32.860
Damn it! What's this
grabbing my leg?

1050
00:59:34.110 --> 00:59:36.150
Gramps! I just...

1051
00:59:36.190 --> 00:59:38.530
I need-- [grunts]

1052
00:59:39.990 --> 00:59:41.160
Damn it!

1053
00:59:41.200 --> 00:59:43.240
[effort grunting]

1054
00:59:43.280 --> 00:59:44.780
[JIGORO] Zenitsu.

1055
00:59:44.830 --> 00:59:45.870
[Zenitsu gasps softly]

1056
00:59:52.380 --> 00:59:56.300
Listen to me. lad.
You are my pride and joy.

1057
01:00:14.770 --> 01:00:16.280
[♪ music fades]

1058
01:00:19.450 --> 01:00:21.860
[MURATA] Well? Can you save him?

1059
01:00:21.910 --> 01:00:23.660
He's someone that I know.

1060
01:00:23.700 --> 01:00:26.700
I can't watch him die.
Please tell me there's a way!

1061
01:00:26.740 --> 01:00:29.000
Keep your voice down.
You're not helping.

1062
01:00:29.040 --> 01:00:31.710
Just watch out
for enemy ambushes.

1063
01:00:31.750 --> 01:00:34.130
At least then you'll actually be
doing something useful.

1064
01:00:34.170 --> 01:00:35.540
[grunting angrily]

1065
01:00:35.590 --> 01:00:38.510
Excuse me? And just
who the hell are you. huh?

1066
01:00:38.550 --> 01:00:41.130
I better not find out
you're a lower rank than I am!

1067
01:00:41.170 --> 01:00:44.800
I'm a demon. I don't care
about your hierarchy.

1068
01:00:45.600 --> 01:00:47.850
This'll slow
the Blood Demon Art.

1069
01:00:47.890 --> 01:00:49.770
But if these cracks
keep spreading.

1070
01:00:49.810 --> 01:00:52.270
it'll travel all the way
to his eyes.

1071
01:00:52.980 --> 01:00:54.520
Hey. can you hear me?

1072
01:00:55.020 --> 01:00:56.230
[groans]

1073
01:00:56.940 --> 01:00:58.650
[all three exclaim]

1074
01:00:58.690 --> 01:01:01.450
Your bedside manner
really sucks. you know that?

1075
01:01:01.490 --> 01:01:03.200
I'm also using a hemostatic.

1076
01:01:03.240 --> 01:01:05.120
but I still can't get
the bleeding to stop.

1077
01:01:05.160 --> 01:01:06.120
What did I say?!

1078
01:01:06.330 --> 01:01:08.490
Don't listen to him.
You're gonna be fine.

1079
01:01:08.540 --> 01:01:09.950
I swear
you'll pull through this!

1080
01:01:10.000 --> 01:01:11.330
Yeah. you can do it!

1081
01:01:11.370 --> 01:01:13.370
Fight on! Fight on!

1082
01:01:13.420 --> 01:01:15.380
The only reason
you're alive right now

1083
01:01:15.420 --> 01:01:16.960
is because
the Upper Rank you fought

1084
01:01:17.000 --> 01:01:19.340
still hadn't mastered
his own techniques.

1085
01:01:19.840 --> 01:01:21.800
That was lucky for you.

1086
01:01:22.340 --> 01:01:23.970
If you'd fought him
a year from now.

1087
01:01:24.010 --> 01:01:25.840
you would have died instantly.

1088
01:01:26.510 --> 01:01:27.720
[Murata groaning]

1089
01:01:27.760 --> 01:01:29.600
Could you stop
with the doom and gloom?

1090
01:01:29.640 --> 01:01:31.720
Consider his feelings!

1091
01:01:31.770 --> 01:01:34.100
[breathing heavily]

1092
01:01:38.270 --> 01:01:41.440
Hey. don't pretend like
I'm the one in the wrong here.

1093
01:01:43.360 --> 01:01:45.070
What? What are you pointing at?

1094
01:01:45.110 --> 01:01:47.660
[YUSHIRO] Your screaming let
the demons know we're here.

1095
01:01:47.700 --> 01:01:49.620
[all screaming]

1096
01:01:49.660 --> 01:01:51.160
Don't say I didn't warn you.

1097
01:01:51.200 --> 01:01:52.620
[snarling]

1098
01:01:52.660 --> 01:01:56.540
Hey. it was Yushiro. right?
Take care of Agatsuma!

1099
01:01:57.080 --> 01:01:58.880
-Charge!
-[all grunting]

1100
01:02:00.670 --> 01:02:03.670
Murata. please take care of them
quickly. okay?

1101
01:02:03.710 --> 01:02:05.880
I'm gonna give you
such an earful later!

1102
01:02:05.930 --> 01:02:08.180
-Damn.
-[demon snarling]

1103
01:02:08.890 --> 01:02:11.260
Water Breathing. Second Form:

1104
01:02:11.310 --> 01:02:14.390
Water Wheel! [yells]

1105
01:02:15.770 --> 01:02:17.230
We're gonna head them off.

1106
01:02:17.270 --> 01:02:18.860
Follow my lead. everyone!

1107
01:02:18.900 --> 01:02:21.110
[all yelling]

1108
01:02:21.150 --> 01:02:22.780
-[footsteps receding]
-[grunts]

1109
01:02:28.870 --> 01:02:31.030
[♪ foreboding music playing]

1110
01:02:35.790 --> 01:02:37.210
This is bad.

1111
01:02:37.250 --> 01:02:38.960
They're gonna run into "him."

1112
01:02:42.170 --> 01:02:44.460
[TANJIRO] We haven't encountered
any Upper Ranks.

1113
01:02:44.920 --> 01:02:47.380
Are we still that far
from Muzan?

1114
01:02:47.430 --> 01:02:49.470
I hope the others are all right.

1115
01:02:52.680 --> 01:02:54.180
Miss Shinobu...

1116
01:02:55.020 --> 01:02:57.190
we're going to win this battle.

1117
01:02:57.230 --> 01:02:59.980
For you. For everyone!

1118
01:03:01.150 --> 01:03:02.730
-[loud crash]
-[gasps]

1119
01:03:02.770 --> 01:03:04.780
That jolt! What was that?

1120
01:03:05.280 --> 01:03:06.490
Mr. Giyu!

1121
01:03:06.530 --> 01:03:07.530
Stay there!

1122
01:03:07.950 --> 01:03:09.780
-Keep calm.
-[grunts]

1123
01:03:11.160 --> 01:03:13.120
[TANJIRO]
Is someone else fighting?

1124
01:03:13.160 --> 01:03:15.290
Are we about to lose
another comrade?

1125
01:03:15.330 --> 01:03:17.540
-[♪ intriguing music playing]
-[loud thuds]

1126
01:03:21.210 --> 01:03:24.170
No. it's something else.

1127
01:03:24.210 --> 01:03:25.760
And it's coming this way.

1128
01:03:26.760 --> 01:03:27.880
[sniffs]

1129
01:03:28.340 --> 01:03:30.760
This... This scent.

1130
01:03:39.390 --> 01:03:41.690
[GIYU] Above us!
Get back. Tanjiro!

1131
01:03:42.560 --> 01:03:43.690
[grunts]

1132
01:03:45.780 --> 01:03:47.780
[DEMON] Long time no see.

1133
01:03:49.400 --> 01:03:52.240
It's commendable
you got this far.

1134
01:03:52.820 --> 01:03:55.330
Especially for a puny insect.

1135
01:03:55.370 --> 01:03:56.450
UPPER THREE

1136
01:03:56.950 --> 01:03:59.830
Don't you agree. Tanjiro?!

1137
01:03:59.870 --> 01:04:01.120
[Tanjiro seething]

1138
01:04:02.250 --> 01:04:05.000
Akaza!

1139
01:04:07.010 --> 01:04:09.170
[♪ low tense music playing]

1140
01:04:12.680 --> 01:04:14.220
[heavy burbling]

1141
01:04:30.700 --> 01:04:32.820
[breathing heavily]

1142
01:04:37.580 --> 01:04:40.330
[TAMAYO] This place...
If I had to guess.

1143
01:04:40.370 --> 01:04:42.500
this fleshy cocoon
is breaking down

1144
01:04:42.540 --> 01:04:43.790
and disposing the drug

1145
01:04:43.830 --> 01:04:46.840
that's rescinding
his demon form.

1146
01:04:47.460 --> 01:04:49.300
Muzan Kibutsuji.

1147
01:04:49.340 --> 01:04:54.010
I had sworn to destroy you
by any means necessary.

1148
01:04:54.590 --> 01:04:58.850
Yet. at this moment.
I am powerless to do so.

1149
01:04:59.560 --> 01:05:00.890
[loud thump]

1150
01:05:00.930 --> 01:05:02.600
[grunting]

1151
01:05:06.110 --> 01:05:10.070
Soon enough.
I'll be absorbed as well.

1152
01:05:10.860 --> 01:05:13.570
Please. someone. Anyone!

1153
01:05:13.610 --> 01:05:15.280
Come quickly!

1154
01:05:15.990 --> 01:05:17.620
I beg you!

1155
01:05:20.620 --> 01:05:22.750
[fight grunts]

1156
01:05:24.540 --> 01:05:26.710
[♪ intense music playing]

1157
01:05:31.920 --> 01:05:35.010
[KIRIYA] According to Father.
if Muzan should die.

1158
01:05:35.050 --> 01:05:37.510
the other demons
will also perish.

1159
01:05:38.720 --> 01:05:42.680
By that logic. it's clear
that Muzan is still alive.

1160
01:05:43.980 --> 01:05:45.480
At this very moment.

1161
01:05:45.520 --> 01:05:48.440
Ms. Tamayo must be
suppressing his powers.

1162
01:05:49.360 --> 01:05:50.690
If she weren't.

1163
01:05:51.230 --> 01:05:54.150
he would surely be aware
of Yushiro's watchful gaze.

1164
01:05:55.200 --> 01:05:57.820
Before Muzan's powers
are fully restored.

1165
01:05:57.870 --> 01:06:01.240
we must do whatever it takes
to see that he's defeated.

1166
01:06:03.080 --> 01:06:04.500
I have to wonder. though.

1167
01:06:04.540 --> 01:06:07.960
inside of this
infinite castle...

1168
01:06:08.920 --> 01:06:11.300
...will we really
be able to find him

1169
01:06:11.340 --> 01:06:13.090
and put an end to it all?

1170
01:06:18.430 --> 01:06:20.430
No need to be nervous.

1171
01:06:21.010 --> 01:06:23.390
You're doing a fine job.
my child.

1172
01:06:25.350 --> 01:06:28.560
Muzan will surely reveal himself
once more.

1173
01:06:29.270 --> 01:06:31.780
just as he did when he found me.

1174
01:06:33.980 --> 01:06:38.700
When it comes to this man.
that's simply his nature.

1175
01:06:39.450 --> 01:06:40.780
[gasps]

1176
01:06:44.250 --> 01:06:46.040
[KIRIYA] I understand. Father.

1177
01:06:46.750 --> 01:06:49.420
I will see to it
our plan succeeds.

1178
01:06:50.840 --> 01:06:53.460
We must find him before
the Corps members' strength

1179
01:06:53.510 --> 01:06:54.670
is fully depleted.

1180
01:06:54.710 --> 01:06:57.090
and settle this
once and for all.

1181
01:06:57.470 --> 01:06:58.640
[Gyomei grunts]

1182
01:07:03.180 --> 01:07:04.310
[distorted grunting]

1183
01:07:07.480 --> 01:07:09.650
-[grunting]
-[KAKUSHI 1] Protect them!

1184
01:07:09.690 --> 01:07:11.150
[KAKUSHI 2] Everybody. group up!

1185
01:07:11.190 --> 01:07:12.570
We have to form a wall!

1186
01:07:12.610 --> 01:07:14.610
Get their attention
off the Hashira!

1187
01:07:14.650 --> 01:07:17.070
Please. sir!
Go on ahead without us!

1188
01:07:17.610 --> 01:07:19.660
You as well! We got this!

1189
01:07:19.700 --> 01:07:20.990
Are you certain?

1190
01:07:21.620 --> 01:07:23.990
-[both grunting]
-[groans]

1191
01:07:25.580 --> 01:07:26.870
[thuds]

1192
01:07:29.330 --> 01:07:32.040
We are!
Just defeat Kibutsuji!

1193
01:07:32.080 --> 01:07:33.420
Please. sir!

1194
01:07:34.000 --> 01:07:35.420
Very well. then.

1195
01:07:35.460 --> 01:07:38.260
I will put my faith
in your efforts here.

1196
01:07:38.300 --> 01:07:39.470
Tokito!

1197
01:07:41.140 --> 01:07:42.390
[KAKUSHI 1] All right!

1198
01:07:42.510 --> 01:07:45.390
Let's show them the fruits
of our Hashira training!

1199
01:07:45.430 --> 01:07:46.730
[ALL] Right!

1200
01:07:46.770 --> 01:07:48.890
[♪ epic cinematic music playing]

1201
01:07:50.350 --> 01:07:52.520
[fight grunts]

1202
01:07:53.860 --> 01:07:56.190
[KIRIYA] Everyone. thank you.

1203
01:07:56.690 --> 01:07:59.860
I know Father would be proud
to see you giving it your all.

1204
01:08:05.490 --> 01:08:07.660
[♪ melancholic music playing]

1205
01:08:10.330 --> 01:08:12.580
-[whimpering]
-[KIRIYA] Stop that!

1206
01:08:13.290 --> 01:08:15.210
You must keep your hands moving.

1207
01:08:15.800 --> 01:08:18.010
Right now. we need to focus.

1208
01:08:19.760 --> 01:08:20.880
[KANATA] Yes.

1209
01:08:24.140 --> 01:08:27.390
Master Kiriya
is quite impressive.

1210
01:08:28.520 --> 01:08:30.270
It's clear
he's still in mourning

1211
01:08:30.310 --> 01:08:32.100
over the loss of the Master.

1212
01:08:32.140 --> 01:08:34.360
yet his duty is unwavering.

1213
01:08:35.020 --> 01:08:38.400
He's led the Demon Slayer Corps
rather splendidly.

1214
01:08:39.860 --> 01:08:42.740
Wouldn't you agree. Mr. Rengoku?

1215
01:08:43.700 --> 01:08:45.320
I would. indeed.

1216
01:08:46.700 --> 01:08:49.450
These children
are still young in years.

1217
01:08:49.500 --> 01:08:52.620
but their resolve
is anything but childish.

1218
01:08:53.790 --> 01:08:55.840
I swear to protect them.

1219
01:08:56.380 --> 01:08:58.840
Just as Kyojuro did before me.

1220
01:08:59.340 --> 01:09:01.880
I will risk my own life
to do so.

1221
01:09:06.180 --> 01:09:08.560
[Nezuko whimpers in pain]

1222
01:09:15.190 --> 01:09:18.230
[SAKONJI] I didn't think
she would suffer this much.

1223
01:09:19.320 --> 01:09:22.780
The Master was working
with a demon named Tamayo

1224
01:09:22.820 --> 01:09:25.280
who delivered this antidote.

1225
01:09:25.320 --> 01:09:28.330
I've administered it
as she instructed.

1226
01:09:29.580 --> 01:09:31.080
Even so.

1227
01:09:31.120 --> 01:09:35.460
will Nezuko be able to turn
back into a human. I wonder?

1228
01:09:35.960 --> 01:09:39.170
If Nezuko
does become human again.

1229
01:09:39.210 --> 01:09:42.550
Muzan's grand scheme
will collapse.

1230
01:09:42.590 --> 01:09:44.050
His thousand-year quest

1231
01:09:44.090 --> 01:09:46.640
for a vessel
which can resist the sun

1232
01:09:46.680 --> 01:09:48.300
will be no more.

1233
01:09:48.810 --> 01:09:51.640
And all of the progress
he's made

1234
01:09:51.680 --> 01:09:54.310
will be wound back like a clock.

1235
01:09:55.850 --> 01:09:59.860
In the many years that we've had
to endure this nightmare.

1236
01:09:59.900 --> 01:10:01.940
Nezuko is the only demon

1237
01:10:01.990 --> 01:10:04.860
who has been able
to live in the sunlight.

1238
01:10:04.900 --> 01:10:07.070
[♪ melancholic music playing]

1239
01:10:10.160 --> 01:10:12.290
[heart beating]

1240
01:10:13.580 --> 01:10:15.080
[inhales deeply]

1241
01:10:16.330 --> 01:10:17.790
[sighs wearily]

1242
01:10:20.590 --> 01:10:22.630
"The final battle."

1243
01:10:22.670 --> 01:10:25.840
These words
echo in my mind.

1244
01:10:27.680 --> 01:10:28.970
[gulps. sighs]

1245
01:10:29.510 --> 01:10:31.260
And each time they do.

1246
01:10:31.310 --> 01:10:34.680
I can't help but tremble
as my heart beats louder.

1247
01:10:35.690 --> 01:10:40.070
This battle may finally
reach its conclusion tonight.

1248
01:10:40.940 --> 01:10:45.610
I never dreamed that I'd be
alive to witness it myself.

1249
01:10:46.820 --> 01:10:48.280
Tanjiro.

1250
01:10:48.320 --> 01:10:50.780
I sometimes
think back to the day

1251
01:10:50.830 --> 01:10:53.620
when you brought
your demon sister to me.

1252
01:10:54.040 --> 01:10:55.910
Ever since then.

1253
01:10:55.960 --> 01:11:00.380
it feels like a giant wheel
of fate has been slowly turning.

1254
01:11:01.460 --> 01:11:05.460
Perhaps it would be best to
compare the sum of our battles

1255
01:11:05.510 --> 01:11:08.300
to a giant dormant machine.

1256
01:11:08.340 --> 01:11:12.430
You and Nezuko are the small
cogs that have joined together

1257
01:11:12.470 --> 01:11:14.430
and awoken it from its slumber.

1258
01:11:15.020 --> 01:11:19.980
What was once frozen in place
has now been set into motion.

1259
01:11:20.020 --> 01:11:22.190
[♪ intriguing music playing]

1260
01:11:22.690 --> 01:11:25.990
-[moaning]
-Don't give up. Nezuko.

1261
01:11:27.490 --> 01:11:30.070
Keep up the fight. Tanjiro.

1262
01:11:30.780 --> 01:11:33.950
You both have to pull through.
no matter what!

1263
01:11:34.490 --> 01:11:36.160
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:

1264
01:11:36.700 --> 01:11:37.750
Fire Wheel!

1265
01:11:37.790 --> 01:11:39.920
[♪ epic dramatic music playing]

1266
01:11:40.460 --> 01:11:41.880
Go through!

1267
01:11:42.000 --> 01:11:44.800
If I can't even sever his arm.
I'll never sever his head!

1268
01:11:44.840 --> 01:11:47.050
[yelling]

1269
01:11:47.840 --> 01:11:49.090
[flesh squelches]

1270
01:11:49.550 --> 01:11:51.050
[blood splatters]

1271
01:11:51.090 --> 01:11:52.050
DESTROY

1272
01:11:52.100 --> 01:11:53.220
I got one.

1273
01:11:53.390 --> 01:11:55.310
I was able
to dodge his attack. too.

1274
01:11:55.350 --> 01:11:56.720
I can do this!

1275
01:11:57.230 --> 01:11:58.850
I couldn't aim for his head.

1276
01:11:58.890 --> 01:12:00.440
but this time. for sure!

1277
01:12:01.560 --> 01:12:04.070
Hinokami Kagura: Fake Rainbow!

1278
01:12:04.110 --> 01:12:05.150
[fizzles out]

1279
01:12:07.400 --> 01:12:09.240
[high-pitched ringing]

1280
01:12:11.360 --> 01:12:13.320
-[panting]
-[sword clatters]

1281
01:12:14.830 --> 01:12:16.790
[flesh squelching]

1282
01:12:16.830 --> 01:12:18.290
Huh?

1283
01:12:19.750 --> 01:12:20.960
[GIYU] Tanjiro.

1284
01:12:21.460 --> 01:12:23.960
You've really sharpened
your skills. haven't you?

1285
01:12:24.880 --> 01:12:26.630
It wouldn't be an exaggeration

1286
01:12:26.670 --> 01:12:29.380
to say he's at the level
of a Hashira now.

1287
01:12:30.590 --> 01:12:34.760
To think that he'd do this well
against Upper Three.

1288
01:12:34.800 --> 01:12:36.970
[♪ enchanting folk music
playing]

1289
01:12:40.060 --> 01:12:41.310
That day...

1290
01:12:42.270 --> 01:12:45.060
...I remember a boy
who felt completely helpless

1291
01:12:45.520 --> 01:12:47.780
as he collapsed
onto the cold snow.

1292
01:12:48.280 --> 01:12:51.070
begging through tears
for his sister's life.

1293
01:12:58.870 --> 01:13:01.000
But you are helpless no longer.

1294
01:13:01.500 --> 01:13:04.330
You have the strength
to fight not only for your life.

1295
01:13:04.830 --> 01:13:07.130
but also
for what's precious to you.

1296
01:13:08.800 --> 01:13:11.340
[AKAZA] "This boy is not weak.

1297
01:13:11.380 --> 01:13:13.130
Don't insult him."

1298
01:13:13.930 --> 01:13:17.430
I must admit that Kyojuro
was right when he said that.

1299
01:13:17.930 --> 01:13:20.850
You are certainly not weak.

1300
01:13:20.890 --> 01:13:23.600
In fact. I commend you.

1301
01:13:26.360 --> 01:13:28.770
Technique Development...

1302
01:13:28.820 --> 01:13:30.990
[♪ intense rock music playing]

1303
01:13:32.950 --> 01:13:36.280
Now. let's kick things off.
shall we?

1304
01:13:36.910 --> 01:13:39.040
It's time we had some fun.

1305
01:13:44.620 --> 01:13:46.670
-[rumbling]
-[heavy creaking]

1306
01:14:07.480 --> 01:14:08.730
[exhales sharply]

1307
01:14:15.070 --> 01:14:16.660
[grunts]

1308
01:14:25.420 --> 01:14:28.460
[GIYU]
Water Breathing. Third Form:

1309
01:14:28.500 --> 01:14:30.090
Flowing Dance!

1310
01:14:31.000 --> 01:14:32.960
You're a Water Hashira.

1311
01:14:33.010 --> 01:14:34.840
How lucky for me!

1312
01:14:34.880 --> 01:14:37.640
It's been 50 years
since I fought one.

1313
01:14:41.890 --> 01:14:43.520
[debris clattering]

1314
01:14:45.390 --> 01:14:49.060
Destructive Death: Disorder!

1315
01:14:50.860 --> 01:14:53.570
Water Breathing. Eleventh Form:

1316
01:14:54.320 --> 01:14:55.740
Dead Calm.

1317
01:15:00.660 --> 01:15:03.370
[AKAZA] I've never seen
that move before.

1318
01:15:03.910 --> 01:15:06.120
Perhaps the last
Water Hashira I killed

1319
01:15:06.160 --> 01:15:08.290
never had a chance to use it!

1320
01:15:08.330 --> 01:15:11.500
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:
Raging Sun!

1321
01:15:13.670 --> 01:15:14.960
He vanished!

1322
01:15:15.710 --> 01:15:16.920
Behind me!

1323
01:15:16.970 --> 01:15:18.510
Fake Rain Kagura!

1324
01:15:19.840 --> 01:15:24.180
[GIYU] Water Breathing.
Second Form: Water Wheel.

1325
01:15:27.640 --> 01:15:28.690
[yells]

1326
01:15:36.570 --> 01:15:38.610
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:

1327
01:15:39.740 --> 01:15:40.820
Flame Dance!

1328
01:15:41.200 --> 01:15:44.950
[AKAZA] Destructive Death.
Leg Type: Crown Splitter!

1329
01:15:45.620 --> 01:15:48.160
[TANJIRO]
I blocked it with my sword.

1330
01:15:52.460 --> 01:15:54.630
His move barely grazed me

1331
01:15:54.670 --> 01:15:56.920
and still did
this kind of damage?

1332
01:16:01.300 --> 01:16:03.140
[AKAZA] How marvelous!

1333
01:16:04.470 --> 01:16:08.230
That elegant sword skill
you're using is magnificent!

1334
01:16:08.270 --> 01:16:11.100
I must know now.
What is your name?

1335
01:16:11.150 --> 01:16:12.980
I want to remember you!

1336
01:16:15.070 --> 01:16:18.110
I don't have a name
to give to a demon like you.

1337
01:16:18.150 --> 01:16:21.030
I hate talking.
so don't speak to me!

1338
01:16:21.820 --> 01:16:23.200
Is that so?

1339
01:16:23.240 --> 01:16:25.950
You're not much
for small talk. are you?

1340
01:16:25.990 --> 01:16:30.210
Well. I happen to quite
enjoy it. so I'll ask you again.

1341
01:16:30.790 --> 01:16:32.290
What is your name?

1342
01:16:32.330 --> 01:16:34.460
[grunting]

1343
01:16:35.670 --> 01:16:37.760
-[impact grunts]
-[crumbles]

1344
01:16:38.590 --> 01:16:41.800
[AKAZA]
Destructive Death. Leg Type:

1345
01:16:41.840 --> 01:16:44.100
Explosive Flurry!

1346
01:16:47.850 --> 01:16:50.230
[yelling]

1347
01:16:55.770 --> 01:16:58.190
-[impact grunts]
-[TANJIRO] Mr. Giyu!

1348
01:16:59.740 --> 01:17:02.360
I see. That's his name.

1349
01:17:02.410 --> 01:17:04.240
Thank you for letting me know.

1350
01:17:07.740 --> 01:17:09.370
Hinokami Kagura!

1351
01:17:09.410 --> 01:17:12.500
Destructive Death:
Eight-Layered Demon Core!

1352
01:17:12.540 --> 01:17:14.830
Burning Bones. Summer Sun!

1353
01:17:21.380 --> 01:17:23.220
[panting]

1354
01:17:29.770 --> 01:17:31.640
[AKAZA] Excellent form!

1355
01:17:31.680 --> 01:17:35.610
To improve this much in such
a short time is impressive.

1356
01:17:35.650 --> 01:17:37.690
I'll give you my praise.

1357
01:17:37.730 --> 01:17:39.480
It seems obvious to me

1358
01:17:39.530 --> 01:17:42.450
that Kyojuro must have
really inspired you.

1359
01:17:42.490 --> 01:17:46.780
The night we met. you were
merely a weak. mournful child.

1360
01:17:46.820 --> 01:17:48.450
crumpled on the ground.

1361
01:17:48.490 --> 01:17:50.910
Not even worthy of being killed.

1362
01:17:50.950 --> 01:17:53.000
-But just look at you now!
-[cracking]

1363
01:17:53.040 --> 01:17:57.130
This leap in your abilities.
it's like you've been reborn!

1364
01:17:57.170 --> 01:17:59.460
My heart won't stop racing.

1365
01:17:59.500 --> 01:18:01.840
I'm truly overjoyed!

1366
01:18:01.880 --> 01:18:03.630
[snickers]

1367
01:18:04.380 --> 01:18:08.260
The night Kyojuro died.
I was glad that it happened.

1368
01:18:09.390 --> 01:18:10.350
[exclaims in disbelief]

1369
01:18:10.890 --> 01:18:12.350
How tragic would it have been

1370
01:18:12.390 --> 01:18:14.560
if he had never gotten
any stronger.

1371
01:18:15.230 --> 01:18:17.400
Such a stubborn man.
not letting go

1372
01:18:17.440 --> 01:18:20.530
of those worthless values
of staying human.

1373
01:18:21.780 --> 01:18:23.530
How dare you!

1374
01:18:30.660 --> 01:18:33.620
Shut up! Just shut up!

1375
01:18:37.420 --> 01:18:40.460
Don't you dare
even speak his name!

1376
01:18:41.550 --> 01:18:42.840
[AKAZA] What's the matter?

1377
01:18:42.880 --> 01:18:45.380
I'm only paying the man
a compliment.

1378
01:18:45.420 --> 01:18:47.220
I'm being sincere.

1379
01:18:47.260 --> 01:18:49.180
These are high words of praise.

1380
01:18:49.220 --> 01:18:50.350
[TANJIRO] You're wrong.

1381
01:18:50.390 --> 01:18:52.640
All you're doing
is insulting him!

1382
01:18:52.680 --> 01:18:55.230
You're just spitting
on his memory!

1383
01:18:55.270 --> 01:18:56.890
On all of us!

1384
01:18:57.900 --> 01:19:00.610
You couldn't be
more wrong. Tanjiro.

1385
01:19:00.650 --> 01:19:05.320
As you'll recall. the only thing
I despise is weak human beings.

1386
01:19:05.820 --> 01:19:08.740
Only a feeble weakling
is deserving of my scorn

1387
01:19:08.780 --> 01:19:10.070
and no one else.

1388
01:19:11.080 --> 01:19:12.740
That's right.

1389
01:19:12.780 --> 01:19:16.000
The mere sight of them
makes my skin crawl.

1390
01:19:16.040 --> 01:19:17.790
They make me retch!

1391
01:19:18.790 --> 01:19:21.040
Through the laws of nature.
they are weeded out

1392
01:19:21.090 --> 01:19:23.460
from this world
just as they should be.

1393
01:19:24.380 --> 01:19:27.510
Everything you just said
is wrong!

1394
01:19:28.510 --> 01:19:29.680
[AKAZA] Huh?

1395
01:19:30.930 --> 01:19:33.180
The fact
you're even alive right now.

1396
01:19:33.220 --> 01:19:34.930
isn't that proof enough?

1397
01:19:36.270 --> 01:19:39.400
As an infant.
we're all helpless.

1398
01:19:39.440 --> 01:19:41.940
We can't live
without someone else's help.

1399
01:19:42.440 --> 01:19:44.480
You're no different. Akaza.

1400
01:19:45.480 --> 01:19:47.450
Even if you don't remember.

1401
01:19:47.490 --> 01:19:49.360
there was a time
when you were protected

1402
01:19:49.410 --> 01:19:50.990
and cared for by someone.

1403
01:19:51.030 --> 01:19:52.200
I know it!

1404
01:19:52.740 --> 01:19:54.370
That's why you're alive.

1405
01:19:59.210 --> 01:20:01.960
The strong should aid
and protect the weak.

1406
01:20:02.460 --> 01:20:04.630
And in turn.
the weak become strong

1407
01:20:04.670 --> 01:20:07.840
and aid and protect
those weaker than themselves!

1408
01:20:08.380 --> 01:20:10.510
That is the law of nature.

1409
01:20:11.050 --> 01:20:14.760
Akaza. I can't tolerate
your way of thinking.

1410
01:20:15.220 --> 01:20:16.810
Here on out.

1411
01:20:16.850 --> 01:20:19.350
I won't let you
do as you please!

1412
01:20:24.360 --> 01:20:25.860
[AKAZA] I get it now.

1413
01:20:28.690 --> 01:20:33.030
I have a disgust for this boy
that's almost primal in nature.

1414
01:20:33.740 --> 01:20:37.500
Even if he's stronger.
that feeling hasn't faded.

1415
01:20:42.290 --> 01:20:44.380
[MAN] No matter who they are.

1416
01:20:44.420 --> 01:20:47.420
everyone begins life
as a newborn.

1417
01:20:47.460 --> 01:20:50.970
We learn by getting help
from those around us.

1418
01:20:51.630 --> 01:20:54.390
We are not competing
with others.

1419
01:20:54.430 --> 01:20:58.100
The only opponent
you have in life is yourself.

1420
01:20:58.720 --> 01:21:02.770
Just focus on becoming stronger
than you were yesterday.

1421
01:21:03.940 --> 01:21:07.570
If you can stay this path
for a decade or even two.

1422
01:21:07.610 --> 01:21:09.190
that would be commendable.

1423
01:21:09.690 --> 01:21:11.150
And before you know it.

1424
01:21:11.200 --> 01:21:14.030
you will be helping others
in turn.

1425
01:21:14.700 --> 01:21:16.700
[breathing shakily]

1426
01:21:20.200 --> 01:21:21.250
[gasps]

1427
01:21:22.040 --> 01:21:23.040
[TANJIRO] What was that?

1428
01:21:23.170 --> 01:21:24.920
He just swung his fist
at nothing.

1429
01:21:31.090 --> 01:21:32.880
Tanjiro.

1430
01:21:33.760 --> 01:21:36.350
You still repulse me to my core.

1431
01:21:36.390 --> 01:21:37.430
[♪ rock music playing]

1432
01:21:37.470 --> 01:21:40.100
Destructive Death.
Crushing Type:

1433
01:21:40.140 --> 01:21:42.520
Ten Thousand Leaves
Flashing Willow!

1434
01:21:45.650 --> 01:21:47.610
[TANJIRO]
This speed. it's blinding!

1435
01:21:47.650 --> 01:21:50.320
No. it's not just his speed.

1436
01:21:50.360 --> 01:21:53.650
It's his precision.
his aura. and also--

1437
01:21:56.450 --> 01:21:57.490
[grunts]

1438
01:21:58.580 --> 01:22:00.870
Destructive Death. Leg Type.

1439
01:22:00.910 --> 01:22:01.910
[TANJIRO] Below.

1440
01:22:04.080 --> 01:22:06.290
[AKAZA] Flying Planet
Thousand Wheels!

1441
01:22:12.210 --> 01:22:14.680
[TANJIRO] Even if I could
anticipate his strikes.

1442
01:22:14.720 --> 01:22:17.800
they're so powerful.
I can't completely deflect them.

1443
01:22:17.850 --> 01:22:19.970
His techniques are so precise.

1444
01:22:20.010 --> 01:22:23.310
they can pierce through any
opening. no matter how small.

1445
01:22:26.190 --> 01:22:28.650
It's like a magnet
is attracting his attacks

1446
01:22:28.690 --> 01:22:30.650
straight toward my weak points.

1447
01:22:30.690 --> 01:22:33.740
But how? What's happening?

1448
01:22:33.780 --> 01:22:36.150
What could be
causing this behavior?

1449
01:22:36.570 --> 01:22:38.700
Come on. Think.

1450
01:22:39.990 --> 01:22:41.660
What's the answer?!

1451
01:22:41.700 --> 01:22:45.080
There must be a clue
in what Akaza's said or done.

1452
01:22:45.120 --> 01:22:47.370
[Akaza grunts] Hyah!

1453
01:22:48.420 --> 01:22:51.880
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:
Solar Heat Haze!

1454
01:22:59.640 --> 01:23:01.100
[blood spurts]

1455
01:23:01.640 --> 01:23:04.390
[chuckles]
What an interesting move.

1456
01:23:04.430 --> 01:23:08.150
I dodged it at first. but then
the blade seemed to extend.

1457
01:23:08.190 --> 01:23:10.690
I don't know what kind of swing
you put behind it.

1458
01:23:10.730 --> 01:23:12.400
but the tip of your blade
wavered

1459
01:23:12.440 --> 01:23:15.690
like it was in a heat haze.
How fascinating!

1460
01:23:18.990 --> 01:23:20.990
-[grunts]
-[glass shattering]

1461
01:23:22.450 --> 01:23:24.580
[debris crumbling]

1462
01:23:26.370 --> 01:23:29.880
[TANJIRO]
Hinokami Kagura: Dance!

1463
01:23:30.670 --> 01:23:31.960
[clangs]

1464
01:23:32.000 --> 01:23:33.210
My sword!

1465
01:23:34.210 --> 01:23:35.590
He'll break it!

1466
01:23:36.760 --> 01:23:39.130
[effort grunts]

1467
01:23:40.430 --> 01:23:42.220
That was a strong headbutt.

1468
01:23:43.890 --> 01:23:46.060
[TANJIRO] Damn you!
Let go of me!

1469
01:23:47.390 --> 01:23:48.940
No good. [straining]

1470
01:23:48.980 --> 01:23:51.150
I can't get him
to loosen his grip.

1471
01:23:55.320 --> 01:23:56.990
[water splashing]

1472
01:24:01.990 --> 01:24:03.160
[grunts softly]

1473
01:24:03.200 --> 01:24:04.700
Mr. Giyu!

1474
01:24:05.200 --> 01:24:07.080
[Giyu sighs]

1475
01:24:08.460 --> 01:24:11.040
You're starting
to get on my nerves.

1476
01:24:11.080 --> 01:24:13.920
Thanks to you.
my back is killing me now.

1477
01:24:14.460 --> 01:24:17.630
I'm not fond of being hurled
like a rag doll.

1478
01:24:17.670 --> 01:24:19.550
I'm gonna make you pay.

1479
01:24:22.590 --> 01:24:26.600
Personally. I'd rather not draw
my sword if I can help it.

1480
01:24:27.100 --> 01:24:29.980
And I have a hard time
justifying using deadly force

1481
01:24:30.020 --> 01:24:31.400
if unnecessary.

1482
01:24:32.650 --> 01:24:34.480
But at this moment.

1483
01:24:34.520 --> 01:24:37.990
I'm against an opponent that
demands everything from me.

1484
01:24:38.030 --> 01:24:39.570
In the short time we fought.

1485
01:24:39.610 --> 01:24:42.200
my senses have been
pushed past their limits.

1486
01:24:43.240 --> 01:24:46.040
My dormant senses
have been rudely awakened

1487
01:24:46.080 --> 01:24:49.290
and are dragging me forward
towards the enemy.

1488
01:24:50.120 --> 01:24:53.750
I now know how much
it expands one's potential

1489
01:24:53.790 --> 01:24:55.840
to have one's back
against the wall

1490
01:24:55.880 --> 01:24:57.630
with their sword raised

1491
01:24:57.670 --> 01:24:59.420
in the face of death.

1492
01:25:02.680 --> 01:25:03.890
Mr. Giyu.

1493
01:25:09.770 --> 01:25:11.350
[♪ intense music playing]

1494
01:25:20.950 --> 01:25:23.820
[AKAZA] A mark appeared
and his movements have gotten...

1495
01:25:23.860 --> 01:25:25.240
Faster!

1496
01:25:29.790 --> 01:25:33.290
[GIYU] Water Breathing.
Fourth Form: Striking Tide!

1497
01:25:34.290 --> 01:25:36.170
[grunts softly. chuckles]

1498
01:25:41.130 --> 01:25:42.260
[grunts]

1499
01:25:47.640 --> 01:25:49.310
[TANJIRO] They're both so fast.

1500
01:25:49.350 --> 01:25:52.020
Mr. Giyu's speed increased
with the mark.

1501
01:25:52.060 --> 01:25:54.270
but Akaza adapted to it
instantly.

1502
01:25:56.730 --> 01:25:59.270
Don't tell me
that's all you're capable of!

1503
01:25:59.320 --> 01:26:01.400
[Giyu groans angrily]

1504
01:26:03.360 --> 01:26:05.740
[both grunting]

1505
01:26:08.330 --> 01:26:12.120
Show me more!
Don't you dare hold back!

1506
01:26:40.940 --> 01:26:44.570
[GIYU]
Tenth Form: Constant Flux!

1507
01:26:52.080 --> 01:26:53.660
[yelling]

1508
01:27:01.630 --> 01:27:05.010
Seventh Form:
Drop Ripple Thrust!

1509
01:27:05.050 --> 01:27:07.800
Destructive Death: Disorder!

1510
01:27:18.440 --> 01:27:21.150
[TANJIRO] Mr. Giyu! Akaza!

1511
01:27:23.360 --> 01:27:24.780
Calm down!

1512
01:27:25.570 --> 01:27:27.610
[weapons clanging]

1513
01:27:28.660 --> 01:27:30.950
Think. Don't panic.

1514
01:27:30.990 --> 01:27:33.410
Whatever you do.
don't lose focus.

1515
01:27:34.040 --> 01:27:35.290
[grunts]

1516
01:27:35.500 --> 01:27:38.750
Why is it that Akaza's attacks
are always so accurate?

1517
01:27:39.670 --> 01:27:43.710
How is he able to respond
to attacks from his blind spots?

1518
01:27:44.590 --> 01:27:45.800
Think!

1519
01:27:50.340 --> 01:27:52.430
[AKAZA] Your fighting spirit
has been tempered

1520
01:27:52.470 --> 01:27:54.140
like quality steel.

1521
01:27:54.180 --> 01:27:55.640
Your name?

1522
01:27:56.310 --> 01:27:57.520
[gasps]

1523
01:27:58.520 --> 01:28:00.690
[TANJIRO]
Back when he fought Mr. Rengoku.

1524
01:28:00.730 --> 01:28:04.400
I remember Akaza using the words
"fighting spirit."

1525
01:28:05.780 --> 01:28:07.690
What did he mean by that?

1526
01:28:07.740 --> 01:28:10.610
Is he able to sense things
through fighting spirit?

1527
01:28:11.160 --> 01:28:13.910
The same way I can sense things
through scent?

1528
01:28:28.010 --> 01:28:30.220
Wherever the enemy's aiming at.

1529
01:28:30.260 --> 01:28:32.430
I get this weird
tingling feeling.

1530
01:28:32.470 --> 01:28:36.010
So. that's how you knew Gyutaro
was attacking you from behind.

1531
01:28:36.060 --> 01:28:38.230
You sure are incredible.
Inosuke.

1532
01:28:38.270 --> 01:28:40.100
[laughs boisterously]

1533
01:28:40.140 --> 01:28:43.190
Well. my skin is tougher
than most people's.

1534
01:28:43.230 --> 01:28:45.070
And whether
it's from behind or not.

1535
01:28:45.110 --> 01:28:46.280
if someone's looking at me.

1536
01:28:46.320 --> 01:28:48.070
I know just
where they're lookin'.

1537
01:28:48.110 --> 01:28:49.650
Could you show me?

1538
01:28:49.690 --> 01:28:52.160
[laughs] Sure thing!

1539
01:28:52.910 --> 01:28:54.450
[determined grunt]

1540
01:28:56.990 --> 01:28:58.700
-It's my right shoulder.
-[gasps]

1541
01:28:58.750 --> 01:29:00.540
You really got it.
That's amazing!

1542
01:29:01.080 --> 01:29:03.500
It's even easier to know
someone's looking at me

1543
01:29:03.540 --> 01:29:05.090
if they had killing intent.

1544
01:29:05.130 --> 01:29:08.550
Since anyone who can harm me
is bad news.

1545
01:29:08.590 --> 01:29:11.300
killing intent kind of
feels like it's stabbing me

1546
01:29:11.340 --> 01:29:12.800
through the skin. you know?

1547
01:29:13.720 --> 01:29:14.970
[TANJIRO] That's right.

1548
01:29:15.010 --> 01:29:17.680
Inosuke was able
to sense the invisible

1549
01:29:17.720 --> 01:29:20.390
using only his honed
sense of touch.

1550
01:29:21.100 --> 01:29:24.440
Think back.
What else did we talk about...

1551
01:29:25.150 --> 01:29:26.320
that day?

1552
01:29:26.360 --> 01:29:28.320
Where things get real tricky

1553
01:29:28.360 --> 01:29:31.360
is when someone who doesn't have
killing intent or hostility

1554
01:29:31.400 --> 01:29:32.610
is looking at me.

1555
01:29:32.650 --> 01:29:34.950
-like that tiny hag!
-Huh?

1556
01:29:35.530 --> 01:29:36.620
[INOSUKE] That old hag

1557
01:29:36.660 --> 01:29:38.620
from the house
with the wisteria mark

1558
01:29:38.660 --> 01:29:39.950
was sneaky.

1559
01:29:40.000 --> 01:29:41.620
Before I knew it...

1560
01:29:41.660 --> 01:29:42.790
Huh?

1561
01:29:44.250 --> 01:29:47.630
...she'd be sitting right
behind me holding rice balls.

1562
01:29:48.340 --> 01:29:51.420
Calling her a "hag" isn't nice.
She's elderly.

1563
01:29:51.460 --> 01:29:53.550
-Elderly hag!
-Stop that!

1564
01:29:53.590 --> 01:29:55.550
Well. that got me thinkin'.

1565
01:29:55.590 --> 01:29:59.180
If I could hide my killing
intent. then I'd be a ninja.

1566
01:29:59.220 --> 01:30:01.520
I'd be able to sneak up
on anybody.

1567
01:30:01.560 --> 01:30:03.640
-[chuckles excitedly]
-Sure.

1568
01:30:03.690 --> 01:30:06.360
But. Inosuke.
she was only sneaky

1569
01:30:06.400 --> 01:30:09.070
'cause she didn't have
the intent of harming you.

1570
01:30:09.110 --> 01:30:11.820
And I think beheading a demon
without killing intent

1571
01:30:11.860 --> 01:30:13.200
would be impossible.

1572
01:30:13.820 --> 01:30:15.200
[INOSUKE] Hmm.

1573
01:30:15.740 --> 01:30:17.740
Yeah. you're probably right.

1574
01:30:17.780 --> 01:30:20.740
A half-hearted strike
without any killing intent

1575
01:30:20.790 --> 01:30:24.330
would never be strong enough
to cut through a demon's neck.

1576
01:30:25.250 --> 01:30:27.460
[TANJIRO]
It was a casual conversation

1577
01:30:27.500 --> 01:30:30.130
but I think Inosuke
was on to something.

1578
01:30:32.340 --> 01:30:35.260
What is it that
Akaza supposedly senses?

1579
01:30:35.300 --> 01:30:37.720
What does he mean
by "fighting spirit"?

1580
01:30:37.760 --> 01:30:39.550
Is it killing intent?

1581
01:30:39.600 --> 01:30:41.100
Is it the will to fight?

1582
01:30:41.140 --> 01:30:42.770
The time spent training?

1583
01:30:42.810 --> 01:30:44.350
Or maybe the amount?

1584
01:30:45.310 --> 01:30:46.480
Is it like the way

1585
01:30:46.560 --> 01:30:48.480
I can anticipate movements
through scent?

1586
01:30:49.810 --> 01:30:51.940
There must be something I can do

1587
01:30:52.440 --> 01:30:54.240
to disrupt his compass!

1588
01:30:57.320 --> 01:30:58.620
[♪ rock music playing]

1589
01:31:04.250 --> 01:31:06.580
Hinokami Kagura: Dance!

1590
01:31:08.710 --> 01:31:11.670
Just one problem
with your attack.

1591
01:31:11.710 --> 01:31:13.550
You're wide open!

1592
01:31:16.090 --> 01:31:17.590
[TANJIRO] His fist!

1593
01:31:23.350 --> 01:31:24.770
[grunts]

1594
01:31:29.190 --> 01:31:30.810
[panting]

1595
01:31:30.860 --> 01:31:32.110
Fighting spirit.

1596
01:31:32.150 --> 01:31:34.440
Instincts. Compass.

1597
01:31:34.480 --> 01:31:35.740
Perception.

1598
01:31:36.240 --> 01:31:39.860
Striking with killing intent.
Sensing the invisible.

1599
01:31:39.910 --> 01:31:42.030
Executing the impossible.

1600
01:31:42.490 --> 01:31:43.740
I see.

1601
01:31:45.450 --> 01:31:47.160
So. that's it.

1602
01:31:49.960 --> 01:31:52.130
-[birds chirping]
-[leaves rustling]

1603
01:31:55.050 --> 01:31:57.590
[laughter]

1604
01:32:04.310 --> 01:32:06.680
Um. Father?
What do you think about

1605
01:32:06.720 --> 01:32:09.140
when you dance
the Hinokami Kagura?

1606
01:32:09.730 --> 01:32:13.690
If it's too tiring for you.
I can take your place next year.

1607
01:32:14.230 --> 01:32:16.570
I don't want you
to overwork yourself.

1608
01:32:18.070 --> 01:32:19.900
Thank you. Tanjiro.

1609
01:32:20.610 --> 01:32:23.120
But to be honest.
I haven't found the Kagura

1610
01:32:23.160 --> 01:32:26.540
to be the least bit tiring
over the last few years.

1611
01:32:27.160 --> 01:32:28.910
I can't quite explain it.

1612
01:32:28.960 --> 01:32:32.420
but back when I learned it
from your grandfather years ago.

1613
01:32:32.460 --> 01:32:36.460
even though I was younger.
healthier and stronger than now.

1614
01:32:36.510 --> 01:32:39.550
I found it to be
far more tiring back then.

1615
01:32:41.800 --> 01:32:43.220
[♪ poignant music playing]

1616
01:32:43.260 --> 01:32:45.970
[TANJIRO] For generations.
the Kagura was performed

1617
01:32:46.010 --> 01:32:48.770
by the Kamado family
at the start of each year.

1618
01:32:49.270 --> 01:32:51.270
It was an exhausting performance

1619
01:32:51.310 --> 01:32:54.190
that would last
from sunset till dawn.

1620
01:32:55.400 --> 01:32:57.940
There are 12 different forms
that must be repeated

1621
01:32:57.980 --> 01:32:59.900
over and over again.

1622
01:32:59.940 --> 01:33:02.530
thousands of times
before daybreak.

1623
01:33:05.370 --> 01:33:06.870
I think my exhaustion

1624
01:33:06.910 --> 01:33:09.250
was the result
of unnecessary movement.

1625
01:33:09.750 --> 01:33:11.420
Using the correct movements

1626
01:33:11.460 --> 01:33:14.330
and breathing patterns
are vital to the dance.

1627
01:33:15.090 --> 01:33:17.960
It's what allows you
to produce maximum strength

1628
01:33:18.000 --> 01:33:19.760
while using minimal actions.

1629
01:33:19.800 --> 01:33:22.800
Once you've mastered
your breathing and movement.

1630
01:33:22.840 --> 01:33:25.510
your mind will become
transparent.

1631
01:33:26.220 --> 01:33:28.010
Transparent?

1632
01:33:28.970 --> 01:33:30.730
But before any of that.

1633
01:33:30.770 --> 01:33:33.100
you must memorize
the moves of the dance

1634
01:33:33.140 --> 01:33:36.440
and slowly ingrain them
into your muscle memory.

1635
01:33:36.480 --> 01:33:39.940
In doing so.
you'll open up your five senses

1636
01:33:39.980 --> 01:33:42.450
and become aware
of the shape of your own body.

1637
01:33:42.490 --> 01:33:44.280
vessel by vessel.

1638
01:33:45.870 --> 01:33:48.910
That was the truly
strenuous part.

1639
01:33:48.950 --> 01:33:52.290
All you can think is that
even if you go on struggling.

1640
01:33:52.330 --> 01:33:54.210
you'll never succeed.

1641
01:33:54.750 --> 01:33:56.630
After you've learned
all these things

1642
01:33:56.670 --> 01:33:58.210
and committed them to memory.

1643
01:33:58.250 --> 01:34:01.420
you'll understand how to remove
what you don't need.

1644
01:34:01.470 --> 01:34:05.300
only leaving behind in your body
what is required of you.

1645
01:34:05.340 --> 01:34:07.260
closing off the rest.

1646
01:34:07.850 --> 01:34:09.100
Closing?

1647
01:34:09.850 --> 01:34:12.100
You know how people
often close their eyes

1648
01:34:12.140 --> 01:34:14.100
when they're trying
to hear better?

1649
01:34:14.850 --> 01:34:16.690
In that same way.

1650
01:34:16.730 --> 01:34:18.820
you'll pick out the things
you need the most

1651
01:34:18.860 --> 01:34:21.490
in the movement
while eliminating the rest.

1652
01:34:22.070 --> 01:34:25.860
Eventually. you will be able
to open and close the vessels

1653
01:34:25.910 --> 01:34:29.280
and muscles in your body.
as if it were second nature.

1654
01:34:29.330 --> 01:34:32.410
The same way you blink
without a second thought.

1655
01:34:33.120 --> 01:34:34.870
When that happens.

1656
01:34:34.910 --> 01:34:38.380
a path illuminated
by a bright light will open.

1657
01:34:39.630 --> 01:34:43.550
If your mind is as clear
as possible. you'll begin to see

1658
01:34:43.590 --> 01:34:46.090
the Transparent World
before you.

1659
01:34:46.130 --> 01:34:48.510
But this domain
can only be reached

1660
01:34:48.550 --> 01:34:50.470
by pushing yourself
past your limits.

1661
01:34:50.510 --> 01:34:53.140
despite the suffering
that may be required.

1662
01:34:53.680 --> 01:34:55.390
Will I ever get to see it?

1663
01:34:56.390 --> 01:34:59.860
If you work tirelessly.
then that's for you to decide.

1664
01:35:00.570 --> 01:35:02.650
There. All done.

1665
01:35:02.690 --> 01:35:03.900
[TANJIRO] Thank you.

1666
01:35:07.570 --> 01:35:10.330
Ten days before my father died.

1667
01:35:10.370 --> 01:35:13.160
an incident where a bear
began attacking people

1668
01:35:13.200 --> 01:35:15.330
happened on
a neighboring mountain.

1669
01:35:15.830 --> 01:35:18.460
We lit bonfires around the house

1670
01:35:18.500 --> 01:35:21.340
and set up multiple ropes
lined with bells.

1671
01:35:32.890 --> 01:35:34.100
Hmm?

1672
01:35:39.940 --> 01:35:41.400
[TANJURO] Tanjiro.

1673
01:35:45.690 --> 01:35:47.360
[TANJIRO] Yes. Father?

1674
01:35:48.320 --> 01:35:49.660
[TANJURO] Come with me.

1675
01:35:50.700 --> 01:35:52.660
[Tanjiro grunting. panting]

1676
01:36:02.210 --> 01:36:03.550
[grunts]

1677
01:36:22.020 --> 01:36:24.150
[breathing unsteadily]

1678
01:36:24.980 --> 01:36:27.150
[♪ dramatic sting]

1679
01:36:31.410 --> 01:36:34.700
[loud growling]

1680
01:36:38.870 --> 01:36:41.920
[TANJURO] I understand
you must be very hungry.

1681
01:36:41.960 --> 01:36:45.170
But I'm afraid I can't allow you
to come any closer.

1682
01:36:46.340 --> 01:36:49.510
If anyone were to try
and cause harm to my family.

1683
01:36:49.550 --> 01:36:52.180
I would be forced
to show you no mercy.

1684
01:36:52.680 --> 01:36:55.010
If you disregard this warning...

1685
01:36:57.970 --> 01:37:00.890
...I'll have no choice
but to take your life.

1686
01:37:01.770 --> 01:37:03.350
-[roaring]
-[bells tinkling]

1687
01:37:03.810 --> 01:37:05.320
[thuds]

1688
01:37:05.360 --> 01:37:06.520
[gasps]

1689
01:37:10.150 --> 01:37:12.160
[bells tinkling]

1690
01:37:12.200 --> 01:37:15.990
[TANJIRO] The bear's head that
was as thick as a human torso

1691
01:37:16.030 --> 01:37:19.040
dropped to the ground
with the sound of the bells.

1692
01:37:20.960 --> 01:37:23.210
My eyes couldn't follow it.

1693
01:37:23.250 --> 01:37:24.960
But if I'm not mistaken.

1694
01:37:25.000 --> 01:37:28.340
my father slashed it twice
in the blink of an eye.

1695
01:37:29.960 --> 01:37:31.510
He must have.

1696
01:37:31.550 --> 01:37:34.680
His ax wouldn't have been
able to cut through otherwise.

1697
01:37:36.180 --> 01:37:39.720
All the while.
my father's scent never wavered.

1698
01:37:39.770 --> 01:37:42.230
Before and after
beheading the bear.

1699
01:37:42.270 --> 01:37:45.810
he emitted no fear.
no killing intent.

1700
01:37:53.070 --> 01:37:55.070
I hope that you were watching.

1701
01:37:56.120 --> 01:37:58.870
A day might come
where you have to do the same.

1702
01:37:58.910 --> 01:38:00.750
[wind blowing]

1703
01:38:01.870 --> 01:38:03.960
[TANJIRO] My father
wasn't the type of person

1704
01:38:04.000 --> 01:38:05.500
to flaunt his strength.

1705
01:38:06.210 --> 01:38:08.500
I realized later on.

1706
01:38:08.550 --> 01:38:12.550
that night. he wanted me
to see it in action.

1707
01:38:13.760 --> 01:38:16.300
The movements necessary
to be able to see

1708
01:38:16.340 --> 01:38:18.970
the Transparent World
he spoke of.

1709
01:38:21.060 --> 01:38:25.560
I'm sure my father. grandfather.
and great-grandfather

1710
01:38:26.060 --> 01:38:28.230
all learned the same way.

1711
01:38:29.860 --> 01:38:32.320
Whatever you do. never give up.

1712
01:38:32.360 --> 01:38:34.570
Always stay calm and focused.

1713
01:38:35.240 --> 01:38:38.160
Any wall you come up against
can be shattered

1714
01:38:38.700 --> 01:38:40.830
if you just work tirelessly.

1715
01:38:42.540 --> 01:38:44.410
[TANJIRO] I understand. Father.

1716
01:38:44.460 --> 01:38:46.000
In that moment...

1717
01:38:46.540 --> 01:38:47.880
that's why I was able to dodge

1718
01:38:47.920 --> 01:38:51.050
Akaza's inescapable blow
to my side.

1719
01:38:53.800 --> 01:38:55.590
If I hadn't moved in time.

1720
01:38:55.630 --> 01:38:58.090
I'm positive that strike
would have killed me.

1721
01:38:58.760 --> 01:39:01.390
When I was alternating moves
with Mr. Giyu.

1722
01:39:01.430 --> 01:39:03.970
weaving my attacks
in between each of his.

1723
01:39:04.480 --> 01:39:07.900
I was protected from being hit
by those lethal blows.

1724
01:39:08.400 --> 01:39:09.560
But in that instant.

1725
01:39:09.610 --> 01:39:12.280
even Mr. Giyu
couldn't make it in time.

1726
01:39:13.530 --> 01:39:18.530
However. for whatever reason.
I knew dodging was possible.

1727
01:39:19.030 --> 01:39:21.700
And for just a split second.

1728
01:39:21.740 --> 01:39:23.620
I was able to see it.

1729
01:39:25.370 --> 01:39:27.000
That world.

1730
01:39:28.790 --> 01:39:30.790
[♪ enchanting music playing]

1731
01:39:30.840 --> 01:39:33.340
The Transparent World.

1732
01:39:35.630 --> 01:39:38.840
Even his body
started to look transparent.

1733
01:39:39.930 --> 01:39:43.770
The same is when Hantengu
was hiding inside his own heart.

1734
01:39:44.270 --> 01:39:47.390
I don't know
if I saw him or smelled him.

1735
01:39:51.860 --> 01:39:53.270
Dodge.

1736
01:39:53.320 --> 01:39:56.530
I used only the senses
that would let me do that.

1737
01:39:57.070 --> 01:40:00.780
Without thinking. my body
moved faster than ever before.

1738
01:40:02.070 --> 01:40:05.540
When I'm inside the Transparent
World my father spoke of.

1739
01:40:05.580 --> 01:40:08.870
my battle instincts
improve drastically.

1740
01:40:10.880 --> 01:40:13.130
I can see my opponent's lungs

1741
01:40:13.170 --> 01:40:15.510
and the blood moving
throughout their body.

1742
01:40:16.000 --> 01:40:18.470
I can see
my own muscles contracting

1743
01:40:18.510 --> 01:40:21.300
faster and clearer than before.

1744
01:40:24.810 --> 01:40:27.060
If I close off
the fighting spirit

1745
01:40:27.100 --> 01:40:29.730
that Akaza
must be detecting me with.

1746
01:40:29.770 --> 01:40:31.560
I can go for his neck.

1747
01:40:32.020 --> 01:40:33.820
[screeches]

1748
01:40:44.530 --> 01:40:46.080
[TANJIRO] See it.

1749
01:40:46.120 --> 01:40:47.620
See it!

1750
01:40:47.660 --> 01:40:49.750
[exhales]

1751
01:40:49.790 --> 01:40:51.000
[♪ rock music playing]

1752
01:40:51.040 --> 01:40:52.500
It looks like
you've thrown about

1753
01:40:52.540 --> 01:40:54.630
every last Water Form at me.

1754
01:40:55.250 --> 01:40:57.800
Enough is enough.
wouldn't you say?

1755
01:40:58.380 --> 01:41:00.220
I'm putting an end to this.

1756
01:41:00.260 --> 01:41:03.390
But you have my respect
for lasting so long!

1757
01:41:04.890 --> 01:41:06.010
[GIYU] What?

1758
01:41:07.140 --> 01:41:09.140
In the middle of my downswing...

1759
01:41:10.600 --> 01:41:12.440
...he hit it from the side.

1760
01:41:14.060 --> 01:41:15.820
And snapped my sword!

1761
01:41:16.400 --> 01:41:18.690
-Goodbye. Giyu.
-[impact grunts]

1762
01:41:22.820 --> 01:41:24.620
[flesh squelching]

1763
01:41:25.580 --> 01:41:28.200
[muted silence]

1764
01:41:28.950 --> 01:41:30.000
[thuds]

1765
01:41:30.040 --> 01:41:32.160
[♪ intense dramatic music
playing]

1766
01:41:42.300 --> 01:41:45.300
-[exhales]
-[flame roaring]

1767
01:41:47.970 --> 01:41:51.180
[GIYU] He stopped the attack
by cutting off his fist.

1768
01:41:51.230 --> 01:41:53.310
His breathing is different.

1769
01:41:53.350 --> 01:41:54.980
And his appearance...

1770
01:41:56.270 --> 01:41:58.690
I've been saved by Tanjiro.

1771
01:42:00.070 --> 01:42:01.990
[AKAZA]
All of the cells in my body

1772
01:42:02.030 --> 01:42:03.610
down to the ones in my hair

1773
01:42:03.650 --> 01:42:06.870
are screaming at me to kill him
as soon as possible.

1774
01:42:08.580 --> 01:42:11.620
I don't know what kind of change
he underwent. but...

1775
01:42:12.870 --> 01:42:14.580
...he's dangerous.

1776
01:42:16.120 --> 01:42:18.290
[GIYU] His focus is on Tanjiro.

1777
01:42:19.380 --> 01:42:21.010
Now's my chance.

1778
01:42:25.380 --> 01:42:28.220
[AKAZA] Technique Development.
Final Form:

1779
01:42:28.760 --> 01:42:31.140
Blue Silver Chaotic Afterglow!

1780
01:42:34.350 --> 01:42:36.730
[GIYU] His attack speed
boosted again.

1781
01:42:36.770 --> 01:42:38.480
and the force is increased.

1782
01:42:38.940 --> 01:42:42.610
My only chance now
is with Dead Calm!

1783
01:43:04.340 --> 01:43:07.180
[TANJIRO] This must be
what Father was talking about.

1784
01:43:07.680 --> 01:43:11.510
This is it.
The Transparent World.

1785
01:43:19.310 --> 01:43:25.820
Strange. It feels like
time is passing by so slowly.

1786
01:43:27.530 --> 01:43:32.200
Or maybe... their movements
just look slower now.

1787
01:43:32.240 --> 01:43:34.410
[♪ intense music continues]

1788
01:43:35.450 --> 01:43:36.790
[groans]

1789
01:43:38.170 --> 01:43:40.130
[GIYU] It's no use.

1790
01:43:40.170 --> 01:43:43.250
A hundred strikes at once
is unavoidable.

1791
01:43:43.750 --> 01:43:45.380
Even with Dead Calm.

1792
01:43:45.420 --> 01:43:48.180
I still wasn't able
to block all of them.

1793
01:43:49.510 --> 01:43:51.350
[AKAZA] Stand proud. Giyu.

1794
01:43:51.390 --> 01:43:54.220
Most wouldn't have been
able to survive that.

1795
01:43:54.260 --> 01:43:57.190
You must have evaded
my fatal blows.

1796
01:43:57.980 --> 01:44:01.980
There's no need for you to die
like Kyojuro and Tanjiro did.

1797
01:44:02.020 --> 01:44:05.070
Give up your pride
and become a demon. Giyu.

1798
01:44:06.820 --> 01:44:10.280
[GIYU] Tanjiro's behind him
and he hasn't noticed?

1799
01:44:10.820 --> 01:44:13.370
-[Akaza speaking indistinctly]
-Is he masking his presence?

1800
01:44:13.410 --> 01:44:15.040
Now's our chance!

1801
01:44:15.870 --> 01:44:17.540
Tanjiro. do it!

1802
01:44:17.580 --> 01:44:20.000
If you have the strength.
behead him.

1803
01:44:20.500 --> 01:44:22.420
Before he notices you.

1804
01:44:22.460 --> 01:44:23.960
go for it!

1805
01:44:24.000 --> 01:44:27.880
Akaza!
Prepare to be decapitated!

1806
01:44:27.920 --> 01:44:29.180
[AKAZA] Huh?

1807
01:44:33.720 --> 01:44:36.260
[GIYU] He willingly
gave himself away!

1808
01:44:36.890 --> 01:44:38.680
[AKAZA] He's still alive?

1809
01:44:39.140 --> 01:44:41.100
I never would have thought
someone like him

1810
01:44:41.150 --> 01:44:43.360
could survive
an attack like that.

1811
01:44:43.900 --> 01:44:45.610
Well. it doesn't matter.

1812
01:44:45.650 --> 01:44:48.070
After all. my Destructive Death.
Compass Needle

1813
01:44:48.110 --> 01:44:49.700
can detect any attack!

1814
01:44:50.150 --> 01:44:53.490
The stronger my opponent's
fighting spirit is.

1815
01:44:53.530 --> 01:44:56.450
the greater
my Compass Needle's reaction.

1816
01:44:57.830 --> 01:44:59.040
[quivers]

1817
01:44:59.620 --> 01:45:01.330
What is this?

1818
01:45:01.790 --> 01:45:04.460
What is this odd presence
he's emitting?

1819
01:45:04.500 --> 01:45:06.460
It feels like
he's turned himself

1820
01:45:06.500 --> 01:45:08.300
into some other creature.

1821
01:45:08.340 --> 01:45:09.630
It's like...

1822
01:45:11.050 --> 01:45:13.590
...his fighting spirit is gone.

1823
01:45:13.640 --> 01:45:14.930
But how?

1824
01:45:14.970 --> 01:45:17.720
I have to calm down. Focus!

1825
01:45:18.180 --> 01:45:19.560
[grunts]

1826
01:45:20.310 --> 01:45:21.770
[flame roaring]

1827
01:45:24.060 --> 01:45:26.110
[TANJIRO] Hinokami Kagura:

1828
01:45:26.150 --> 01:45:28.730
Setting Sun Transformation.

1829
01:45:28.780 --> 01:45:30.950
[♪ intriguing music playing]

1830
01:45:31.780 --> 01:45:33.910
[tinkling]

1831
01:45:46.840 --> 01:45:47.960
[gasps]

1832
01:45:50.210 --> 01:45:52.930
[Akaza straining]
This can't be possible.

1833
01:45:55.510 --> 01:45:57.890
[Tanjiro exhales]

1834
01:45:59.930 --> 01:46:02.230
[AKAZA] In the last
several hundred years.

1835
01:46:02.270 --> 01:46:05.730
I've never once seen a human
without any fighting spirit.

1836
01:46:06.190 --> 01:46:09.190
Even newborn children
had traces of it.

1837
01:46:09.780 --> 01:46:12.280
And yet. in that instant.

1838
01:46:12.320 --> 01:46:14.240
his fighting spirit vanished

1839
01:46:14.280 --> 01:46:16.700
as if it were never there
to begin with.

1840
01:46:20.200 --> 01:46:22.500
It's as if
I was facing an anomaly

1841
01:46:22.540 --> 01:46:24.250
that shouldn't even exist.

1842
01:46:24.290 --> 01:46:27.000
So. my senses
were thrown into confusion.

1843
01:46:27.460 --> 01:46:30.500
My Compass Needle
detected nothing.

1844
01:46:31.050 --> 01:46:32.510
[tinkling]

1845
01:46:32.550 --> 01:46:35.590
But that's not the biggest issue
at hand here.

1846
01:46:35.630 --> 01:46:37.350
When on the battlefield.

1847
01:46:37.390 --> 01:46:40.010
there's no telling
what could come your way.

1848
01:46:40.060 --> 01:46:42.730
It's vital that you're able
to deal with the unexpected

1849
01:46:42.770 --> 01:46:44.270
at a moment's notice.

1850
01:46:44.770 --> 01:46:47.020
And I'm able to do that!

1851
01:46:47.650 --> 01:46:50.570
Or at least... I thought so.

1852
01:46:51.480 --> 01:46:54.200
But during that short battle.

1853
01:46:54.240 --> 01:46:58.700
he was able to grasp something
and use it to surpass my speed.

1854
01:46:59.200 --> 01:47:01.660
Whatever it was he learned
was able to shatter

1855
01:47:01.700 --> 01:47:04.000
centuries' worth
of martial arts techniques

1856
01:47:04.040 --> 01:47:06.040
with a single head-on attack.

1857
01:47:06.750 --> 01:47:10.880
Within those eyes of his.
there was no hatred. no rage.

1858
01:47:10.920 --> 01:47:14.010
no killing intent
or fighting spirit.

1859
01:47:14.670 --> 01:47:17.630
He must have somehow seen
what I'd been looking for:

1860
01:47:17.680 --> 01:47:22.060
the domain that lies
within the realm of the highest.

1861
01:47:23.770 --> 01:47:26.310
None other than
the selfless state.

1862
01:47:28.440 --> 01:47:31.110
For some time now.
I've had a vague sense

1863
01:47:31.150 --> 01:47:33.190
that this state of mind existed.

1864
01:47:33.650 --> 01:47:36.240
And yet. even after
all these centuries.

1865
01:47:36.280 --> 01:47:38.070
I've yet to attain it.

1866
01:47:45.580 --> 01:47:46.620
[gasps]

1867
01:47:47.210 --> 01:47:48.830
[AKAZA] Not yet!

1868
01:47:48.870 --> 01:47:50.580
I can still fight!

1869
01:47:50.630 --> 01:47:53.250
I will continue
to become stronger!

1870
01:47:59.510 --> 01:48:02.600
[TANJIRO] This is bad.
He's reattaching his head!

1871
01:48:03.060 --> 01:48:05.180
[effort grunting]

1872
01:48:06.850 --> 01:48:09.060
-[thuds]
-[gasps]

1873
01:48:11.730 --> 01:48:14.110
[AKAZA] I can't die here.

1874
01:48:15.480 --> 01:48:17.320
Not like this.

1875
01:48:20.320 --> 01:48:23.080
I have to become stronger.

1876
01:48:25.160 --> 01:48:28.500
Stronger than anyone else
in the whole world!

1877
01:48:28.540 --> 01:48:30.330
Stronger!

1878
01:48:30.790 --> 01:48:32.580
-[thuds]
-[fizzles out]

1879
01:48:32.630 --> 01:48:35.800
I have to find a way
to become stronger.

1880
01:48:37.880 --> 01:48:39.010
[clatters]

1881
01:48:42.930 --> 01:48:44.260
[body thuds]

1882
01:48:45.220 --> 01:48:48.140
[TANJIRO] That's it. It's over.

1883
01:48:49.850 --> 01:48:51.270
We won!

1884
01:48:52.230 --> 01:48:53.560
[sighs in relief]

1885
01:48:53.940 --> 01:48:55.860
[grunts in pain]

1886
01:48:56.230 --> 01:48:57.900
So lightheaded.

1887
01:48:59.740 --> 01:49:01.910
My muscles are cramping up.

1888
01:49:01.950 --> 01:49:04.070
My body's reached its limit.

1889
01:49:06.700 --> 01:49:09.500
Tanjiro. are you all ri--
[gasps]

1890
01:49:10.330 --> 01:49:13.040
His body
hasn't disintegrated yet.

1891
01:49:13.080 --> 01:49:15.710
Does... Does this mean...

1892
01:49:16.170 --> 01:49:17.210
Tan--

1893
01:49:17.880 --> 01:49:19.300
[♪ intense music playing]

1894
01:49:19.340 --> 01:49:20.670
[grunts]

1895
01:49:27.560 --> 01:49:31.350
[TANJIRO] He's moving!
His body is still intact!

1896
01:49:31.390 --> 01:49:33.650
The severed part is closing up!

1897
01:49:34.860 --> 01:49:36.730
[strained grunting]

1898
01:49:36.770 --> 01:49:38.650
I can't see straight.

1899
01:49:38.690 --> 01:49:40.280
I can't.

1900
01:49:43.610 --> 01:49:44.820
[impact grunts]

1901
01:49:49.870 --> 01:49:51.210
[strained gasping]

1902
01:49:51.250 --> 01:49:54.040
No. No way.

1903
01:49:54.080 --> 01:49:56.460
Slashing his neck
didn't kill him!

1904
01:49:56.500 --> 01:49:59.960
Is there some kind of condition
like with Gyutaro and Daki?

1905
01:50:00.420 --> 01:50:01.470
That can't be it.

1906
01:50:02.010 --> 01:50:05.510
His head disintegrated.
yet he hasn't given up!

1907
01:50:06.010 --> 01:50:09.350
It's like he's trying to evolve!

1908
01:50:11.180 --> 01:50:12.480
[impact grunts]

1909
01:50:15.650 --> 01:50:17.110
If we don't do something.

1910
01:50:17.150 --> 01:50:19.980
his head will stop
being his weak point like Muzan!

1911
01:50:20.650 --> 01:50:22.690
This battle isn't over yet.

1912
01:50:22.740 --> 01:50:24.650
I have to fight...

1913
01:50:25.410 --> 01:50:26.530
Tanjiro!

1914
01:50:26.570 --> 01:50:28.160
He's fainted.

1915
01:50:28.200 --> 01:50:29.740
Of course he has.

1916
01:50:29.790 --> 01:50:32.370
He's long since
passed his limit.

1917
01:50:37.210 --> 01:50:38.880
[grunts]

1918
01:50:42.010 --> 01:50:45.180
Water Breathing. Fourth Form:

1919
01:50:45.220 --> 01:50:47.680
[♪ epic music playing]

1920
01:50:47.720 --> 01:50:49.510
Striking Tide!

1921
01:50:54.480 --> 01:50:56.100
Ridiculous!

1922
01:50:56.150 --> 01:50:59.190
He lost his head and can still
regenerate that quickly?

1923
01:50:59.940 --> 01:51:02.070
[sword clanking]

1924
01:51:03.190 --> 01:51:05.320
[grunting]

1925
01:51:11.950 --> 01:51:14.870
[yelling]

1926
01:51:19.250 --> 01:51:21.210
-[coughs]
-[blood splatters]

1927
01:51:23.550 --> 01:51:25.920
I can't hear out of my left ear.

1928
01:51:25.970 --> 01:51:28.050
and my right hand has gone numb.

1929
01:51:29.470 --> 01:51:33.020
I can still grip my sword.
but who knows for how long.

1930
01:51:41.690 --> 01:51:42.770
Wait!

1931
01:51:43.860 --> 01:51:44.990
I...

1932
01:51:45.610 --> 01:51:48.700
I'm here. I'm still alive!

1933
01:51:49.200 --> 01:51:53.740
If you wanna kill Tanjiro.
you'll have to defeat me first!

1934
01:51:57.830 --> 01:52:00.080
[AKAZA] An indomitable spirit.

1935
01:52:00.130 --> 01:52:01.630
It will never bend.

1936
01:52:01.670 --> 01:52:04.710
no matter what crisis
it finds itself in.

1937
01:52:05.510 --> 01:52:08.180
We don't fight the way
samurai do.

1938
01:52:08.220 --> 01:52:10.260
We don't carry weapons.

1939
01:52:10.300 --> 01:52:13.430
though we carry our convictions
like swords.

1940
01:52:14.970 --> 01:52:18.270
[MAN] Though we carry
our convictions like swords.

1941
01:52:18.980 --> 01:52:23.020
our battles are waged
with our fists.

1942
01:52:24.440 --> 01:52:27.530
[AKAZA] You are such an eyesore!

1943
01:52:30.320 --> 01:52:31.700
[soft thump]

1944
01:52:38.040 --> 01:52:39.580
[GIRL] Please stop.

1945
01:52:45.800 --> 01:52:47.380
[AKAZA] Who is that?

1946
01:52:52.720 --> 01:52:54.680
Mr. Hakuji.

1947
01:52:54.720 --> 01:52:56.520
please. that's enough!

1948
01:52:56.560 --> 01:52:58.100
[♪ poignant music playing]

1949
01:52:59.640 --> 01:53:03.770
[AKAZA] Let go.
Let go of my hand.

1950
01:53:04.230 --> 01:53:05.770
Just who are you?

1951
01:53:07.570 --> 01:53:10.860
Stop. You don't
have to keep going. [sniffles]

1952
01:53:10.900 --> 01:53:13.450
Let's leave this place together.

1953
01:53:13.820 --> 01:53:15.740
[AKAZA] I can't.

1954
01:53:15.780 --> 01:53:19.120
I've still got unfinished
business with those two.

1955
01:53:20.500 --> 01:53:22.500
[GIRL]
What do you mean by that?

1956
01:53:23.080 --> 01:53:25.290
[AKAZA]
I've got to become stronger.

1957
01:53:25.340 --> 01:53:26.750
I've got to!

1958
01:53:27.250 --> 01:53:30.300
I'll kill anyone
who gets in my way.

1959
01:53:31.010 --> 01:53:33.720
Why do you want that? [sniffles]

1960
01:53:33.760 --> 01:53:36.800
For what reason
do you need to become stronger?

1961
01:53:38.350 --> 01:53:42.480
[AKAZA] Because...
unless I'm strong enough.

1962
01:53:42.520 --> 01:53:45.860
I won't be able to bring
any more back home to him.

1963
01:53:47.980 --> 01:53:50.280
He needs medicine.

1964
01:53:52.320 --> 01:53:55.160
I must become stronger.

1965
01:53:55.910 --> 01:53:57.200
[grunts angrily]

1966
01:53:57.530 --> 01:54:00.870
If I don't. I won't be able to
get away with the money I stole.

1967
01:54:02.210 --> 01:54:04.000
If I happen to be caught.

1968
01:54:04.040 --> 01:54:06.380
I won't be able
to defend myself.

1969
01:54:07.800 --> 01:54:09.550
If I'm not strong enough.

1970
01:54:09.590 --> 01:54:13.220
the magistrate will catch me
and have me beaten and lashed.

1971
01:54:13.680 --> 01:54:15.760
[whipping]

1972
01:54:16.640 --> 01:54:18.100
[MAGISTRATE]
We've already given you

1973
01:54:18.140 --> 01:54:21.020
three tattoos on each arm
for stealing.

1974
01:54:21.060 --> 01:54:23.600
Next time.
we'll chop off your hand.

1975
01:54:23.640 --> 01:54:25.190
[Hakuji chuckling]

1976
01:54:27.900 --> 01:54:29.900
[laughing]

1977
01:54:31.610 --> 01:54:33.650
[ATTENDANT]
Bow your head and repent!

1978
01:54:33.700 --> 01:54:36.030
If you're gonna chop it off.
then do it!

1979
01:54:36.070 --> 01:54:38.950
Go ahead and take both of them
if you're really serious.

1980
01:54:38.990 --> 01:54:41.160
I'll just use my feet to steal.

1981
01:54:41.200 --> 01:54:44.160
You're not gonna catch me again.
so make it count!

1982
01:54:46.630 --> 01:54:50.090
[MAGISTRATE] To hear this from
someone at such a young age.

1983
01:54:50.130 --> 01:54:52.760
This boy of 11 has already
taken on punishments

1984
01:54:52.800 --> 01:54:55.220
that would make
a grown man faint.

1985
01:54:56.470 --> 01:54:58.430
You are a demon child!

1986
01:54:58.470 --> 01:55:00.640
Go and call me
whatever names you want.

1987
01:55:00.680 --> 01:55:03.350
"Demon child" suits me
just damn fine!

1988
01:55:03.390 --> 01:55:05.640
They say I already had teeth
when I was born.

1989
01:55:05.690 --> 01:55:06.650
so I guess I am.

1990
01:55:06.690 --> 01:55:08.940
-Be quiet!
-Dirty little punk!

1991
01:55:08.980 --> 01:55:12.070
[HAKUJI] Don't you mean
"demon child." you bastard?

1992
01:55:12.110 --> 01:55:14.360
[grunts]

1993
01:55:15.820 --> 01:55:16.860
Hmph!

1994
01:55:16.900 --> 01:55:20.410
SOUTH TOWN MAGISTRATE'S OFFICE

1995
01:55:20.450 --> 01:55:21.540
[birds calling]

1996
01:55:21.580 --> 01:55:22.700
[MAN 1] Hakuji!

1997
01:55:22.750 --> 01:55:25.000
[MAN 2] Oh! [panting]
There you are!

1998
01:55:25.040 --> 01:55:27.500
[voice breaking] When you were
caught for stealing again.

1999
01:55:27.540 --> 01:55:30.750
word about it made its way
back to your father.

2000
01:55:31.290 --> 01:55:33.800
He hung himself. Hakuji!

2001
01:55:34.260 --> 01:55:35.300
Huh?

2002
01:55:38.510 --> 01:55:40.760
[Hakuji's father weakly]
"Dear Hakuji.

2003
01:55:41.890 --> 01:55:44.020
live an honest life.

2004
01:55:44.600 --> 01:55:46.810
You can still start over."

2005
01:55:47.600 --> 01:55:49.770
-[wind blowing]
-[leaves rustling]

2006
01:55:51.730 --> 01:55:52.780
[♪ poignant music continues]

2007
01:55:52.820 --> 01:55:54.030
[paper fluttering]

2008
01:55:54.070 --> 01:55:56.450
[HAKUJI]
What kind of world is this?

2009
01:55:56.490 --> 01:55:59.200
Are the poor
not even allowed to live?

2010
01:56:04.200 --> 01:56:05.370
[voice breaking] Dad.

2011
01:56:07.620 --> 01:56:09.750
To hell with this rotten world.

2012
01:56:09.790 --> 01:56:12.000
To all of it! [sobbing]

2013
01:56:14.500 --> 01:56:18.720
Every rotten human.
they can all burn in hell!

2014
01:56:18.760 --> 01:56:20.970
[grunts angrily]

2015
01:56:22.640 --> 01:56:26.060
Why do scumbags like them
get the privilege of living

2016
01:56:26.100 --> 01:56:29.350
when my father had to die
in such a horrible way?

2017
01:56:29.390 --> 01:56:31.980
He was never a burden to me.

2018
01:56:32.020 --> 01:56:34.110
So why would he feel that way?

2019
01:56:34.570 --> 01:56:37.900
You didn't do anything wrong.
Dad. You didn't!

2020
01:56:39.910 --> 01:56:42.200
I never cared
about getting beaten

2021
01:56:42.240 --> 01:56:44.120
after I was caught stealing.

2022
01:56:44.160 --> 01:56:47.960
Even if they beat me until every
bone in my body was broken.

2023
01:56:48.000 --> 01:56:50.040
I could take it all
for you. Dad.

2024
01:56:50.080 --> 01:56:51.460
For centuries even.

2025
01:56:51.500 --> 01:56:54.170
Learn your lesson!
Live an honest life!

2026
01:56:54.920 --> 01:56:57.920
[HAKUJI] Why don't you
shut the hell up. you scumbag?

2027
01:56:57.970 --> 01:56:59.930
Medicine's expensive.

2028
01:56:59.970 --> 01:57:02.640
The hell do you expect me
to do about that?

2029
01:57:04.100 --> 01:57:07.720
My dad's only getting thinner
and thinner by the day.

2030
01:57:08.810 --> 01:57:11.900
He's so malnourished.
you can see his bones.

2031
01:57:12.480 --> 01:57:15.860
I just want him to have
something better to eat.

2032
01:57:18.110 --> 01:57:20.820
I would have happily
given my life...

2033
01:57:22.740 --> 01:57:24.950
[voice breaking]
...if it meant saving his.

2034
01:57:31.080 --> 01:57:35.080
I'd have done anything...
for my father!

2035
01:57:37.960 --> 01:57:40.170
[breathing heavily]

2036
01:57:40.220 --> 01:57:43.090
-[clapping]
-Huh?

2037
01:57:43.130 --> 01:57:44.220
SORYU

2038
01:57:44.300 --> 01:57:46.350
[MAN] Well. well.
I am quite impressed.

2039
01:57:46.390 --> 01:57:48.970
I was called over
because someone said that

2040
01:57:49.020 --> 01:57:50.480
a child was about to be killed.

2041
01:57:50.520 --> 01:57:53.940
But you've laid out seven
grown-ups with your bare fists.

2042
01:57:53.980 --> 01:57:56.310
You've got some talent.
don't ya?

2043
01:57:56.360 --> 01:58:00.110
Not just anyone can take on
that many guys and still win.

2044
01:58:00.150 --> 01:58:02.780
[chuckling] That's the kind of
spunk I like to see.

2045
01:58:04.990 --> 01:58:07.120
[AKAZA] What's going on here?

2046
01:58:07.160 --> 01:58:09.160
Who is this man?

2047
01:58:10.160 --> 01:58:12.500
Could these be my memories?

2048
01:58:12.540 --> 01:58:14.540
How about you join my dojo?

2049
01:58:14.580 --> 01:58:16.790
I don't have any students
at the moment.

2050
01:58:17.250 --> 01:58:19.250
Stay out of my way.
you old fart!

2051
01:58:19.300 --> 01:58:20.760
You lookin' to die?

2052
01:58:20.800 --> 01:58:22.670
-Those tattoos.
-Uh?

2053
01:58:22.720 --> 01:58:24.340
You're a criminal from Edo.

2054
01:58:25.010 --> 01:58:26.890
I'm guessing
after being thrown out.

2055
01:58:26.930 --> 01:58:29.600
you eventually
found your way here.

2056
01:58:29.640 --> 01:58:31.640
I never asked for your opinion.

2057
01:58:31.680 --> 01:58:34.140
Now shut up
and get the hell out of my way!

2058
01:58:34.190 --> 01:58:37.770
[scoffs] All right.
Time to be reborn!

2059
01:58:38.650 --> 01:58:40.190
You ready?

2060
01:58:41.070 --> 01:58:45.410
That's it. Drop dead. old man!
[grunting]

2061
01:58:46.160 --> 01:58:47.410
[impact grunts]

2062
01:58:55.620 --> 01:58:58.090
[strained grunt. coughs. gasps]

2063
01:58:58.130 --> 01:58:59.460
[body thuds]

2064
01:59:03.130 --> 01:59:04.470
SORYU

2065
01:59:04.510 --> 01:59:06.470
[MAN] I'll give it to you.
You're tough.

2066
01:59:06.510 --> 01:59:07.470
DOJO

2067
01:59:07.510 --> 01:59:09.140
After that beating I gave you.

2068
01:59:09.180 --> 01:59:11.310
you came to
in less than an hour.

2069
01:59:12.350 --> 01:59:13.730
The name's Keizo.

2070
01:59:14.390 --> 01:59:16.310
I teach
the Soryu style of fighting

2071
01:59:16.350 --> 01:59:18.810
which uses only your bare hands.

2072
01:59:18.860 --> 01:59:21.980
Like I said. I don't have
any other students.

2073
01:59:22.480 --> 01:59:26.200
So I get by by doing whatever
odd jobs I can for people.

2074
01:59:28.780 --> 01:59:31.490
I have a daughter
who's in rather poor health.

2075
01:59:31.530 --> 01:59:33.910
I'd like you
to help look after her.

2076
01:59:34.410 --> 01:59:37.830
I'd be here if I could.
but I have to work.

2077
01:59:38.830 --> 01:59:41.290
My wife was pushed
to the edge of exhaustion

2078
01:59:41.340 --> 01:59:42.800
and drowned herself.

2079
01:59:43.800 --> 01:59:46.340
Life sure takes a bite
out of you. doesn't it?

2080
01:59:50.470 --> 01:59:52.430
If I were a more capable man.

2081
01:59:52.470 --> 01:59:55.220
my wife and daughter wouldn't
have suffered like this.

2082
01:59:58.230 --> 02:00:00.560
You said you knew
I was a criminal.

2083
02:00:00.610 --> 02:00:03.820
Are you really all right leaving
your daughter around me?

2084
02:00:05.190 --> 02:00:06.780
Why wouldn't I be?

2085
02:00:06.820 --> 02:00:09.570
I pummeled the criminal
out of you earlier. didn't I?

2086
02:00:09.610 --> 02:00:10.700
It's fine.

2087
02:00:11.570 --> 02:00:13.790
[♪ tender music playing]

2088
02:00:13.830 --> 02:00:15.950
[AKAZA] They are alike.

2089
02:00:23.590 --> 02:00:25.460
I get it now.

2090
02:00:26.760 --> 02:00:29.430
The reason
you disgusted me earlier.

2091
02:00:29.930 --> 02:00:31.140
It was because you would've

2092
02:00:31.180 --> 02:00:34.310
dredged up memories
of my worthless past.

2093
02:00:39.270 --> 02:00:41.810
[KEIZO]
This is my daughter. Koyuki.

2094
02:00:42.480 --> 02:00:43.860
[coughing]

2095
02:00:44.820 --> 02:00:47.280
[AKAZA] My worthless past.

2096
02:00:50.530 --> 02:00:51.950
Worthless.

2097
02:00:56.080 --> 02:00:58.910
[coughing]

2098
02:01:01.080 --> 02:01:04.500
Hakuji. I'm so sorry.

2099
02:01:05.380 --> 02:01:07.590
[chuckles] How are you feeling?

2100
02:01:07.630 --> 02:01:09.630
[coughing]

2101
02:01:09.670 --> 02:01:11.380
You okay being up?

2102
02:01:12.390 --> 02:01:13.430
[KOYUKI] Hmm.

2103
02:01:14.100 --> 02:01:17.390
Looks like you've got more color
in your cheeks this morning.

2104
02:01:17.430 --> 02:01:19.180
[chuckles] That's good.

2105
02:01:19.850 --> 02:01:20.940
Hmm.

2106
02:01:21.520 --> 02:01:24.770
-Huh?
-Oh. yeah. This boy.

2107
02:01:24.810 --> 02:01:26.860
His name is... [chuckles]

2108
02:01:26.900 --> 02:01:30.150
Well. I've asked him countless
times. and he won't say.

2109
02:01:30.200 --> 02:01:32.320
-Go on. get inside.
-[grunts]

2110
02:01:34.030 --> 02:01:35.240
Have a seat.

2111
02:01:37.040 --> 02:01:40.040
I wanna know his name
when I get back. Okay?

2112
02:01:51.630 --> 02:01:52.880
Um...

2113
02:01:53.340 --> 02:01:56.390
Your... Your face.

2114
02:01:56.970 --> 02:01:58.390
You're hurt.

2115
02:01:58.970 --> 02:02:00.520
Are you all right?

2116
02:02:03.770 --> 02:02:05.770
[AKAZA] "I'll make you better.

2117
02:02:05.810 --> 02:02:07.610
I'll save you.

2118
02:02:07.650 --> 02:02:09.030
Protect you."

2119
02:02:09.650 --> 02:02:14.200
In that past life. all I did
was spew a bunch of lies.

2120
02:02:14.660 --> 02:02:16.370
I was so pathetic.

2121
02:02:18.240 --> 02:02:20.700
[birds chirping]

2122
02:02:25.830 --> 02:02:28.250
[coughing]

2123
02:02:32.970 --> 02:02:34.630
Oh. thank you.

2124
02:02:36.140 --> 02:02:38.890
[HAKUJI] You don't have to
thank me every time. you know.

2125
02:02:38.930 --> 02:02:40.680
Just focus on resting.

2126
02:02:42.430 --> 02:02:46.310
I'm sorry for causing you
trouble like this.

2127
02:02:46.350 --> 02:02:48.480
It's fine. Really.

2128
02:02:50.320 --> 02:02:53.110
Koyuki. you want this closed?

2129
02:02:53.900 --> 02:02:57.320
Hmm. You can leave it open.

2130
02:02:59.240 --> 02:03:02.040
[HAKUJI] Koyuki was very
delicate and frail.

2131
02:03:03.450 --> 02:03:07.290
I would change out her towels
and nightgown and give her water

2132
02:03:07.330 --> 02:03:08.960
even throughout the night.

2133
02:03:09.540 --> 02:03:12.340
And whenever she needed
to use the lavatory.

2134
02:03:12.380 --> 02:03:14.720
obviously she was too weak
to be able to go

2135
02:03:14.760 --> 02:03:16.300
without needing assistance.

2136
02:03:20.260 --> 02:03:23.520
I was used to taking care
of the sick because of my dad.

2137
02:03:23.560 --> 02:03:27.270
and since I had an almost
inhuman physical endurance.

2138
02:03:27.310 --> 02:03:29.560
it really wasn't a big deal
for me.

2139
02:03:32.110 --> 02:03:34.530
[crows cawing]

2140
02:03:34.570 --> 02:03:37.030
Sorry to make you help me
all day.

2141
02:03:43.620 --> 02:03:46.460
[HAKUJI] Why do people
who are suffering from illness

2142
02:03:46.500 --> 02:03:48.920
always feel the need to say
they're sorry?

2143
02:03:49.790 --> 02:03:52.210
"Sorry to make you
do things for me."

2144
02:03:52.750 --> 02:03:55.340
"Sorry if my coughing's
bothering you."

2145
02:03:55.970 --> 02:03:59.090
"Sorry I can't put food
on the table like I should."

2146
02:04:01.180 --> 02:04:04.060
They didn't choose
to have to live this way.

2147
02:04:04.100 --> 02:04:06.310
Of course
they wanna breathe normally.

2148
02:04:06.350 --> 02:04:08.730
They can't help it
if they start coughing.

2149
02:04:09.980 --> 02:04:11.480
Out of everyone.

2150
02:04:11.520 --> 02:04:14.030
they're the ones
suffering the most.

2151
02:04:16.780 --> 02:04:19.240
Sorry again to make you do this.

2152
02:04:19.780 --> 02:04:21.620
Because of my sickness.

2153
02:04:21.660 --> 02:04:24.160
you're not able to do
your training.

2154
02:04:24.200 --> 02:04:26.540
or even go out and have fun.

2155
02:04:27.410 --> 02:04:29.420
[HAKUJI]
I don't care about having fun.

2156
02:04:29.460 --> 02:04:30.790
I never have.

2157
02:04:31.580 --> 02:04:34.750
As far as training goes.
I squeeze it in whenever I can.

2158
02:04:34.800 --> 02:04:36.300
so. it's fine.

2159
02:04:37.590 --> 02:04:38.670
Are you sure?

2160
02:04:39.340 --> 02:04:42.390
Even you need to take
a little break.

2161
02:04:43.220 --> 02:04:46.770
I hear there are fireworks
happening tonight.

2162
02:04:46.810 --> 02:04:48.480
You should go see them.

2163
02:04:49.810 --> 02:04:51.600
Fireworks. huh?

2164
02:04:51.650 --> 02:04:54.110
If you don't feel nauseous
at night.

2165
02:04:54.150 --> 02:04:57.650
I could carry you on my back
and go see them on the bridge.

2166
02:04:57.690 --> 02:04:58.900
Huh?

2167
02:05:02.450 --> 02:05:04.530
If you're not feeling up to it.

2168
02:05:04.580 --> 02:05:07.700
they'll do fireworks again
next year. and after that.

2169
02:05:07.750 --> 02:05:09.910
So. we can just go
when you're better.

2170
02:05:14.840 --> 02:05:16.750
[crying softly]

2171
02:05:18.510 --> 02:05:21.010
There was one thing
that was hard

2172
02:05:21.050 --> 02:05:22.510
about taking care of her.

2173
02:05:22.680 --> 02:05:25.600
And that was whenever she would
suddenly break out into tears

2174
02:05:25.640 --> 02:05:27.510
in the middle
of our conversations.

2175
02:05:28.180 --> 02:05:32.230
I can imagine how she felt.
bedridden and sick as she was.

2176
02:05:32.690 --> 02:05:35.110
but it still made me
uncomfortable.

2177
02:05:35.150 --> 02:05:36.440
[insects trilling]

2178
02:05:36.480 --> 02:05:39.030
SORYU

2179
02:05:46.740 --> 02:05:48.290
[impact grunts. wheezes]

2180
02:05:49.410 --> 02:05:52.250
[sighs] Ah. now I understand.

2181
02:05:52.790 --> 02:05:54.580
The symbol used for Hakuji.

2182
02:05:54.630 --> 02:05:56.170
it's the same as komainu.

2183
02:05:56.210 --> 02:05:58.300
[chuckles] That makes sense.

2184
02:05:58.340 --> 02:06:00.510
You and I really are the same.
after all.

2185
02:06:00.550 --> 02:06:03.760
We only thrive when we have
something to protect.

2186
02:06:03.800 --> 02:06:05.220
Just like the komainu

2187
02:06:05.260 --> 02:06:07.970
who protect the entrance
to the shrines. [chuckles]

2188
02:06:08.430 --> 02:06:10.560
[laughs heartily]

2189
02:06:11.140 --> 02:06:12.600
[♪ gentle music playing]

2190
02:06:12.810 --> 02:06:15.770
[HAKUJI] There was a story as to
how my master owned this land.

2191
02:06:15.810 --> 02:06:18.980
even though he wasn't a samurai
or anything like that.

2192
02:06:19.030 --> 02:06:22.490
He had rescued an elderly man
from a group of bandits.

2193
02:06:23.070 --> 02:06:25.280
The old man.
who had no living heirs.

2194
02:06:25.320 --> 02:06:27.570
was so impressed
by his Soryu technique

2195
02:06:27.620 --> 02:06:29.620
that he left him
not only his land.

2196
02:06:29.660 --> 02:06:31.580
but the dojo that lay upon it.

2197
02:06:34.750 --> 02:06:37.880
However. there were those
with envious eyes

2198
02:06:37.920 --> 02:06:40.920
who wished to have the land
and dojo all to themselves.

2199
02:06:41.590 --> 02:06:44.050
The Kenjutsu Dojo next door

2200
02:06:44.090 --> 02:06:46.840
started harassing
the Soryu Dojo.

2201
02:06:48.600 --> 02:06:51.680
Because of that.
the Soryu Dojo had a hard time

2202
02:06:51.720 --> 02:06:53.140
keeping any students.

2203
02:07:00.570 --> 02:07:05.450
But now. thanks to my training
here and caring for Koyuki...

2204
02:07:06.700 --> 02:07:09.870
...my heart has finally
found salvation.

2205
02:07:10.910 --> 02:07:13.080
[effort grunting]

2206
02:07:23.420 --> 02:07:25.470
[chuckles]

2207
02:07:29.010 --> 02:07:32.930
Three short years went by
and I turned 18.

2208
02:07:34.060 --> 02:07:35.680
Koyuki was 16.

2209
02:07:36.140 --> 02:07:38.850
She was almost never
bedridden anymore

2210
02:07:38.900 --> 02:07:41.400
and was now able
to live a normal life.

2211
02:07:42.570 --> 02:07:44.030
[chuckles]

2212
02:07:44.610 --> 02:07:45.860
[birds chirping]

2213
02:07:45.900 --> 02:07:47.860
Hakuji! Come here.

2214
02:07:48.620 --> 02:07:49.660
Yes. sir.

2215
02:07:50.120 --> 02:07:51.580
[insects trilling]

2216
02:07:51.620 --> 02:07:52.910
This dojo.

2217
02:07:53.040 --> 02:07:56.000
would you be willing
to take it over for me. Hakuji?

2218
02:07:56.710 --> 02:08:00.040
Koyuki's told me that
she's quite fond of you as well.

2219
02:08:01.000 --> 02:08:02.300
[exclaims in surprise]

2220
02:08:09.840 --> 02:08:12.970
[HAKUJI] As someone branded
with the tattoos of a criminal.

2221
02:08:13.010 --> 02:08:16.480
picturing any kind of future
for myself was hard enough.

2222
02:08:17.810 --> 02:08:22.150
But a future in which someone
could like a person like me?

2223
02:08:22.190 --> 02:08:24.230
I couldn't have even dreamed it.

2224
02:08:26.190 --> 02:08:28.820
My dad asked me
to lead an honest life.

2225
02:08:28.860 --> 02:08:30.950
something I never thought
was possible.

2226
02:08:31.450 --> 02:08:33.700
But perhaps it really is.

2227
02:08:35.160 --> 02:08:37.830
The faint hope
of being able to start over

2228
02:08:37.870 --> 02:08:40.080
began to swell within me

2229
02:08:40.120 --> 02:08:42.920
until it felt like
it was about to burst.

2230
02:08:48.010 --> 02:08:49.470
[♪ tender music playing]

2231
02:08:49.510 --> 02:08:52.140
But I could never have predicted
in that moment

2232
02:08:52.180 --> 02:08:54.140
that the two people
I wanted to protect

2233
02:08:54.180 --> 02:08:56.520
more than anything else
in this life...

2234
02:08:57.520 --> 02:09:00.060
...would end up
meeting the fate they did.

2235
02:09:04.980 --> 02:09:08.240
I had made a trip to Edo
to visit my dad's grave.

2236
02:09:09.030 --> 02:09:12.110
I wanted to let him know
that I was getting married.

2237
02:09:21.920 --> 02:09:25.750
I returned before even a full
day and night had passed.

2238
02:09:28.670 --> 02:09:31.550
Yet a sense of dread
came over me.

2239
02:09:32.550 --> 02:09:35.010
My chest started to feel tight

2240
02:09:35.050 --> 02:09:38.180
and a terrible feeling of nausea
overtook me.

2241
02:09:38.890 --> 02:09:40.230
[retches]

2242
02:09:40.690 --> 02:09:43.190
[MAN] Someone put poison
in the well!

2243
02:09:44.020 --> 02:09:45.570
[voice breaking]
The other school was so angry

2244
02:09:45.610 --> 02:09:47.530
they couldn't beat you
or Mr. Keizo.

2245
02:09:47.570 --> 02:09:49.780
they went and did this
out of spite!

2246
02:09:49.820 --> 02:09:52.360
It's atrocious. Unthinkable!

2247
02:09:52.410 --> 02:09:54.450
They even killed Koyuki!

2248
02:09:57.870 --> 02:09:59.290
[HAKUJI] Why?

2249
02:09:59.500 --> 02:10:02.960
Why is it whenever the ones I
care about are in mortal peril.

2250
02:10:03.000 --> 02:10:05.250
I'm never there for them?

2251
02:10:10.630 --> 02:10:11.970
[fireworks bursting in distance]

2252
02:10:12.590 --> 02:10:14.090
[crickets chirping]

2253
02:10:14.140 --> 02:10:17.220
I had even gone
and made a promise to her.

2254
02:10:19.310 --> 02:10:21.930
Are you sure
that I'm the one for you?

2255
02:10:24.020 --> 02:10:25.610
When we were children.

2256
02:10:26.060 --> 02:10:28.570
do you remember
when you talked to me

2257
02:10:28.610 --> 02:10:30.570
about seeing the fireworks?

2258
02:10:31.190 --> 02:10:35.530
-Huh? Uh... no. not really.
-[giggles softly]

2259
02:10:36.780 --> 02:10:39.490
Because of those little talks
we used to have.

2260
02:10:39.540 --> 02:10:42.200
there were a lot of things
which I took with me

2261
02:10:42.250 --> 02:10:44.330
that gave me hope
for the future.

2262
02:10:45.540 --> 02:10:49.000
You said even if we couldn't see
the fireworks that year.

2263
02:10:49.040 --> 02:10:52.510
we could go to the one
happening next year.

2264
02:10:52.550 --> 02:10:54.260
or the year after that.

2265
02:10:54.970 --> 02:10:58.220
The truth is.
I could never imagine a future

2266
02:10:58.260 --> 02:11:00.640
where I'd still be alive
a year later.

2267
02:11:00.680 --> 02:11:03.480
and certainly not
any longer than that.

2268
02:11:04.640 --> 02:11:06.810
My mother couldn't either.

2269
02:11:06.850 --> 02:11:09.980
I think that's why she ended up
taking her own life.

2270
02:11:10.480 --> 02:11:12.940
'cause she didn't
want to see me die.

2271
02:11:12.990 --> 02:11:14.780
Not just her.

2272
02:11:14.820 --> 02:11:17.660
I could tell my father
had given up hope. too.

2273
02:11:17.700 --> 02:11:19.450
deep down inside.

2274
02:11:20.580 --> 02:11:22.910
Because I was just so weak.

2275
02:11:24.250 --> 02:11:26.830
But you never treated me
that way.

2276
02:11:26.870 --> 02:11:29.540
You were able to see
a future for me.

2277
02:11:30.380 --> 02:11:33.880
You talked to me about
doing things as if...

2278
02:11:33.920 --> 02:11:37.010
As if it were obvious
that I'd still be here.

2279
02:11:37.050 --> 02:11:40.300
[crying softly]
That made me so very happy.

2280
02:11:51.650 --> 02:11:54.740
So. yes. I am sure
you're the one for me.

2281
02:11:56.780 --> 02:11:58.160
Would you...

2282
02:11:58.700 --> 02:12:00.830
Would you be my husband?

2283
02:12:01.240 --> 02:12:02.540
[distant explosion]

2284
02:12:07.830 --> 02:12:08.920
[fireworks bursting]

2285
02:12:08.960 --> 02:12:10.040
Yes.

2286
02:12:10.670 --> 02:12:13.300
I promise to become stronger
than anyone.

2287
02:12:13.920 --> 02:12:16.470
and protect you
for the rest of my life.

2288
02:12:17.840 --> 02:12:19.090
[exclaims]

2289
02:12:20.930 --> 02:12:24.270
[HAKUJI]
In the end. I was all talk.

2290
02:12:24.770 --> 02:12:27.890
I wasn't able to fulfill
any of my promises.

2291
02:12:28.440 --> 02:12:29.810
[chuckles]

2292
02:12:35.480 --> 02:12:37.650
[♪ foreboding music playing]

2293
02:12:40.450 --> 02:12:43.120
What do you want? [gasps]

2294
02:12:43.660 --> 02:12:45.370
You've got some nerve.

2295
02:12:45.410 --> 02:12:48.210
Wait. You're from the Soryu--

2296
02:12:49.080 --> 02:12:50.880
[screaming]

2297
02:12:50.920 --> 02:12:52.540
[♪ somber music playing]

2298
02:12:56.510 --> 02:12:57.840
[man grunts]

2299
02:13:01.390 --> 02:13:04.350
[Hakuji grunts. yells]

2300
02:13:04.390 --> 02:13:06.390
[groans angrily]

2301
02:13:11.560 --> 02:13:14.650
The family. the Soryu Dojo.
were recently poisoned.

2302
02:13:14.690 --> 02:13:16.980
And we believe
that a student of theirs

2303
02:13:17.030 --> 02:13:19.740
retaliated against
the Kenjutsu Dojo.

2304
02:13:19.780 --> 02:13:22.570
Sixty-seven people
were murdered inside.

2305
02:13:22.620 --> 02:13:25.280
He shattered their skulls
and crushed their organs.

2306
02:13:25.330 --> 02:13:26.740
all barehanded.

2307
02:13:27.290 --> 02:13:28.750
Not only were most of the bodies

2308
02:13:28.790 --> 02:13:31.290
mangled and mutilated
beyond recognition.

2309
02:13:31.330 --> 02:13:34.590
most had limbs missing
that we couldn't even locate.

2310
02:13:34.630 --> 02:13:36.960
Organs. limbs. brain matter.

2311
02:13:37.000 --> 02:13:39.050
even jaws and eyeballs
were found

2312
02:13:39.090 --> 02:13:42.220
strewn across the walls
and the ceiling of the premises.

2313
02:13:43.010 --> 02:13:46.050
This killer
was no ordinary human.

2314
02:13:47.430 --> 02:13:49.730
[wet squelching]

2315
02:13:51.100 --> 02:13:54.230
[breathing shakily]

2316
02:14:09.290 --> 02:14:11.410
[MUZAN] I heard
there was some commotion

2317
02:14:11.460 --> 02:14:13.330
about a demon sighting here.

2318
02:14:13.370 --> 02:14:15.880
even though I know
I never sent one.

2319
02:14:16.420 --> 02:14:19.300
So. I decided to come
see for myself.

2320
02:14:19.340 --> 02:14:21.510
Yet all I find is a human.

2321
02:14:22.090 --> 02:14:24.300
How utterly disappointing.

2322
02:14:25.390 --> 02:14:28.510
[HAKUJI] Move. or I'll kill you!

2323
02:14:29.680 --> 02:14:32.020
-[thuds]
-[splatters]

2324
02:14:33.440 --> 02:14:34.770
It just so happens

2325
02:14:34.810 --> 02:14:38.440
I was contemplating
creating 12 powerful demons.

2326
02:14:39.030 --> 02:14:41.280
I wonder if you'll be
able to withstand

2327
02:14:41.320 --> 02:14:43.820
the amount of blood
I'm about to give you.

2328
02:14:45.820 --> 02:14:48.030
You... [grunts]

2329
02:14:49.410 --> 02:14:53.040
...do whatever you want.

2330
02:14:53.920 --> 02:14:56.670
None of it matters.

2331
02:15:02.550 --> 02:15:04.590
[thunder rumbling]

2332
02:15:04.630 --> 02:15:06.760
[♪ somber music playing]

2333
02:15:07.550 --> 02:15:09.680
[grunting]

2334
02:15:11.220 --> 02:15:14.270
[AKAZA] After becoming a demon.
I lost my memories...

2335
02:15:14.850 --> 02:15:17.940
and once again.
started to seek out power.

2336
02:15:18.400 --> 02:15:19.730
-[thuds]
-[grunts]

2337
02:15:19.770 --> 02:15:21.110
-[flesh squelches]
-[grunts]

2338
02:15:27.990 --> 02:15:29.450
[clangs]

2339
02:15:30.330 --> 02:15:32.080
-[wet squelching]
-[sword clatters]

2340
02:15:33.200 --> 02:15:34.870
It's not enough!

2341
02:15:34.910 --> 02:15:36.750
It will never be enough!

2342
02:15:36.790 --> 02:15:38.670
[thunderclap]

2343
02:15:40.750 --> 02:15:44.010
Even though I had nothing
left to my name.

2344
02:15:44.050 --> 02:15:47.300
Even though I had nothing
worth fighting for anymore.

2345
02:15:49.550 --> 02:15:52.680
Even though my family
was no longer around

2346
02:15:52.720 --> 02:15:56.640
and I had no desire
to live in a world without them.

2347
02:15:59.190 --> 02:16:02.610
For over a century.
I committed senseless massacres

2348
02:16:02.650 --> 02:16:04.490
over and over again.

2349
02:16:05.400 --> 02:16:08.610
Thinking about it now.
it's pathetic.

2350
02:16:08.660 --> 02:16:10.320
It's absurd.

2351
02:16:11.200 --> 02:16:13.950
All those deaths
were meaningless.

2352
02:16:19.370 --> 02:16:21.460
Even if I died now.

2353
02:16:21.500 --> 02:16:25.010
I couldn't go where the other
three were waiting for me.

2354
02:16:26.170 --> 02:16:31.100
Damn you for dredging up
these memories. You bastard!

2355
02:16:32.970 --> 02:16:34.890
Pathetic humans.

2356
02:16:34.930 --> 02:16:38.270
clinging on to life
with their fragile bodies!

2357
02:16:39.390 --> 02:16:43.150
Even their strongest
eventually die

2358
02:16:43.190 --> 02:16:45.530
and vanish into thin air!

2359
02:16:46.150 --> 02:16:48.240
[flesh squelching]

2360
02:16:48.860 --> 02:16:50.700
[GIYU] He's still not dead?

2361
02:16:50.740 --> 02:16:52.570
You can't be serious.

2362
02:16:53.740 --> 02:16:56.450
I have to kill him
before it's too late.

2363
02:16:57.450 --> 02:17:01.630
If we let him regenerate.
there will be no stopping him.

2364
02:17:03.340 --> 02:17:04.750
-[loud thump]
-[gasps]

2365
02:17:06.710 --> 02:17:08.920
[grunts] I must have passed out.

2366
02:17:08.970 --> 02:17:10.430
What's going on?

2367
02:17:12.140 --> 02:17:16.100
His head's back!
But how is that even possible?!

2368
02:17:17.270 --> 02:17:19.350
I decapitated him!

2369
02:17:20.020 --> 02:17:22.190
[♪ intense music playing]

2370
02:17:25.480 --> 02:17:28.400
Destructive Death:
Annihilation Type.

2371
02:17:29.110 --> 02:17:31.280
Stop it!

2372
02:17:31.320 --> 02:17:34.030
[AKAZA] Seriously?
He can still move?

2373
02:17:34.080 --> 02:17:36.740
[TANJIRO] Mr. Giyu and I
are going to win!

2374
02:17:36.790 --> 02:17:40.710
Akaza. I'll behead you
as many times as it takes!

2375
02:17:43.580 --> 02:17:45.090
My sword!

2376
02:17:46.380 --> 02:17:48.800
[GIYU] It slipped
out of his hands.

2377
02:17:49.800 --> 02:17:51.430
[TANJIRO] I lost my grip.

2378
02:17:53.720 --> 02:17:54.970
[effort grunts]

2379
02:18:00.560 --> 02:18:02.390
[KEIZO] All right. young man.

2380
02:18:03.150 --> 02:18:04.860
Time to be reborn.

2381
02:18:06.980 --> 02:18:09.820
[AKAZA] I despise
those who are weak.

2382
02:18:11.900 --> 02:18:16.030
Weaklings... Instead of
fighting you fair and square.

2383
02:18:16.080 --> 02:18:18.620
they always resort
to cheap tricks.

2384
02:18:19.410 --> 02:18:21.210
They're atrocious.

2385
02:18:21.710 --> 02:18:23.830
They have no patience.

2386
02:18:23.870 --> 02:18:26.130
And they quickly grow desperate.

2387
02:18:26.170 --> 02:18:28.750
Just thinking about them
makes me sick.

2388
02:18:30.800 --> 02:18:34.470
I killed people
with my fists for protection.

2389
02:18:35.010 --> 02:18:38.720
I desecrated my master's
beloved Soryu with blood.

2390
02:18:40.020 --> 02:18:43.140
And I couldn't follow
my father's last wishes!

2391
02:18:45.560 --> 02:18:47.110
That's right.

2392
02:18:47.650 --> 02:18:50.070
The one I wanted to kill...

2393
02:18:51.780 --> 02:18:53.280
[clatters]

2394
02:18:55.530 --> 02:18:58.240
[TANJIRO] This couldn't be
worse. I dropped my sword!

2395
02:18:58.280 --> 02:19:00.080
[♪ foreboding music playing]

2396
02:19:00.120 --> 02:19:02.660
My fists aren't enough
to stop him!

2397
02:19:13.090 --> 02:19:15.590
He's about to unleash
the Annihilation Type move

2398
02:19:15.630 --> 02:19:17.470
he used on Mr. Rengoku!

2399
02:19:20.640 --> 02:19:23.850
I've got to take Mr. Giyu
with me out of the attack range!

2400
02:19:28.060 --> 02:19:30.690
[GIYU] Leave me! Save yourself!

2401
02:19:36.280 --> 02:19:38.320
[AKAZA] I've got to kill...

2402
02:19:40.780 --> 02:19:42.410
...that weakling

2403
02:19:42.870 --> 02:19:45.040
I've come to hate!

2404
02:20:03.720 --> 02:20:05.890
[♪ dramatic music playing]

2405
02:20:11.360 --> 02:20:12.980
[thudding]

2406
02:20:15.900 --> 02:20:18.030
[grunts. gasps]

2407
02:20:18.610 --> 02:20:20.740
[flesh squelching]

2408
02:20:24.870 --> 02:20:25.910
[blood spurts]

2409
02:20:27.960 --> 02:20:30.380
[TANJIRO]
He just attacked himself.

2410
02:20:33.130 --> 02:20:35.460
Why would he turn on himself
like that?

2411
02:20:36.380 --> 02:20:37.550
Why?

2412
02:20:39.130 --> 02:20:40.970
[♪ melancholic music playing]

2413
02:20:41.010 --> 02:20:42.390
For a second.

2414
02:20:42.430 --> 02:20:45.520
I could pick up the scent
of gratitude from him.

2415
02:20:46.770 --> 02:20:48.980
Why did he smile at me?

2416
02:20:52.770 --> 02:20:55.400
[AKAZA] That's enough! Stop it!

2417
02:20:55.440 --> 02:20:57.860
I don't want to regenerate!

2418
02:20:58.440 --> 02:21:00.280
Don't you get it?

2419
02:21:00.320 --> 02:21:02.160
The battle is over!

2420
02:21:04.120 --> 02:21:07.410
In that decisive moment. I lost.

2421
02:21:07.450 --> 02:21:09.750
That technique
he beheaded me with

2422
02:21:09.790 --> 02:21:11.960
was nothing short of perfection.

2423
02:21:13.210 --> 02:21:17.630
He anticipated my movements
and pivoted at the last second.

2424
02:21:17.670 --> 02:21:21.180
then struck me down before
I could unleash my attack.

2425
02:21:22.090 --> 02:21:23.930
It's over now.

2426
02:21:24.640 --> 02:21:29.230
Let me accept my fate
and go to hell.

2427
02:21:32.400 --> 02:21:34.360
[TANJIRO]
Where's he trying to go?

2428
02:21:40.570 --> 02:21:43.570
[gasps softly]
He stopped in his tracks.

2429
02:21:46.490 --> 02:21:47.790
[HAKUJI] Dad.

2430
02:21:49.660 --> 02:21:51.580
Are you feeling better now?

2431
02:21:52.120 --> 02:21:54.130
Are you in pain anymore?

2432
02:21:55.380 --> 02:21:58.010
No need to worry. son. I'm fine.

2433
02:21:58.800 --> 02:22:00.840
Thank you. Hakuji.

2434
02:22:07.260 --> 02:22:09.020
I'm sorry. Father.

2435
02:22:09.520 --> 02:22:12.890
I'm sorry I couldn't start over
like you wanted.

2436
02:22:12.940 --> 02:22:14.650
I failed you.

2437
02:22:17.690 --> 02:22:19.650
[KEIZO] Do not despair.

2438
02:22:20.240 --> 02:22:22.490
Regardless of
who you grow up to be.

2439
02:22:22.530 --> 02:22:26.070
you're still my son
and still my student.

2440
02:22:26.120 --> 02:22:28.330
Heaven may not accept you...

2441
02:22:29.660 --> 02:22:31.290
...but you needn't worry.

2442
02:22:31.330 --> 02:22:33.420
Our hearts will be with you.

2443
02:22:35.710 --> 02:22:37.210
Master.

2444
02:22:38.420 --> 02:22:39.550
[gasps]

2445
02:22:40.090 --> 02:22:43.720
Didn't you say you were seeking
to become stronger than anyone?

2446
02:22:43.760 --> 02:22:48.720
Don't tell me you intend
to let it end like this. Akaza.

2447
02:22:50.680 --> 02:22:54.060
[AKAZA] That's right.
I can't die here.

2448
02:22:54.100 --> 02:22:56.150
I have to get stronger!

2449
02:22:57.440 --> 02:22:59.320
So what if I got beheaded?

2450
02:22:59.360 --> 02:23:02.070
Who cares
if I win or lose the fight?

2451
02:23:02.780 --> 02:23:05.410
If I kill those
who stand in my way...

2452
02:23:06.200 --> 02:23:09.160
then there's still hope
for me to get stronger!

2453
02:23:11.620 --> 02:23:13.080
I made a promise!

2454
02:23:13.120 --> 02:23:15.120
I'm not about to break it!

2455
02:23:21.000 --> 02:23:23.340
[breathing shakily]

2456
02:23:24.380 --> 02:23:25.510
[♪ tender music playing]

2457
02:23:25.550 --> 02:23:27.260
Mr. Hakuji.

2458
02:23:27.970 --> 02:23:29.800
thank you so much.

2459
02:23:30.310 --> 02:23:32.220
You've done more than enough.

2460
02:23:36.560 --> 02:23:37.980
It's okay.

2461
02:23:38.480 --> 02:23:40.190
We're all right now.

2462
02:23:40.230 --> 02:23:41.820
Akaza!

2463
02:23:41.860 --> 02:23:43.990
[♪ epic cinematic music playing]

2464
02:23:47.610 --> 02:23:50.490
[wailing]

2465
02:23:51.830 --> 02:23:53.200
Sorry!

2466
02:23:53.250 --> 02:23:55.960
I'm sorry
I couldn't protect you!

2467
02:23:56.580 --> 02:23:59.920
I wasn't there
when you needed me to be!

2468
02:24:00.540 --> 02:24:03.710
I couldn't keep
a single promise I made.

2469
02:24:03.760 --> 02:24:07.630
I'm sorry. [sobbing] Please
try to forgive me. Koyuki.

2470
02:24:07.680 --> 02:24:11.010
I'm so sorry.
[continues sobbing]

2471
02:24:13.930 --> 02:24:16.390
I'm so happy you remembered us.

2472
02:24:16.440 --> 02:24:19.150
I can't tell you
how happy that makes me.

2473
02:24:19.810 --> 02:24:23.070
And to see you now
as the man that I once knew.

2474
02:24:23.110 --> 02:24:24.900
I'm so grateful.

2475
02:24:33.160 --> 02:24:36.120
Welcome home. Hakuji.

2476
02:24:40.460 --> 02:24:42.250
Hey. Hakuji.

2477
02:24:42.630 --> 02:24:44.000
Welcome home.

2478
02:24:52.720 --> 02:24:54.350
[HAKUJI] I'm back now.

2479
02:24:54.890 --> 02:24:57.140
I'm finally back home.

2480
02:25:00.440 --> 02:25:02.190
Welcome back home...

2481
02:25:03.190 --> 02:25:04.690
...my darling.

2482
02:25:08.990 --> 02:25:10.110
[gasps softly]

2483
02:25:11.320 --> 02:25:13.490
[♪ gentle music playing]

2484
02:25:32.340 --> 02:25:34.050
[Tanjiro breathing shakily]

2485
02:25:34.100 --> 02:25:35.640
He vanished.

2486
02:25:38.600 --> 02:25:39.930
[gasps]

2487
02:25:41.140 --> 02:25:42.690
[inhales deeply]

2488
02:25:43.650 --> 02:25:45.150
[exhales sharply]

2489
02:25:47.030 --> 02:25:49.240
It's over. Right?

2490
02:25:53.370 --> 02:25:54.740
Gotta hurry...

2491
02:25:55.740 --> 02:25:59.200
...and get to where
Ms. Tamayo is.

2492
02:26:00.160 --> 02:26:01.370
And then...

2493
02:26:08.340 --> 02:26:10.380
[grunts weakly] Tanjiro.

2494
02:26:16.350 --> 02:26:17.470
[exhales]

2495
02:26:19.730 --> 02:26:22.640
[Kasugai Crow cawing]

2496
02:26:23.480 --> 02:26:28.320
Tanjiro! Giyu!
Have defeated Upper Three!

2497
02:26:28.360 --> 02:26:32.320
They are unable to stay
conscious due to exhaustion!

2498
02:26:32.360 --> 02:26:33.950
They've passed out!

2499
02:26:39.330 --> 02:26:45.250
Tanjiro! Giyu!
Have defeated Upper Three!

2500
02:26:45.290 --> 02:26:47.090
Upper Three!

2501
02:26:51.760 --> 02:26:53.170
[♪ haunting
choral music playing]

2502
02:26:53.220 --> 02:26:55.180
[KOKUSHIBO] Akaza!

2503
02:26:55.220 --> 02:26:58.050
His presence has vanished.

2504
02:26:59.970 --> 02:27:02.730
What a baffling conclusion.

2505
02:27:05.690 --> 02:27:07.150
Akaza...

2506
02:27:08.520 --> 02:27:12.690
...what happened to your burning
ambition to defeat me?

2507
02:27:14.610 --> 02:27:19.030
To think you'd abandoned
everything you stood for...

2508
02:27:20.160 --> 02:27:23.960
...and turned your back
on the path to greatness.

2509
02:27:24.790 --> 02:27:26.580
[♪ music intensifies]

2510
02:27:30.670 --> 02:27:33.720
Your weakness appalls me.

2511
02:27:38.840 --> 02:27:39.970
Huh?

2512
02:27:40.970 --> 02:27:42.180
[exclaims]

2513
02:27:42.560 --> 02:27:43.730
This feeling.

2514
02:27:44.270 --> 02:27:46.810
Could Lord Akaza be dead?

2515
02:27:48.270 --> 02:27:49.610
Very strange.

2516
02:27:49.650 --> 02:27:53.190
Surely my imagination
must be running wild. right?

2517
02:27:53.690 --> 02:27:58.530
It almost felt like Lord Akaza
had turned into some creature.

2518
02:28:01.030 --> 02:28:03.790
But now that he's dead.
I guess it doesn't matter.

2519
02:28:03.830 --> 02:28:05.960
-[laughs]
-[rattling]

2520
02:28:07.000 --> 02:28:08.790
Let's see.

2521
02:28:08.830 --> 02:28:10.210
where was I?

2522
02:28:10.790 --> 02:28:12.960
Oh. I remember.

2523
02:28:13.420 --> 02:28:16.170
I had just asked for your name.
hadn't I?

2524
02:28:17.300 --> 02:28:19.090
[Kanao breathing shakily]

2525
02:28:29.060 --> 02:28:31.520
[KASUGAI CROW] Tanjiro! Giyu!

2526
02:28:31.570 --> 02:28:33.980
Have defeated Upper Three!

2527
02:28:34.030 --> 02:28:35.530
Upper Three!

2528
02:28:36.190 --> 02:28:37.450
Did you hear that?

2529
02:28:37.490 --> 02:28:40.910
Yes. Excellent work. Tomioka.

2530
02:28:41.450 --> 02:28:43.580
Excellent work. Kamado.

2531
02:28:44.290 --> 02:28:46.500
[♪ closing theme song playing]

2532
02:28:48.670 --> 02:28:52.170
Mr. Tomioka and Tanjiro.
They did it!

2533
02:28:52.210 --> 02:28:54.920
[IGURO] Now it's our turn
to follow their lead.

2534
02:28:55.460 --> 02:28:56.800
Right!

2535
02:29:04.180 --> 02:29:05.430
[demon snarling]

2536
02:29:11.230 --> 02:29:13.610
Hang in there. Agatsuma!

2537
02:29:17.610 --> 02:29:18.990
[cawing]

2538
02:29:19.030 --> 02:29:21.030
[INOSUKE] Start flapping
those wings faster.

2539
02:29:21.070 --> 02:29:22.620
or I'm gonna keep poking!

2540
02:29:23.160 --> 02:29:24.580
You're gonna use those wings

2541
02:29:24.620 --> 02:29:26.540
to show me where
the strongest demon is!

2542
02:29:26.580 --> 02:29:27.870
You hear me?

2543
02:29:28.370 --> 02:29:30.580
I'm coming through!

2544
02:29:31.080 --> 02:29:32.250
Hyah!

2545
02:29:32.290 --> 02:29:33.750
Now we're talkin'!

2546
02:29:33.790 --> 02:29:36.550
I'm sensing a powerful
demon over here.

2547
02:29:36.590 --> 02:29:38.170
[cawing]

2548
02:29:43.430 --> 02:29:45.390
Where is Big Brother?

2549
02:29:55.480 --> 02:29:57.480
Where are all the Upper Ranks?

2550
02:29:57.530 --> 02:29:59.740
Tell me! Come on!

2551
02:30:00.240 --> 02:30:02.950
I'm gonna bury you all!

2552
02:30:10.790 --> 02:30:12.670
[KANATA] The passageway
leading north

2553
02:30:12.710 --> 02:30:14.580
on the 88th level is clear.

2554
02:30:14.630 --> 02:30:16.290
No sign of Muzan.

2555
02:30:16.960 --> 02:30:18.800
[KUINA]
The 100th and 27th levels

2556
02:30:18.840 --> 02:30:21.470
in the southeast are clear.
No sign of Muzan.

2557
02:30:22.470 --> 02:30:24.140
He's in here.

2558
02:30:24.180 --> 02:30:25.510
He has to be.

2559
02:30:25.550 --> 02:30:26.760
But where is he?

2560
02:30:27.680 --> 02:30:29.930
[KANATA] There's no sign
of Muzan on any of the levels

2561
02:30:29.980 --> 02:30:32.390
from 90 to 100. either.

2562
02:30:34.150 --> 02:30:37.150
[KUINA] Covering the entire
100th and 33rd levels.

2563
02:30:37.190 --> 02:30:38.730
No sign of Muzan.

2564
02:30:40.230 --> 02:30:42.450
Our crows will find you.

2565
02:30:42.490 --> 02:30:45.240
You can only hide from us
for so long.

2566
02:30:45.780 --> 02:30:49.030
We'll search every inch
of this Infinity Castle.

2567
02:30:49.080 --> 02:30:53.160
Even if you try to run from us.
we will hunt you down.

2568
02:30:53.620 --> 02:30:55.250
[plucking]

2569
02:30:57.250 --> 02:30:58.670
FOUR

2570
02:30:59.250 --> 02:31:01.420
[continues plucking
biwa strings]

2571
02:31:07.760 --> 02:31:10.850
Multi-layered structures
are headed northeast.

2572
02:31:11.350 --> 02:31:14.980
Attention! The castle's
expanding in every direction.

2573
02:31:15.020 --> 02:31:16.770
Folding over themselves!

2574
02:31:16.810 --> 02:31:20.070
[Nakime plucking
biwa strings faster]

2575
02:31:20.820 --> 02:31:22.570
[BOTH] And becoming one!

2576
02:31:28.320 --> 02:31:30.910
[gasps] You can't be serious.

2577
02:31:32.040 --> 02:31:33.450
No.

2578
02:31:33.500 --> 02:31:34.660
It's fine.

2579
02:31:34.710 --> 02:31:36.710
We've come too far to lose.

2580
02:31:37.460 --> 02:31:39.460
Crows. push forward.

2581
02:31:39.500 --> 02:31:41.460
and find Muzan!

2582
02:31:46.220 --> 02:31:49.350
[MUZAN] Try all you want.
Demon Slayers!

2583
02:31:49.390 --> 02:31:51.510
But each one of you
will meet your end

2584
02:31:51.560 --> 02:31:53.140
before ever reaching me!

2585
02:31:53.680 --> 02:31:57.480
You may be feeling smug after
beheading one of my Upper Ranks.

2586
02:31:57.520 --> 02:32:01.570
but unless you could kill me.
your triumph is meaningless!

2587
02:32:02.400 --> 02:32:05.530
[laughs maliciously]

2588
02:32:05.570 --> 02:32:08.280
You're all going to die
the most pointless deaths

2589
02:32:08.320 --> 02:32:11.240
all the while
never seeing my face!

2590
02:32:11.280 --> 02:32:15.540
I can't think of a more fitting
end for the Demon Slayer Corps.

2591
02:32:16.040 --> 02:32:18.500
Mark my words.
When I'm done here.

2592
02:32:18.540 --> 02:32:21.340
I'm going to make you regret
the day you were born!

2593
02:32:22.420 --> 02:32:23.710
Just wait.

2594
02:32:23.760 --> 02:32:26.930
You're each going to squirm
and writhe in pain.

2595
02:32:26.970 --> 02:32:28.840
Draw your final breaths

2596
02:32:28.890 --> 02:32:31.970
because for every one
of you Demon Slayers.

2597
02:32:32.010 --> 02:32:35.560
there is no tomorrow!

2598
02:32:45.650 --> 02:32:47.190
[KASUGAI CROW 1] Please. Giyu.

2599
02:32:50.700 --> 02:32:52.660
Don't die!

2600
02:32:59.620 --> 02:33:03.460
[KASUGAI CROW 2] We can't
have you dying on us. Tanjiro.

2601
02:33:15.850 --> 02:33:18.100
[music ends]

2602
02:33:18.140 --> 02:33:20.310
[♪ closing theme song playing]

2602
02:33:21.305 --> 02:34:21.356
